window.AKK_HAPPY_CEO_AGREEMENT_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_HAPPY_CEO_AGREEMENT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: All the Ugly Pictures","paragraphs":["\"I...I'm so confused now...\"","\"Don't rush to make a decision. Anyway, ask yourself and think about whether you'll regret doing this or not.\"","After all, Shen Tang was going to be her sister-in-law in the future, and they had been gaming buddies for so long, so she didn't want to see Miao Miao regret it or it be awkward between them in the future.","She played another round with Miao Miao. Miao Miao probably wasn't in the mood to play games and kept getting caught in a bad state. Shen Tang invited her to play again next time.","On the other hand, Miao Miao, or rather Gu Yun'an, was feeling confused in her heart.","She had just exited the game and saw that Lian Sister had sent her a message, but she didn't see it because of the do not disturb setting while gaming.","Gu Yun'an opened the message, and sure enough, Lian Sister was expressing how painful she was.","[Lian Sister: Yun'an, please, I'll just try this one last time. If it doesn't work out I'll give up, okay?]","Gu Yun'an didn't reply to the message for a long time.","Until late at night she learned that Zhou Qinglian had attempted suicide by overdosing on pills.","Fortunately she was rushed to the hospital in time and saved.","Gu Yun'an felt it was all because of her, because she hadn't agreed for so long, so Lian Sister did something foolish.","When she arrived at the hospital, she stood hesitantly outside the ward, not daring to go in.","Through the window, she could see Lian Sister's face pale as a sheet without a hint of color.","Gu Yun'an blamed herself more and more.","A girl came out, having said something to the person inside, and said impatiently, \"What did you come here for? To see if Lian Sister is dead or not?\"","Gu Yun'an staggered back two steps and shook her head, saying, \"I didn't...\"","\"If it weren't for you, how could Lian Sister--!\"","\"Cough, cough, cough!\"","A heart-wrenching cough came from inside the room, and the girl hurried back in.","Zhou Qinglian looked towards the door and smiled bitterly, \"Yun'an, you're here, why don't you come in? Don't worry, it wasn't because of you, I just...\"","She choked up, probably when mentioning something sad.","The girl glared fiercely at Gu Yun'an, and hurried to comfort Zhou Qinglian.","Gu Yun'an was at a loss for what to do. She didn't quite understand how things had developed this way.","She had only refused to help Lian Sister interfere in other people's relationships. How did that make her almost a murderer?","After a long time Zhou Qinglian finally calmed down a little, but her face was even paler.","She looked at Gu Yun'an, her voice pleading, \"Yun'an...\"","Gu Yun'an closed her eyes. \"Lian Sister, I'll help you this one last time.\"","\"Thank you, Yun'an, thank you...\"","Soon, Shen Tang finished filming her scenes and prepared to go back home.","Qi Yue handed her a box with a mischievous grin, \"Here, a gift for you. Open it tonight, okay~\"","Shen Tang was very curious, like a cat scratching away at something inside her, and wanted to open it right away.","Seeing this, Qi Yue poked Shen Tang on the nose and said, \"Don't open it early, or I'll expose your ugly photos!\"","Shen Tang: \"!!!\"","\"Wait, how do you have my ugly photos?\"","\"Don't believe me?\"","Qi Yue took out her phone and opened an album full of Shen Tang's eating photos, sleeping photos, and photos of her with her mouth wide open laughing.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Wow, real sisters! Not one was good looking.","\"Delete them quickly!\"","Shen Tang reached to grab the phone. She absolutely could not allow such photos to exist!","Qi Yue directly locked her screen, \"Don't worry, I won't show them to anyone else. Remember, open it tonight, okay~ Send me a photo after. \"","\"Then you have to delete all the photos afterwards.\"","Qi Yue thought for a moment and nodded, \"Okay, after you take a photo wearing it tonight and show me, I'll delete all the photos.\"","\"Wearing it?\"","Shen Tang had a bad feeling about this. Could it be that kind of clothing?","But she saw Qi Yue wave her hand and leave directly, \"See you in a few days.\"","Shen Tang finished packing her luggage and gave Yuan Yuan a few days off. As soon as she went downstairs, she saw Gu Huaian's car, and thought she was seeing things at first.","Until Zhen the assistant got out of the car, \"Madam, President Gu asked me to come pick you up.\"","\"Oh, thank you for taking the time to come get me when you're so busy.\"","\"You're too kind.\"","Sitting in the car, Shen Tang was still a little confused. She could have gone herself, so why did Gu Huaian send the super busy Zhen to come?","Finally, the car stopped, not at the villa, but at a residence near Gu Huaian's company.","She had been here once before, but didn't end up delivering food. Instead, she got to know Qi Yue.","Though it happened long ago, she remembered it clearly.","Thinking of it now, Shen Tang couldn't help laughing out loud.","She followed Zhen upstairs, and gave the place a quick once-over. The black and white, cold color scheme was exceptionally tidy without much liveliness. The bright pink slippers at the door looked very conspicuous.","Clearly, they were prepared specially for her.","Zhen explained, \"President Gu bought them himself.\"","Shen Tang was touched that Gu Huaian went through so much effort. Her heart welled up with sweetness.","Zhen checked his watch, \"I have some things to do, so I'll get going. Dinner is already ordered and will be delivered shortly.\"","\"Thank you, Zhen.\"","\"Just doing my job, don't mention it.\"","Shen Tang felt that, contrary to his high pay and heavy workload, Zhen worked 24/7 tirelessly. Not only did he handle Gu Huaian's work properly, but he also paid attention to the little things in his life. Not just anyone could handle such a job.","After Zhen left, Shen Tang walked around the room. The house was big and empty, but was furnished with many things according to her lifestyle.","For example, the yellow pillow she often used on the sofa at the villa, her favorite straw water cup, toiletries, etc.","Worth mentioning, many things were couple sets.","Shen Tang: \"Tsk.\""]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: Stop it with Your Mouth","paragraphs":["After Assistant Chen left, it wasn't long before the food delivery person arrived.","Shen Tang opened the door to get the food, not noticing that the delivery person took several extra glances at her.","\"Thank you for your hard work.\"","\"You're welcome.\"","Shen Tang closed the door. Outside, the person covered their mouth and screamed excitedly.","He frantically typed in the group chat: [Bros, I think I just saw Tangtang! It was the real Tangtang! She's alive!]","[Who else could it be other than alive?]","[Hey, watch what you say!]","[Heavens, was that the Shen Tang? Is she as beautiful as she looks online?]","[She's even more beautiful than online. Her skin looks so fair it glows, and she even said thank you to me. Ah ah ah ah, bros, I'm dead.]","Shen Tang was completely unaware of all this.","She opened the food container and took a bite. Hmm, the taste is so familiar, like what Sister Lan makes.","She quickly messaged Gu Huaian on WeChat to confirm, and after getting a positive response, she slowly enjoyed the meal.","It had also been a few days since she last chatted with Sister Lan, so Shen Tang took out the gift she had prepared for her and set it aside neatly.","Suddenly, she noticed the box in the corner.","This was the gift from Qi Yue. Shen Tang eagerly unwrapped it.","It was a thin box, and inside was a set of clothes when opened.","\"Sailor uniform?\"","Shen Tang looked it over; it didn't seem to have any problems, yet she also felt like something was a bit off.","It wasn't until she tried it on that she was stunned.","Good gracious, the top was so short, it barely covered her chest, even more revealing than a crop top.","And this skirt, just bending over slightly would lead to an accidental reveal.","Shen Tang recalled Qi Yue's previous words, she didn't feel too opposed to it, they were just girls after all, just looking was no big deal.","So Shen Tang took out her phone and snapped a few selfies, selecting the one that looked most decent and directly sending it to Qi Yue.","She was about to ask if Qi Yue was satisfied, when she realized she had sent it to the wrong person - to Gu Huaian.","Because they had just been in contact, his chat was at the top.","Shen Tang hurriedly tried to recall the photo.","Hopefully he was too busy to have seen it.","But reality is often cruel. Gu Huaian sent back several puzzled question marks.","[Silly Monkey in Love: Sorry, sent it to the wrong person]","[Gu Huaian: Who did you want to send it to?]","Shen Tang covered her face. Shoot, this was a misunderstanding.","[Silly Monkey in Love: Just Qi Yue...]","[Gu Huaian: Not allowed]","[Silly Monkey in Love: She's a girl]","[Gu Huaian: I'm the only one who can see photos like this]","Shen Tang's little face flushed red. Wow, what a domineering CEO line, she loved it, hehehe.","But she had already promised Qi Yue, plus Qi Yue had those ugly photos of her, they were too embarrassing, she couldn't let Qi Yue keep them!","Shen Tang sent a screenshot of her chat with Gu Huaian to Qi Yue, and asked: What should I do? He won't let me send them to you.","[Qi Yue: Am I just part of you guys' play?]","[Qi Yue: Tangtang, how come you'll show him but not me? Aren't we good friends? crying.jpg]","[Silly Monkey in Love: I could show you my butthole.jpg]","[Qi Yue: Then if I delete all the photos, will you show me?]","[Silly Monkey in Love: Okay, you delete first]","Qi Yue sent a screenshot of clearing her photo album and asked: Can I see now?","Shen Tang chuckled mischievously and sent an audio message: \"Hahaha, nope!\"","Qi Yue also laughed and sent one back: \"I tricked you, I didn't actually delete them!\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","As expected of good friends, neither spoke a true word, tricking back and forth. They could go scheme in the imperial palace.","Unexpectedly, Qi Yue sent a video call. Shen Tang reacted quickly and picked it up right away.","The angle was quite suggestive, just happening to show her fair, slender waist.","\"Yo yo yo, I knew it would fit you perfectly!\"","Shen Tang looked down, \"How's this fit perfectly? It's like I'm not even wearing anything.\"","\"You don't understand, this kind of half-revealing feeling is exactly what's desired. Any man who sees this would be driven mad with desire. You're sure to successfully seduce President Gu tonight.\"","Driven mad with desire?","Shen Tang felt that was debatable. For a workaholic like Gu Huaian, even if she stripped naked and stood in front of him, he'd probably think work was more important.","\"Don't doubt it!\"","\"So you have experience then?\"","With one line, Qi Yue shut her mouth. \"I don't have much practical experience, but my theoretical knowledge is very extensive.\"","The wealthy playboy friends around her were all players, each one wilder than the next. Sometimes she would hear about things, her eyes had been opened.","Shen Tang raised her brow, \"As if anyone lacks theoretical knowledge, I don't even know how many novels I've read.\"","The two ended up discussing everything from novels to comics to videos, sharing many resources with each other.","Unknowingly, they had chatted for over two hours.","Until the room door opened, Shen Tang was startled and looked to the door, \"Gu Huaian? You're back this early?\"","Qi Yue gave a perverted grin and immediately shut up. She then saw Shen Tang get pulled into Gu Huaian's embrace.","She had wanted to watch the kind of scene you could see without spending money, but when she really ate dog food, Qi Yue felt she was just asking for this abuse.","Yet before she could end the video call, the screen went black.","Looks like Gu Huaian was the one who hung up.","\"Che, men.\"","Meanwhile, Shen Tang's face was currently pressed tightly against Gu Huaian's chest, able to hear his steady, powerful heartbeat.","\"You...\"","\"Tangtang...\"","When Gu Huaian spoke, Shen Tang could feel the vibration in his chest.","\"Mm, I'm here.\"","Gu Huaian held her tighter and tighter, as if wanting to meld her into his embrace.","Shen Tang couldn't resist struggling a bit. She didn't control her strength well and directly threw Gu Huaian off.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Would he believe her if she said it wasn't on purpose?","Gu Huaian turned his body slightly and lightly coughed, \"Want to change your clothes?\"","Only then did Shen Tang realize she was still wearing the sailor uniform, her old face instantly turning red.","She glanced at Gu Huaian's expression. See, she knew he wouldn't react. He loved work the most.","Gu Huaian's voice was slightly hoarse, \"Don't overthink. I'm taking you to meet some friends in a bit.\"","\"You have friends?!\" Shen Tang blurted out.","Gu Huaian chuckled, \"I do have a few. If you don't want to meet them, I won't make you.\"","\"Let's meet, let's meet.\"","It was just meeting some friends, no big deal.","It's said that when dating, you should meet each other's friends. Come to think of it, she seemed to not have brought Gu Huaian to meet her friends yet.","Shen Tang suddenly felt a little guilty.","But thinking about it, it hadn't been long since they confirmed their relationship. Plus they had been busy, so she didn't do anything wrong.","Thinking this, Shen Tang's back straightened again.","Gu Huaian pushed her towards the wardrobe. \"Go change quickly.\"","\"Oh...\"","Gu Huaian went straight to the bathroom and splashed cold water on his face, finally suppressing the restlessness in his heart.","Heaven knows how stimulating it was for him to see Shen Tang dressed like that earlier.","Although he wasn't lustful, there was no lack of other women trying to seduce him before. But he felt nothing towards them, he didn't react to them the same as Shen Tang.","It was difficult not to have desires when the woman he liked was right before his eyes.","For such matters, he both anticipated and feared the next time.","Unlike others, Gu Huaian was still somewhat traditional at heart.","He wanted to give Shen Tang a grand wedding ceremony. He wanted to keep the beautiful memories of the two on their wedding night, he didn't want to treat her so casually even though they were already legally married.","Gu Huaian gently exhaled.","Once he calmed down, he came out.","By now Shen Tang had already finished changing for quite some time. Seeing him take so long to come out, she was a bit surprised, \"Are you constipated?\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Sometimes he really hated that she couldn't keep her mouth shut.","Shen Tang tilted her head, \"Don't tell me your hemorrhoids are acting up? Don't hesitate to see a doctor.\"","Gu Huaian couldn't stand it anymore. He lowered his head and silenced her chattering mouth.","With his mouth."]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: No Puppy Love","paragraphs":["After half an hour, the two finally came downstairs.","All the way, Shen Tang didn't speak again, her cheeks flushed red, and her lips were ruddy, it was obvious what had happened.","When they arrived at the parking lot, Shen Tang sensitively noticed someone peeping at her, but when she turned around, she didn't see anything.","Was it an illusion?","\"What's wrong?\"","\"Nothing.\"","Shen Tang was inclined to think it was her illusion, it was probably just a passerby taking a casual glance.","The place Gu Huaian mentioned was a club that required a membership card to enter, the threshold was very high.","At least Shen Tang had never been there before.","Gu Huaian looked like a regular customer, the valet and waiters were all very familiar with him, and took him straight to the usual private room 8888.","\"This room number is nice.\"","\"Businessmen care more about this.\" Even Gu Huaian was no exception.","Gu Huaian pushed open the door, and the cacophonous noise that could barely be called music flew into their ears.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Good gracious, it was a hellish din.","Seeing them come in, the two quickly put down their microphones.","\"Brother Gu and sister-in-law are here.\"","\"Come in and sit down, sister-in-law is so beautiful, first time seeing you, this little gift is nothing.\"","The man speaking took out a black card and handed it over.","The red-haired man next to him stared wide-eyed in shock, \"You rascal, when I asked you earlier what gift you had prepared, you said you didn't prepare anything.\"","\"Didn't you also say you didn't prepare anything? Then what are you holding in your hand?\"","The red-haired man threw the keys in his hand directly at Shen Tang, \"Sister-in-law is so nice, this car is more suitable for girls to drive, it's a gift for you.\"","Shen Tang reflexively caught the keys, stunned for a moment, were greeting gifts always so generous?","She looked at Gu Huaian for help.","Gu Huaian nodded, \"Take it, they have also taken advantage of me a lot.\"","\"Look at what Brother Gu said, how could that be taking advantage of you?\"","\"Right, that was just brotherhood.\"","Gu Huaian also looked very relaxed at the moment, it seemed these two were close friends of his.","It was just that the one with blue hair and the other with red hair didn't look very smart.","\"Sister-in-law, please sit down, would you like a drink or some fruit?\"","\"Thank you, no need.\"","She had to say, the red-haired man was very attentive, making her feel flattered. The blue-haired man was also not to be outdone, but Gu Huaian pulled him back before he could come forward.","\"Alright, both of you sit back down, what's with your behavior?\"","\"Alright, I'll listen to Brother Gu. Sister-in-law, please feel free.\"","The blue-haired man looked extremely stifled.","\"I'll just call you by your names.\"","That night, Shen Tang was flattered by the two little flatterers.","She looked at Gu Huaian suspiciously, could it be that he was so close with them because these two had sweet mouths!","Tsk tsk, this man, you really can't judge a book by its cover!","The three quickly became acquainted, especially when the two found out Shen Tang was a Glory legend, their wagging tails seemed to wag even more happily.","\"As expected of sister-in-law, you play games so well!\"","\"Yeah, sister-in-law, why don't you take us to play a few rounds?\"","\"Sure.\"","Shen Tang opened the game, they were going to trio queue at first, but she suddenly remembered Gu Huaian could also play Glory, so she asked, \"Do you want to play together?\"","The red-haired man was stunned, \"Brother Gu can play games too?\"","The blue-haired man shook his head, \"No way, he's a noob, he wouldn't play this kind of thing.\"","\"Sure, let me update it first.\" Gu Huaian had been too busy lately to play any games.","This time the red and blue-haired men were shocked, they really didn't know Brother Gu could play this kind of game.","The red-haired man was shocked beyond belief: \"Brother Gu, didn't you say this game was useless?\"","Gu Huaian glanced at him, \"Did I say that?\"","The red-haired man scratched his head, \"I...seem to have remembered wrong, it must have been Fu Junsheng who said it.\"","Fu Junsheng the blue-haired man: \"...\"","\"Yes, yes, yes, I said everything.\"","So, the few sat in a private room that cost thousands per hour and played Glory.","Shen Tang had thought these two must be quite good, but it turned out they were just feeders.","The private room echoed with pleas for help from time to time:","\"Sister-in-law save me!\"","\"Sister-in-law come quick!\"","\"Sister-in-law—\"","\"Shut up!\" Gu Huaian couldn't stand these two anymore, they really talked too much, more than five hundred ducks.","After playing a few rounds, they lost just as many rounds.","After all, there were two moles on their team for the enemy, no wonder they couldn't win three versus seven.","Shen Tang felt bad about saying she didn't want to play anymore, but Gu Huaian took the initiative to say, \"It's getting late, let's play again next time.\"","Shen Tang shot him an approving glance, he really was her good boyfriend, he understood what she was thinking.","Gu Huaian's lips curved up slightly.","The few ate dinner together before going their separate ways.","On the drive home, Gu Huaian explained his history with the other two.","\"The three of us grew up together as childhood friends. Maybe because I did well in school since I was young, I was the model child in the eyes of the parents.","At first, they didn't like me, and ambushed me a few times, but I beat them in the end, and they became my lackeys since. Even when I went abroad for university and started my business, they followed me. Although they're a bit dumb, they're good people worth befriending.\"","Shen Tang nodded, she could tell they were quite stupid indeed, but they were nice people.","However, she was still a bit surprised, she didn't expect Gu Huaian had a time when he got into fights too.","He seemed to know what she was thinking, and said with a smile, \"Actually I was quite rebellious before too, probably not what you imagined.\"","Shen Tang tilted her head. \"Don't tell me you smoked, drank, had early relationships, and skipped class in school too?\"","Gu Huaian answered seriously, \"No early relationships.\"","This was definitely not to be misunderstood."]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Help Me Think","paragraphs":["\"Pfft!\"","Gu Huaian's serious explanation of his expression was really adorable.","\"What about you? What were you like before?\"","When Shen Tang heard Gu Huaian's words, her thoughts drifted uncontrollably to the past.","Because she was an orphan, besides studying and taking care of the children, what Shen Tang did most was to take on part-time jobs.","At that time, she was young, and many shop owners were unwilling to hire her. Finally, she took the initiative to ask for half the wages before someone dared to employ her.","When others went out to play, she was working; when others coaxed their parents, she was also working.","The school uniform was the one she wore most throughout the year. To be honest, she didn't feel tired at that time, on the contrary, she felt very fulfilled.","But now, if she had to live like that again, she was afraid she wouldn't have that kind of perseverance anymore.","She still remembered washing dishes in the kitchen in the depths of winter, her hands even had chilblains, which was very itchy.","Hearing these thoughts, Gu Huaian's eyes turned red with distress.","His Tang Tang had such a hard time before...","Shen Tang said with a smile, \"There's nothing much to say about when I was in school. I was more introverted at that time and didn't have many friends.\"","She didn't encounter what was written in novels, like being bullied, being abused, after all, life is not a novel.","Most of her classmates were very nice. The few unfriendly ones were also beaten friendly by her.","Gu Huaian leaned sideways and hugged her in his arms, stroking her smooth hair, \"I will treat you well.\"","Shen Tang struggled to look up, \"How well? Let me touch your abs?\"","The driver sitting in the front row silently raised the partition.","Was this free content he could listen to?","Gu Huaian's previous emotions were swept away by Shen Tang's words.","\"What are you always thinking in your head?\"","\"Abs.\"","\"Oh, and pecs too.\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He took Shen Tang's hand and slowly reached into his clothes...","The soft, cool little hand slid back and forth on his abdomen. Gu Huaian only felt his lower abdomen tighten, and his whole body became uncomfortable.","After a while, he asked hoarsely, \"Haven't you touched enough?\"","[Wow, so this is what abs feel like...]","[Not enough touches! Not enough touches!]","Reluctant in her mind, in reality, Shen Tang pretended to be calm and withdrew her hand, \"Touched enough.\"","Gu Huaian sighed, then pulled her hand back, \"Let you touch some more.\"","Oh well, he had to indulge the one he chose.","Form is emptiness, emptiness is form. Gu Huaian kept chanting this in his heart, but it didn't work.","His attention inevitably fell on the little hand on his abdomen, soft, cool, making his skin tingle.","He grabbed Shen Tang's hand, \"Next time to touch again.\"","Although Shen Tang hadn't touched enough, from Gu Huaian's slightly hurried breathing and hoarse voice, she realized something was wrong with him.","She sat quietly next to him and didn't make any more mischief for the rest of the trip.","Just talking big, when it came to actual practice, she still had very little courage.","The two were quiet all the way until they got home. Only then did Shen Tang realize there was only one bedroom here.","So wouldn't the two have to sleep together?","Shen Tang was fine, but Gu Huaian was nervous and clumsy, \"Do you want to shower first or should I go first?\"","\"I'll go first, it takes me longer to blow dry my hair.\"","\"Okay, I'll go have an international conference call first.\"","Looking at the time, it was almost midnight. Shen Tang didn't expect him to still have to work this late.","Even after she had finished bathing and came out, Gu Huaian was not done yet.","Shen Tang wiped her hair and walked over, afraid of encountering the same situation as last time, she just glanced from afar, and sure enough he was in a video conference.","Without disturbing him, she blow-dried her hair and lay in bed playing on her phone.","However, no matter how interesting the short videos and jokes were, she couldn't really get into them. Her mind was full of the two soon sharing a bed.","Shen Tang gently patted her cheeks, \"Shen Tang, you really have no backbone. It's not like you haven't lived together before.\"","But the situation was different then. At that time, he was the sugar daddy, and her mindset was to \"serve\" him well.","Now the two had become boyfriend and girlfriend. Some things were probably unavoidable.","The more Shen Tang thought about it, the more R-rated it became, and she finally hid under the quilt completely.","In the living room, Gu Huaian, who was still in the meeting, suddenly froze.","Question: What is it like to have a girlfriend with too wild an imagination?","This question could probably only be answered by Gu Huaian.","Right in the middle of a proper meeting, suddenly hearing the R-rated content imagined by his girlfriend in her mind, he almost couldn't maintain his expression.","Was this meeting absolutely necessary now?","It really was.","After all, it was an international conference call, with different time zones.","Gu Huaian suppressed the urge to leave and earnestly continued the meeting.","When it finally ended, he hurried back to the bedroom, only to find that Shen Tang was already asleep, her head still covered by the quilt.","He gently flipped part of the quilt down.","Shen Tang didn't even open her eyes, mumbling groggily, \"Are you done with work?\"","\"Yeah, go back to sleep first, I'll go take a shower.\"","\"Oh...\"","Afraid the noise would be too loud, Gu Huaian simply rinsed off and then returned to the bedroom.","The bed was very big, and he lay on the other side. Although they couldn't even touch each other, he was excitedly unable to fall asleep for a while.","He opened WeChat, and the other two guys in their small group were still chatting, as they were night owls.","[Gu Huaian: Help me think of a good way to propose]","[Cen Songbai: ??? Propose? ]","[Fu Junsheng: Brother Gu, aren't you two already married?]","[Gu Huaian: We only registered, haven't had the proposal or wedding ceremony yet]","[Cen Songbai: Brother Gu, your order is really different from others]","[Gu Huaian: Help me think of a good proposal ceremony]","In fact, Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng were also both lifelong bachelors until now. Their families were urging them too, but before, they had Gu Huaian as a shield.","Until a while ago, he secretly got married.","The two were most worried that their families would find out about this and force them to hurry up and find someone to marry too.","They didn't want to be matched in arranged marriages between prominent families, and in a short time they couldn't find a girl they liked either, so where could they go get married?","Their parents were so strict about them not having relationships in school, but after graduation they started urging them to hurry up and get married and have kids. These parents really left them speechless.","So the proposals suggested by the two bachelors weren't great either.","[Cen Songbai: How about arranging 999 roses on the ground in a heart shape with candles, and proposing on one knee?]","[Fu Junsheng: Cheesy]","[Cen Songbai: Then you suggest something?]","[Fu Junsheng: I say, just book an entire Western restaurant, listen to music, eat a candlelight dinner, put the ring in the dessert your sister-in-law is eating, and when she eats it, Brother Gu get down on one knee and propose]","[Cen Songbai: ??? Put the ring in the dessert, isn't that dirty? No, how did you come up with this?]","[Fu Junsheng: I saw it in a TV show, they did it this way, there must be a reason. I saw the female lead was moved to tears, what do you know!]","[Cen Songbai: Just make a suggestion, why start cursing people?]","And so, the two started arguing.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","Gu Huaian felt this suggestion wasn't great either.","He was foolish, he shouldn't have asked these two."]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: Watch What You Say","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian closed his phone and planned to have Cen Assistant find some proposals tomorrow.","Glancing to the side, Shen Tang was sleeping very soundly, her little mouth slightly open, and her calm, rhythmic breathing could be heard clearly, giving people a reassuring feeling.","He didn't know when, but drowsiness came over him, and Gu Huaian also fell into a deep sleep.","The next day, Shen Tang opened her eyes in a daze and found that she was octopus-hugging Gu Huaian tightly, their bodies pressed close together, making the posture a bit too intimate.","Shen Tang could even feel Gu Huaian’s certain body part.","[Oh my god, so big!]","Shen Tang’s old face turned red, and she gently pulled her hand back. Seeing Gu Huaian’s eyelashes flutter, Shen Tang quickly closed her eyes and pretended to be asleep.","[It would be too awkward to face this situation, better to let Gu Huaian wake up first,] she thought.","But she kept her eyes closed and waited for a long time, yet Gu Huaian showed no sign of getting up.","She lifted her eyelids a little, wanting to see what was going on, and happened to meet Gu Huaian’s eyes directly.","Shen Tang: “......”","\"Not pretending to sleep anymore?\"","Gu Huaian chuckled softly. He hadn’t fully woken up yet when he heard Tang Tang’s inner voice just now.","He had to say, having this mind reading ability was quite good indeed.","He just didn’t know how long it would last.","He had a hunch that this ability wouldn’t always be there.","Shen Tang blinked her eyes innocently. \"What are you talking about? I just woke up.\"","She stubbornly refused to admit it.","Gu Huaian had just said it casually.","Their postures were too intimate, so he shifted back a little. \"Can we get up now?\"","Shen Tang hurriedly pulled back her hands and legs.","\"Aren't you going to work so late today?\"","\"I took the day off to accompany you.\"","\"Ah? Isn't the company busy?\"","\"I finished today's work in advance. I’ll accompany you well today.\"","Shen Tang was delighted and pleasantly surprised to hear this.","\"So where shall we go?\"","\"Do you want to go to the amusement park? Or the beach? Or camping? I heard there might be a meteor shower tonight.\"","It was obvious Gu Huaian had done some preparation work, which was quite thoughtful.","Shen Tang was very moved. \"Let's go camping. I haven't gone before.\"","In her previous life, she was either working or on the way to work, with no time for camping at all.","She had only seen other people's posts about it online before, and Shen Tang was quite envious.","\"Alright, camping first, we’ll do the rest one by one.\"","A trace of distress rose in Gu Huaian's heart, and he made a decision that he would make up for all the hardships Tang Tang suffered in her previous life.","Shen Tang noticed Gu Huaian's gaze was a little strange. She rubbed her arms and said, \"Why are you looking at me like that? It's creepy.\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He leaned down and pecked Shen Tang on the lips. \"You'd better not talk.\"","\"I don't like listening anyway.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She suspected that she had corrupted Gu Huaian, why did he talk like this now?","Shen Tang suddenly realized, \"You didn't brush your teeth just now.\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","\"Sorry, I was too rushed.\"","He was too eager to shut her mouth that he forgot they just woke up.","While Shen Tang turned around, Gu Huaian secretly breathed into his hand and smelled it. Fortunately there was no odor.","When Shen Tang came out of the bathroom after washing up, Gu Huaian had already prepared breakfast, keeping it simple since Shen Tang still had to film later.","After eating, the two went to the supermarket to buy camping supplies.","Since it wouldn’t be fun with just the two of them, they simply called the two funny guys Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng along.","Not far away was a large shopping mall. Shen Tang wore a mask and walked hand in hand with Gu Huaian inside, looking just like an ordinary young couple.","Suddenly, screams erupted nearby as the crowd panicked and shoved each other while running away.","“Murder! Murder!”","\"Ahhhhh!\"","The two looked at each other, squeezed forward a few steps, and saw a man in his thirties holding a blood-stained kitchen knife. He kept hacking at a girl’s neck, his eyes red with madness.","Gu Huaian covered Shen Tang's eyes after she took just one glance. \"Don't look.\"","With his other hand, Gu Huaian quickly dialed the police.","The woman's pupils were dilated. She was beyond saving, with blood spurting everywhere from her carotid artery. The floor was stained red.","The mechanical actions of the man looked terrifying. Everyone around was staying far away, afraid of getting involved.","\"What's the situation? He's so ruthless...\"","\"Looks like a crime of passion...\"","\"The woman must have cheated, otherwise the man wouldn't be so vicious.\"","With her eyes closed, Shen Tang's ears became sharper, and she heard the birth of rumors.","She tore Gu Huaian's hand down and glared at the few gossipers. \"Do you know that spreading rumors is against the law? Aren't you afraid the dead will come looking for you at night?\"","That aunt looked embarrassed. \"I didn't say anything. Little girl, your words are too vulgar.\"","\"Far less vulgar than you though,\" Shen Tang retorted.","She hated people like this the most, who did nothing but spread nonsense with their mouth.","When she worked nights in her past life, she often came home late.","The old lady downstairs then spread rumors that she didn't have a proper job, causing others to look at her strangely. Some men even knocked on her door late at night. It was so annoying.","Gu Huaian's eyes flashed coldly. So things like this had happened.","He felt powerless that even if he wanted to help, he didn’t have the chance.","He wasn't involved in Shen Tang's past, but would guard her future.","Gu Huaian looked at the rumormonger and said, \"According to the security law, those who spread rumors may be detained for 5-10 days and fined less than 500 yuan if the circumstances are serious. Auntie, watch what you say.\"","The aunt paled in fright. \"I just said it casually, why make such a big deal...\"","\"Yes, you just said it casually, but others would believe it. Don't you understand that you shouldn't make judgments without knowing the truth?\"","\"Whether it’s too much or not, shouldn’t you ask the dead person?\"","The aunt took a few steps back. She didn’t dare provoke someone she couldn’t hide from.","Soon, the security guards arrived. The guards in large shopping malls tended to be quite capable and quickly subdued the man.","The volume of discussion from the crowd gradually increased, talking about all sorts of things.","Some were frightened, some gossiped out of curiosity, and some even openly discussed the dead, saying that she was doomed to be killed for dressing so provocatively.","Shen Tang wondered why it was always the victim being criticized when the killer was clearly the man.","What was wrong with this world?"]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: Hope Shen Tong's Dream Comes True","paragraphs":["From the moment they left until they settled the bill, Shen Tang felt somewhat melancholic.","She never expected to encounter such a situation right after coming out, especially the words of those people pointing and whispering, which lingered in Shen Tang's heart like a heavy boulder, causing a sense of stifling oppression.","Gu Huaian didn't know how to console her, so he silently accompanied her.","\"Are we still going?\" he asked.","Shen Tang gathered her spirits and replied, \"Yes!\"","\"Why would I miss this opportunity after finally getting it?!\" she exclaimed.","She wasn't sure if she was saying it for Gu Huaian to hear or for herself.","In the end, the two of them decided to go, fortunately without encountering any strange incidents as they proceeded.","Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng were a pair of amusing fools, and they quickly managed to make Shen Tang forget about the previous unpleasantness. They secretly breathed a sigh of relief in a place where Shen Tang couldn't notice.","Sure enough, when the sister-in-law was happy, Big Brother Gu was happy too.","They were really an easygoing couple!","The four of them set up two tents, with each pair sharing one.","At first, Shen Tang felt a little uneasy, but then she thought to herself that both pairs had already slept together, so she might as well let go and not worry about what Gu Huaian might do.","In the evening, the mountain breeze was still chilly, so Gu Huaian handed Shen Tang a thick coat to wear.","Surprised, she asked, \"You are so thoughtful!\"","The two of them sat side by side, waiting for the meteor shower they had seen in the preview.","Gu Huaian reached out and embraced Shen Tang, leaning her against his shoulder.","They sat there quietly, not needing to say a word, but feeling very happy.","Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng glanced at each other and imitated the posture of Shen Tang and Gu Huaian, sitting beside them.","Cen Songbai leaned against Fu Junsheng's shoulder and used a high-pitched voice to ask, \"Junsheng, will you love me forever?\"","Fu Junsheng responded in a falsetto, \"Darling, why would you say such silly things? If I don't love you, who will I love?\"","Shen Tang and Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Could you two sit a little farther away?\"","Suddenly, Gu Huaian regretted bringing these two party crashers along. They were absolutely clueless.","Upon hearing Gu Huaian's words, Cen Songbai dramatically flung himself into Fu Junsheng's arms and sobbed, \"Wuwuwu, hubby, he wants us to go away!\"","Fu Junsheng's expression suddenly changed, and he pushed Cen Songbai away and started retching.","\"Yue~\"","Cen Songbai: \"...\"","\"Honey~\"","\"Shut up!\"","\"Cen Songbai, you're so disgusting. How did you manage to make that sound?\"","\"Didn't you want me to be more disgusting?\" Cen Songbai felt wronged.","Yes, although that was true, he didn't want him to be this disgusting.","The two of them, single dogs, were here, forced to eat dog food.","Fu Junsheng had originally planned to disgust Gu Huaian and the others, but he didn't expect to be disgusted by Cen Songbai first.","Gu Huaian's face turned ugly, and he felt a bit nauseous, while Shen Tang almost burst out laughing.","Just then, a shooting star streaked across the sky.","Shen Tang quickly tugged at Gu Huaian's sleeve and said, \"Look, a shooting star! Make a wish!\"","After the words fell, she closed her eyes, clasped her hands together, and silently prayed.","After a while, Shen Tang opened her eyes and tilted her head to ask Gu Huaian, \"What wish did you make?\"","Gu Huaian was about to speak when Shen Tang quickly covered his mouth and said, \"No, no, don't say it. If we say it out loud, the wish won't come true.\"","Gu Huaian closed his mouth and stopped talking.","His wish was actually \"to make Shen Tang's dreams come true.\"","No matter what she desires, he wants her to have a safe and smooth life in the future.","Cen Songbai on the side teased, \"Oh, oh, oh.\"","Gu Huaian gave him an annoyed look.","The more he thought about it, the more he felt that he shouldn't have called them together.","Fortunately, Cen Songbai knew when to quit. He touched his nose and said, \"Well, we're both tired. Let's go back and rest. We won't disturb you anymore.\"","Fu Junsheng also waved his hand, and the two of them glanced at each other, then quickly looked away, even keeping a few meters of distance when leaving.","Shen Tang stood up and patted the dust off her bottom. \"Shall we go back too?\"","\"Okay.\"","Lying in the tent, Shen Tang absentmindedly scrolled through her phone. Suddenly, she sat up and exclaimed, \"What the hell?\"","\"What's wrong?\"","Shen Tang quickly handed over her phone. \"You're trending!\"","It was a video from today at the supermarket. It seemed that some passerby recorded the incident where Shen Tang confronted an old lady and posted it online.","Ironically, the netizens didn't recognize her from the half of her face visible outside the mask, but rather because of her foul language.","[Give this young lady a like.]","[I can't stand people spreading rumors like this. My male classmate came to find me, and the downstairs aunty started rumors that I have a boyfriend and even said I had an abortion. Seriously, speechless.]","[Let's dig up more on this handsome guy. Does anyone know who he is?]","[Isn't this Gu Huaian? Can't believe there are people who don't recognize him.]","[Wait, is this girl Shen Tang? Is she dating Gu Huaian?]","[What kind of dream is she having? An orphanage-raised D-list actress, and he's the CEO of Gu Corporation. Do you really think it's possible?]","[Oh my God, this couple is perfect for a novel. Can someone please write a book about them?]","[??? Why are you shipping everything?]","[Shipping everything keeps my nutrition balanced.]","Gu Huaian suddenly chuckled, and Shen Tang curiously leaned over to read the comments. \"What's so funny?\"","\"Some people have keen eyes.\"","\"Huh?\"","\"They say we have the perfect couple look.\"","Shen Tang also saw that comment. To be honest, she didn't think they looked alike at all.","If she had to say, maybe they both just looked good. Perhaps good-looking people have something in common?","Pfft!","With that thought, Shen Tang burst into laughter. She felt a bit shameless with that idea.","But she did feel that the difference between the two of them was too great. Some netizens were right in their analysis—they truly seemed like people from two different worlds.","\"By the way, why did you choose me for a marriage agreement in the first place?\"","Shen Tang was genuinely curious about this question.","She had forgotten a lot of the original book's plot and didn't know if it was mentioned there.","But since the original character was a cannon fodder, and Gu Huaian wasn't a significant male lead, it was unlikely to be written.","Gu Huaian never expected Shen Tang to suddenly ask this question. He pondered for a moment and replied, \"To be honest, it was because of the pressure from my family that I had Cen assist me in selecting a suitable candidate for marriage. At that time, despite the scandals surrounding you, your background... indicated that you didn't have any troublesome relatives, and furthermore, you were more obedient to your manager's instructions.\"","In other words, it was because you lacked connections, independence, and were easier to control. Both of them understood this point.","Shen Tang felt frustrated, saying, \"In the era of the internet, there's truly no privacy left.\"","\"Cough, would you mind?\" Gu Huaian asked nervously.","When he researched the information before, it should have been the original Shen Tang. She probably came over on the day they signed the contract.","At least, that was Gu Huaian's speculation, as he still remembered Cen mentioning that Shen Tang was acting strangely that day.","\"I don't really mind,\" Shen Tang replied with a vein popping on her forehead.","If it weren't for signing the contract with her, who knows who would have enjoyed this great wealth and prosperity?","Wouldn't she have to remain poor forever?","Speaking of this, Shen Tang suddenly thought, now that she agreed to be Gu Huaian's girlfriend, does the agreement still hold?","Will she not receive her monthly payment anymore?","Shen Tang was greatly shocked and looked at Gu Huaian abruptly.","He wouldn't have gotten together with her just to save money, right?","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","You really are a clever little trickster!"]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: Three Hundred Million","paragraphs":["Shen Tang hesitated, very much wanting to ask clearly. But she also felt it would seem too money-minded and realistic, which didn't seem very good.","Gu Huaian could hear her psychological activities very clearly, and deliberately pretended not to know.","After much mental preparation, Shen Tang decided there was nothing to be embarrassed about for liking money. What did she have to feel awkward about?","\"Ahem, um...\"","\"What is it?\" Gu Huaian pretended not to know.","\"Is that agreement still valid?\"","\"Of course it's invalid.\"","Shen Tang's face instantly collapsed. Carefully she asked, \"Then what about my money...?\"","\"I myself am yours, so naturally my money is yours too.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Here it comes, though late the pie he painted is arriving.","Don't men always say things like this?","Her best friend's boyfriend had said the same thing in her past life. Then the man saved up his salary, saying it was to buy a house, while the woman's money was spent on living expenses for them both.","Of course, she wasn't comparing Gu Huaian with scumbags.","Gu Huaian definitely wouldn't stoop low. But spending someone else's money and your own money were completely different things!","Although she liked money, she didn't want to just keep asking others for it.","Gu Huaian heard her thoughts loud and clear.","He gave Shen Tang's hair a big rub with his hand. Not surprisingly, she was his wife.","\"Have you checked your card?\"","\"No.\"","\"Check it now.\"","Shen Tang guessed what had happened. She logged into her phone's app and glanced at the balance, instantly dumbstruck.","\"Wait, how much money is this?\"","\"Let's see, one two three four five six seven eight nine... nine digits is how much money? Tens hundreds millions billions trillion!\"","Shen Tang's eyes widened. \"Is this three billion?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Why did you give me so much money?\"","Compared to these billions, her previous savings were negligible.","\"It's for supporting my wife.\"","\"Ha?\"","\"I saw online that boyfriends always turn over their salaries, right?\"","\"But isn't this too much?!\"","Shen Tang still felt a sense of unreality. Had she struck it rich?","She even felt the money was burning her hand, and had an urge to give it back.","Wake up Shen Tang! Have you forgotten your money-loving persona?","\"I...\"","She was reluctant to return the money, yet also hesitated to keep it. Shen Tang the money maniac was conflicted.","Gu Huaian laughed softly. \"It's yours now that I gave it to you. This is all my salary over the years. It's all yours. What's mine is now yours, and what's yours is still yours.\"","Shen Tang swallowed. \"Is that a promise?\"","\"It is!\"","\"Then what will you spend?\"","Gu Huaian took Shen Tang's hand. \"I'll have to rely on my wife from now on.\"","\"Who's your wife?!\"","They had just started dating and he was already calling her his wife! Wouldn't they have to sleep together eventually?","How adorable, makes me want to kiss him.","Gu Huaian didn't hold back. He pulled Shen Tang into his arms and fiercely kissed her face several times.","Of course, it was aimed at her face.","Shen Tang expressionlessly wiped her face. Was this guy crazy?","That night, Shen Tang received a call from her agent regarding the photos.","Shen Tang was conflicted about how to respond. Gu Huaian moved next to the phone and said, \"That's right, we're together now.\"","Pei Kesong didn't say much, only \"I see\" and \"Be careful.\"","At first Shen Tang thought she knew about her camping trip here, and was worried about safety issues.","But then she realized Pei Kesong meant that kind of \"be careful.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Did everyone think something had happened between her and Gu Huaian?","Did no one believe they lay together in bed chatting purely under the blanket?","Gu Huaian was silent. To be honest, if he wasn't himself, he wouldn't quite believe it either.","Happy times always pass quickly. Two days after her date with Gu Huaian, Shen Tang had to report to filming again.","It seemed she was always shooting dramas, though none had aired yet.","Gu Huaian was reluctant to part. \"Why don't I just come with you on set?\"","\"Then who'll handle your work?\"","\"I'll hand it to Assistant Cen.\"","Assistant Cen suddenly jerked his head up. \"???\"","\"No, President Gu, you—\"","\"You can't always bully Assistant Cen alone. He doesn't even have time to date.\"","Assistant Cen adjusted his glasses. \"Too true.\"","\"I'll give you a 5% raise every month.\"","Hearing Gu Huaian's words, Assistant Cen immediately smiled. \"It is my honor to serve President Gu.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Recalling Assistant Cen's mentioned salary, Shen Tang mentally calculated the 5% increase and admired it.","Though she was shooting dramas, her popularity wasn't high. Her pay wasn't nearly as much as the main actors.","But it was still far more than ordinary people earned.","\"Come on, I have to get back on set. Hurry and settle your work, then we can go out and play. I've never gone sightseeing!\"","As expected, hearing this, a trace of distress flashed through Gu Huaian's eyes.","\"Alright, anywhere you want to go, we'll go. In the future we'll travel the whole world.\"","Shen Tang waved her hand. \"My ride is here, bye for now!\"","Just as she was about to get in the car, Shen Tang suddenly turned and ran back. Standing on tiptoes, she kissed Gu Huaian's mouth with a pop.","\"Take good care of yourself, I'll check in on you from time to time.\"","\"You too.\"","Assistant Cen expressionlessly ate a bowlful of dog food.","The two lingered over their farewells before Shen Tang finally got in the car and left.","Gu Huaian looked to Assistant Cen, who immediately made a \"zip it\" gesture, getting it in a second.","\"You know how it is, they're in the honeymoon phase.\"","Assistant Cen desperately wanted to say he didn't know.","Nor did he want to know.","President Gu was just dating, so why did it feel like his soul had been replaced?","Assistant Cen was starting to get scared.","Making sure President Gu didn't see, he hurriedly brushed away the goosebumps on his arm.","This was way too creepy.","After returning to set, Shen Tang was immediately approached by the Director and Qi Yue.","Qi Yue grabbed Shen Tang's arm and pulled her aside to ask softly, \"Well, did you do it?\"","Before Shen Tang could reply, she saw the Director cocking his ear to eavesdrop.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","One was gossipier than the next.","\"You're imagining things, nothing happened.\"","Qi Yue rubbed her chin in surprise. \"That can't be. Could he be impotent?\"","The Director popped his head over. \"Who is it? Is it President Gu Huaian? Tang Tang, the news says you two are together. Is it true?\"","\"It's fake!\"","The Director hissed. \"You're lying.\"","\"Why ask when you already know the answer?\"","The Director excitedly covered his mouth. \"So you really are together!!!\""]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: The Families Are Coming","paragraphs":["The days passed by steadily. Shen Tang was always busy shooting her drama, while Gu Huaian reported to her every morning and night like a clingy big puppy.","Shen Tang quite enjoyed this and didn't find it annoying at all.","Strangely, Miao Miao hadn't contacted her for a good many days. Things were also quiet on Zhou Qinglian's end, with no mischief being stirred up.","It wasn't until Shen Tang received a message from Gu Huaian to accompany her to a banquet that she knew an opportunity had arrived.","This banquet was being held by the Zhou family and all the invitees were of the same social circle.","Shen Tang was attending as Gu Huaian's family member. She wrapped up work early that day, and Gu Huaian had sent over a styling team to get her ready ahead of time.","They were the same team that had styled Shen Tang before, so everyone was quite familiar and worked very efficiently.","After Shen Tang had tidied up, she went downstairs with her bag and ran into Qi Yue who was dressed up just as elegantly.","\"Yueyue, you look so beautiful today,\" Shen Tang said.","Qi Yue flipped her hair coquettishly. \"Of course. Us sisters are going to outshine everyone tonight.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Don't get ahead of yourself just because I complimented you.","Although it was true that both of their looks for tonight were quite eye-catching, who wouldn't dress up for a banquet like this?","Qi Yue had always been very confident.","As Shen Tang was about to get into Qi Yue's car, Gu Huaian stepped out of another car.","\"Tangtang~\"","His voice was so tender that Qi Yue immediately rolled her eyes. \"Alright, your family member is here. Looks like you can't ride with me anymore.\"","The corners of Shen Tang's mouth couldn't help curving up. \"Hehe, we see each other every day. It won't make much difference.\"","\"Yes, yes, just look at you, not hesitating one bit with your eyes glued to him. Go on, don't be an eyesore here.\"","Shen Tang clip-clopped over in her high heels. \"You came!\"","The drive over would take two hours, plus another two hours for the return trip. Just thinking about it made Shen Tang feel tired already.","Gu Huaian hugged Shen Tang and nuzzled his face in her hair, murmuring, \"I missed you.\"","Those words instantly drained all of Shen Tang's energy.","\"I...I missed you too.\"","Seeing this, Qi Yue in the other car twisted her lips and sharply snapped the curtain closed.","The two separated after a brief embrace. After all, Shen Tang was a public figure and had eyes on her all the time.","Once they were in the car, it sped off. Qi Yue also hurriedly told her driver to get going.","After the two cars had left, a man in a duckbill cap emerged from around the corner. He glanced at the photos he had taken and a sly smile spread across his face. \"This will make headlines.\"","It was standard practice for paparazzi to first contact the celebrity and offer to sell the photos back before leaking anything, since their ultimate goal was money.","But to his surprise, after emailing the Gu Corporation, there was no response for a long time.","This left him unsure of what to do - should he sell or not sell? His asking price wasn't high either, just seven figures. There was no way the Gu Corporation couldn't even afford that little bit of money.","But that's a story for later. Back to Shen Tang and the others arriving at the banquet. All eyes turned to look at them when they entered.","Zhou Qinglian, as the host, naturally came up to greet them. She was dressed in pure white, with ink black hair cascading down her back and light makeup on.","It had to be said, she looked truly beautiful tonight - a kind of shattered beauty that made people want to protect her.","\"Huaian, you came. Miss Shen, long time no see.\"","Gu Huaian's expression was aloof. Shen Tang smiled and nodded. \"Miss Zhou.\"","On the surface, there was no sign whatsoever of any discord between them.","It was best that Zhou Qinglian was willing to maintain this surface peace. After all, Shen Tang had no desire to engage in any petty squabbles either.","But somehow, Shen Tang felt uneasy about Zhou Qinglian's attitude.","After a brief exchange, the few of them split up.","Shen Tang watched Zhou Qinglian for a bit before withdrawing her gaze.","\"Is your sister here?\"","\"I'm not sure.\"","Shen Tang pressed her lips. She wanted to ask Miao Miao but didn't want to reveal her alt account right now.","Seeing her dilemma, Gu Huaian said, \"Let me ask.\"","Soon he replied, \"She's here, upstairs.\"","Shen Tang's heart tightened. Miao Miao, don't do anything rash!","Speak of the devil.","Not long after, Gu Yun'an came downstairs. From afar, Shen Tang noticed her abnormal complexion. Was she sick?","Gu Yun'an scanned the crowd and met Shen Tang's eyes before walking over.","Not just Shen Tang - Gu Huaian's face had also darkened.","After all, Gu Yun'an wasn't his real sister. And with her parents' recent scheming, his patience toward her was wearing thin.","If she dared make any moves against Shen Tang, he wouldn't stand on ceremony just because they were relatives.","Gu Yun'an felt utterly confused. Should she really do as Sister Lian had said?","She knew in her heart that it was wrong, but last time when she had refused, Sister Lian had attempted suicide by taking pills. If it happened again, they might not be able to save her in time.","Yet she also didn't want to do that to Shen Tang - it would ruin her!","In a daze, Gu Yun'an went downstairs and saw that Shen Tang had indeed arrived. Her face turned even paler.","\"Ow!\"","She bumped into someone and the person was quite angry. But seeing Gu Yun'an's sickly complexion, they couldn't help feeling concerned. \"Hey, you alright?\"","Gu Yun'an shook her head. \"I'm fine...\"","\"You don't look fine at all...\" The man wanted to say more but Gu Yun'an had already walked away.","She only had eyes for Shen Tang right now.","The man scratched his head in confusion and left.","Shen Tang had kept an eye on Gu Yun'an the whole time and naturally witnessed this scene too.","She couldn't help doubting if hiding her identity from Miao Miao had been a mistake.","If Miao Miao knew her monkey sister was actually Shen Tang, perhaps she wouldn't be so conflicted?","Or she might outright reject Zhou Qinglian's request.","Of course, these were just Shen Tang's guesses.","The truth was she had gotten to know Miao Miao over a very short time, far less than her history with Zhou Qinglian.","She really wasn't sure whose side Miao Miao would take if her identity was exposed.","After all, they did have a long friendship. Shen Tang didn't want to see the two of them fall out either.","\"Big brother, sister-in-law.\" Gu Yun'an murmured.","\"You look very pale. Are you feeling unwell?\"","Gu Yun'an clenched the hem of her dress nervously. \"No, I'm not unwell, just a little tired.\"","\"I see. Make sure to rest up.\"","\"Okay...\"","After speaking, Gu Yun'an sat down not far away, looking very troubled.","Seeing her state, Shen Tang couldn't help feeling distressed.","Just what was Zhou Qinglian making her do? It seemed too harsh.","As more and more people came over to chat, Shen Tang eventually had no time to think about anything else. Her mind was completely occupied with socializing.","This was so tiring. Shen Tang felt like her face would freeze from all the smiling.","Just then, a server came up beside her and whispered something to her. Shen Tang's expression changed instantly.","\"Alright, I'll head over now.\""]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Make This Reputation Real.","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian frowned as he looked over, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Nothing.\"","Shen Tang knitted her brows, \"She said Yun'an was looking for me and wanted me to go over alone, that she had something to discuss.\"","This excuse was really too fake, truly, anyone with eyes could tell something was amiss.","\"I'll go with you!\" Gu Huaian was worried.","To be honest, the wealthy had more despicable means, he couldn't let Shen Tang take the risk.","Shen Tang shook her head, \"I'll go myself, I actually want to see what will happen.\"","Gu Huaian was a bit helpless, seeing that Shen Tang had made up her mind, he could only let her go.","\"I'll have someone secretly follow you, remember, be careful and don't be rash.\"","\"Don't worry, don't worry, relax.\"","Shen Tang went to the place the waiter had just mentioned - the small garden.","Next to the garden was a swimming pool, Shen Tang immediately thought of certain scheming plotlines from novels, and unconsciously distanced herself a bit.","After a while, Gu Yun'an came out.","Shen Tang's eyes flashed with disappointment, Meow Meow had decided to make a move against her after all?","\"You were looking for me?\"","\"I...\"","Gu Yun'an hesitated for a moment, then said, \"Sis...Sister-in-law, I want to ask you a question.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Are you and my elder brother truly in love with each other?\"","Caught off guard by this question, Shen Tang was stunned for a moment, but quickly reacted.","\"What kind of ridiculous question is that, if we weren't truly in love why would we get married?\"","Shen Tang automatically ignored the previous agreement to get married.","Gu Yun'an's gaze gradually became firm, \"Since you two truly love each other, then I wish you happiness.\"","Having said that, she turned and left.","Shen Tang was dumbfounded, that was it?","Zhou Qinglian, hiding in the shadows, saw this and gritted her teeth. This Gu Yun'an really was useless.","\"I knew I couldn't rely on her.\"","The girl next to her coldly laughed, \"Don't worry, leave it to me.\"","She rushed out and ran to Shen Tang's side, speaking excitedly, \"Oh my! Aren't you the actress Shen Tang?\"","Shen Tang had never seen the person before her and nodded, \"That's me.\"","\"You don't look quite the same as online, have you had plastic surgery?\"","Although it was secluded here, it wasn't completely deserted.","Hearing this, several gazes turned to look at Shen Tang.","Shen Tang crossed her arms over her chest, \"Sorry, but this is the face my mom gave me. You on the other hand, the fake chin doesn't look natural at all, the doctor's skills don't seem great.\"","The woman reflexively touched her chin. Noticing people looking over, her expression instantly changed.","\"This is also the face my mom gave me, what are you talking about?\"","\"Oh? Is that so? Sorry, I didn't notice.\" While she spoke as such, her words contained no trace of feeling bad.","The girl's eyes flashed as she walked closer to Shen Tang while speaking, \"It's fine, I don't mind...\"","As she spoke, she acted as if pushing Shen Tang. Shen Tang reflexively moved to block her hand.","The woman then grinned evilly and leaned back, jumping into the pool.","From a distance, it looked as if Shen Tang had pushed her in.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She had thought the woman wanted to push her in, she didn't expect her to jump in herself.","To be honest, Shen Tang didn't really understand this kind of using self-harm to frame others.","She still cherished her own body very much.","Especially now during autumn, it was cold. Just looking at it made Shen Tang feel cold.","This woman was really desperate.","The woman floundered in the water, \"Help!\"","\"He...Help!\"","\"I can't swim!\"","Shen Tang just watched coldly as people around noticed what was happening and hurriedly went to rescue the woman.","After being saved, the woman, wrapped in a bathrobe, shivered violently, her wet hair clinging together in strands, looking extremely pitiful.","Her makeup was untouched, she must have used waterproof makeup.","Zhou Qinglian rushed over and grabbed her in an embrace. Her eyes were red as she anxiously asked, \"YOYO, are you alright?\"","\"I...I'm fine...cough cough cough!\"","Seeing this, Zhou Qinglian looked at Shen Tang resentfully and questioned, \"I don't know what great enmity YOYO has with you that you would harm her like this. Don't you know she can't swim? You're practically trying to kill her!\"","Shen Tang uttered an \"oh\", \"She jumped in herself, what does it have to do with me?\"","\"Nonsense! You clearly pushed me in!\" The woman named YOYO said.","\"Are you sure I pushed you in?\" Shen Tang raised a brow.","YOYO was unsure why Shen Tang asked this, but they had investigated beforehand, there were no cameras here that could have seen what happened just now.","So she nodded, \"That's right, I admit I spoke rudely to you earlier, but you didn't have to push me into the pool...\"","Whispers arose from the surroundings, but these were all people concerned about face. No one directly pointed fingers, as for what was said behind backs, no one knew.","Soon after, Gu Huaian also came over.","Gu Yun'an followed behind him like a quail, glancing at Shen Tang before guiltily lowering her head.","\"What happened?\"","Just as Shen Tang was about to speak, Zhou Qinglian choked up with tears hanging on her face, seemingly about to fall. She looked extremely pitiful.","\"Nothing much, it's unrelated to Miss Shen. YOYO was rude first, even getting pushed into the pool is not a big deal.\"","YOYO pursed her lips with red-rimmed eyes, turning her head away. \"It's all my fault for angering Miss Shen...\"","Shen Tang let out a cold laugh. These two sang perfectly in harmony.","Too bad...","\"Oh? Your meaning is that Tang Tang pushed her in?\"","YOYO nodded, then hurriedly shook her head, stealing a timid glance at Shen Tang. \"No...it wasn't Miss Shen who pushed me, I jumped in myself...\"","This reaction seemed to further confirm Shen Tang had done it.","Shen Tang just watched their performance quietly.","It was apparent many wanted to say something but didn't dare to with Gu Huaian present.","Zhou Qinglian also noticed something was off. This was different from what they had imagined.","Not a single person was speaking up for them.","She looked at Gu Yun'an, wanting her to help explain, but she kept her head lowered the entire time, not even glancing up.","No one knew what was so interesting on the ground that had her full attention.","Zhou Qinglian blinked and her tears instantly fell. \"Let's just leave this matter. YOYO, hurry and apologize to Miss Shen.\"","YOYO sniffed and then sneezed before dully saying, \"Sorry.\"","Gu Huaian looked towards the crowd and Cen Songbai walked out. He waved his phone, \"Funny how I happened to be filming a video here and accidentally recorded some interesting things.\"","YOYO and Zhou Qinglian's expressions changed at the same time.","Zhou Qinglian's facial control was still better than YOYO's. She quickly regained her composure, \"YOYO is catching a cold. I'll take her to change clothes first, please excuse us.\"","Saying so, she moved to support YOYO and leave.","Shen Tang blocked their path, \"Why the rush to leave? Weren't you saying I pushed you down? How disappointing if it's not confirmed.\"","YOYO hastily retreated a step back, \"What are you trying to do?\"","Shen Tang sinisterly laughed, \"Naturally, to confirm this notoriety!\""]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Who told you to Set Me Up","paragraphs":["YOYO was startled.","She had also heard of Shen Tang's previous reputation for being very strong. YOYO was so skinny herself that she was not even as strong as Shen Tang's two fists.","However, she glanced around. There were so many people here that she did not believe Shen Tang would actually do that.","Shen Tang could not possibly disregard her reputation entirely.","But she really did disregard it!","YOYO did not dodge, so Shen Tang grabbed her collar and walked towards the swimming pool.","YOYO was so frightened she was dumbstruck. \"What are you doing? Let me go!\"","Zhou Qinglian also tried to pull them back, but the two women's strength compared to Shen Tang's was like a mantis trying to stop a chariot. They were still uncontrollably getting closer and closer to the pool.","This move really frightened many people.","\"Stop her quickly!\"","\"This... isn't necessary...\"","\"President Gu, are you just going to watch this happen to your wife?\"","Perhaps not expecting Gu Huaian to say such words, the others did not know whether they should step forward to stop it or not.","If they got involved, and he resented them, what would happen?","They had come here to meet business partners, not to make enemies.","So for a moment, no one stepped forward to help.","Zhou Qinglian was furious inside, hating the indifference of the people around her, and afraid that she would be implicated as well.","If Shen Tang took the opportunity to push her in too, it would be so embarrassing.","YOYO was also scared to death, clinging tightly to Zhou Qinglian and Shen Tang's arms and not letting go.","At the edge of the pool, YOYO trembled uncontrollably. \"I was wrong, I really was wrong. I shouldn't have falsely accused you. Don't throw me in...\"","She really could not swim. She had not been faking when she nearly drowned before. She had truly almost drowned.","But she had not been too afraid earlier since people had been arranged nearby just in case.","However, the sensation of nearly drowning had still left her with some psychological trauma. She was genuinely very afraid of being tossed in by Shen Tang.","Now no one was helping, so she worried that if she was thrown in this time, no one would come to save her and she might really drown!","She was truly frightened now.","The people around had not expected this to be the truth. They had assumed Shen Tang pushed the girl in.","Cen Songbai gave a cold snort. \"See? I said she fell in herself.\"","\"Tsk!\"","Perhaps because YOYO had been holding on too tightly, Zhou Qinglian cried out in pain on reflex and pushed her a little. YOYO almost fell in, but was grabbed by one of Shen Tang's arms and pulled back up.","That's right, just one arm.","\"Wow!\"","The people around were shocked.","\"She's so strong!\"","\"Or is it that the girl is too skinny...\"","\"I think so too, I could also do that.\"","Seeing the skinny physique of the speaker, Cen Songbai rolled his eyes. As if you could!","Zhou Qinglian apologized with reddened eyes, \"I'm sorry, YOYO. I didn't mean it. You were holding too tight just now...\"","As she spoke, she deliberately revealed the red marks on her arm.","YOYO had been a little angry earlier, but seeing Zhou Qinglian like this, her anger dissipated.","\"It's nothing, Sister Lian. I'm not blaming you.\"","\"I'm saying...\"","Shen Tang interrupted the two people's dramatics. \"Did you forget something?\"","\"Either confess properly, or I'll take the villain's name.\"","Now that she had already revealed this much, YOYO no longer concealed anything. She closed her eyes and shouted loudly, \"That's right, it was me. No one instructed me. I deliberately framed you and jumped in myself. I'm sorry, alright?\"","\"Who told you to frame me?\"","\"No, no one. I just don't like you. What right does an infamous zero-ranked celebrity like you have to attend the same banquet as us?\"","Hearing these words, Gu Huaian's expression suddenly darkened, as if brewing a storm.","To be honest, Shen Tang was not actually that angry. But hearing her say this, she did not believe it.","\"I don't even know you. Just because you don't like me you deliberately jumped into the water to frame me? Could your reason be any more far-fetched?\"","YOYO glanced at Zhou Qinglian, but said nothing.","\"That's right, it was just me. No one instructed me.\"","Some peacemakers felt Shen Tang's interrogation-like behavior was going too far. One of them stepped forward and said, \"Everyone, give me some face on this matter and just let it go. Miss Shen was not harmed in the end, and this young lady has suffered the consequences of her own actions.\"","Shen Tang wanted to say: Who are you?","\"I think that's reasonable.\"","\"Yes, just leave it at that. One should be gracious when possible.\"","Gu Huaian raised his eyebrows. \"Oh? Is that what you all think?\"","The area fell silent again.","After all, none of them had as much standing as Gu Huaian here.","Many were even surprised that he had condescended to attend this banquet at all.","While the Zhou family was once comparable to the Gu family, now one had risen high and the other declined far.","Zhou Qinglian pressed her lips together, her eyes pleading, \"President Gu, could you give me some face on this and let YOYO go change her clothes first? It's so cold out, she'll catch a fever.\"","Gu Huaian looked at Shen Tang, who nodded. Only then did he relent, \"Go on then.\"","YOYO made her escape as if she had been granted amnesty, hurriedly wrapping her clothes around her as she ran off.","She had lost all face today. She would not be able to show herself in public after this.","Zhou Qinglian took one more look at them before following after YOYO.","The people around gradually dispersed as well. They did want to keep watching the lively scene, but not with Gu Huaian here. This was not a show they could watch.","In fact, Shen Tang had not truly intended to push her in.","Of course, if YOYO kept clinging and refusing to let go, who knew what would have happened.","About Cen Songbai's earlier words, Shen Tang asked in a low voice, \"Did you really get it on video?\"","\"I got it, but it wasn't clear.\"","Cen Songbai sighed. Otherwise he would have presented it already.","It was fortunate his sister-in-law was quite capable. If it were someone else, they might have had to swallow this injustice.","Gu Yun'an timidly walked up to Shen Tang and bowed deeply to her, saying softly, \"I'm sorry.\"","Gu Huaian's face was cold as he scolded, \"Louder! Haven't eaten?\"","\"I'm sorry!\"","As soon as Gu Yun'an said this, tears streamed down her face. No one knew if it was from fear, distress, or something else.","This was Shen Tang's first time seeing Gu Huaian act so fierce.","She wanted to take out a tissue, but realized the dress she was wearing had no pockets.","Cen Songbai quickly took out a handkerchief and handed it to Gu Yun'an. \"Use this if you don't mind.\"","Gu Yun'an accepted the handkerchief and wiped her tears.","Shen Tang then spoke, \"Why are you apologizing?\"","\"I...I knew their plans but didn't tell you...\"","\"I'm sorry. I didn't know what to do. Sister Lian had tried to commit suicide and been hospitalized because of me before. I was afraid she would try again, so I...I agreed to help her trap you to make my brother happy...\"","As Gu Yun'an spoke, she broke down bawling.","She knew she had done wrong, but also felt wronged because she had not actually done anything. Yet her brother still scolded her.","The reason Gu Huaian had come over so late was because he had been berating Gu Yun'an.","He was not a good-tempered man. Though he did not curse, his words were unbearable.","Gu Yun'an cried inconsolably. Shen Tang sighed and walked over to put her arm around her, gently comforting, \"Don't cry. I'm not blaming you.\"","If she had truly wanted to do something, Zhou Qinglian would not have come down personally just now.","Sometimes, having no one to offer comfort was better. Having someone comfort you made it harder to control your emotions.","Thinking that she was like this yet Shen Tang did not blame her, Gu Yun'an felt even more guilty and could not stop her tears.","With a plop, a snot bubble emerged.","She froze for a moment, noticing the barely suppressed smiles on the three faces before her. Gu Yun'an cried even louder.","She had truly embarrassed herself tremendously!"]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Let Me Think Again","paragraphs":["Cen Songbai fiddled with his ears. With such a loud voice, it would be a waste if she didn't go into singing. She could sing those female high notes.","There's currently a singing show called \"The Good Voice\" that's quite popular. It would be a loss if Gu Yun'an wasn't on it.","However, he considered himself a gentleman, so he didn't say anything. Instead, he sat there quietly and waited for her to finish crying.","After venting her emotions, Gu Yun'an also stopped crying.","Her face was a little red. Her handkerchief was also covered in snot and tears now, so she couldn't give it back.","\"I'll wash it clean and give it back to you.\"","\"No need, it's just a handkerchief.\"","To be honest, Cen Songbai was actually a little disgusted. It wasn't like he couldn't afford a new handkerchief.","\"Your makeup is messed up. Let's fix your makeup before we go in.\"","Hearing this, Gu Yun'an hurriedly opened her bag, took out a mirror, turned her back, and started reapplying her makeup.","Oh no, oh no, oh no! Her image!","What girl would cry so ugly like her!","She even had a snot bubble!","Shen Tang felt that she shouldn't keep hiding the fact that she was wearing a vest from him, so she was going to come clean.","But unexpectedly, Gu Huaian suddenly said, \"It's fine now, let's go in.\"","\"Oh...\"","As they walked, Shen Tang noticed there were more gazes looking her way, some were friendly while others were not. But she didn't care.","Outsiders' opinions had never affected her conscience.","And her conscience followed a famous quote - \"None of my business, none of your business.\"","She wasn't living for others to look at.","A slightly overweight middle-aged man walked over with a smiling face. \"President Gu, Madam Gu, my daughter made some mistakes just now. I've had her sent back already. Please forgive her.\"","Judging by this, the man should be YOYO's father.","\"It's nothing. Just ask her not to do this again in the future.\"","Shen Tang knew who the real culprit was behind the scenes. She just didn't expect that woman to be so stubborn - she still wouldn't expose Zhou Qinglian even at this point. It seemed like the two had a genuinely good relationship.","She wondered if YOYO's father knew that the elder Mr. Zhou had coerced him into doing his bidding outside.","\"Don't worry, I'll educate her properly when I get back.\"","\"Mm.\"","Seeing Gu Huaian nod, the visible relief on the man's face was visible to the naked eye.","\"Then I won't disturb President Gu anymore.\"","Not long after, Zhou Qinglian's father also came over.","He looked refined and cultured, with dark circles under his eyes - rather like he had overindulged himself. He also had a young and beautiful girl in his arms.","\"Huaian, long time no see.\"","Gu Huaian gave a faint smile that didn't reach his eyes.","\"Uncle Zhou.\"","The man's eyes lit up when he saw Shen Tang. \"Oh my, is this your girlfriend? She's so pretty.\"","Shen Tang suppressed the displeasure in her heart and greeted him.","Simply because the way he looked at her was too lustful - not the way an elder looks at a junior, but the way a man looks at a woman.","Gu Huaian took two steps forward to shield Shen Tang. \"Uncle Zhou, we have other matters to attend to, so we'll take our leave first.\"","Although he didn't really want them to leave so soon, he still felt somewhat intimidated by Gu Huaian, so he forced out an easygoing laugh. \"Let's catch up some other time then. By the way, have you seen Lianlian? Where has that girl run off to!\"","Apparently he was unaware of what had just transpired.","It was hard to say if he truly didn't know or if he was feigning ignorance.","\"We've seen her. We'll get going first.\" Gu Huaian said, then pulled Shen Tang by the hand and headed out.","Gu Yun'an and Cen Songbai followed closely behind.","As he watched their retreating backs, Zhou's facade slowly crumbled away and he spat in disdain.","...","YOYO had just taken a hot shower. Her head still felt faint and she suspected she might be running a fever.","Zhou Qinglian felt guilty. \"I'm sorry, YOYO. I didn't think she would actually—\"","\"I don't blame you. It was my choice to help you.\"","Hearing this, Zhou Qinglian's eyes instantly reddened. \"What do you mean by that?\"","\"Are you having regrets?\"","YOYO turned her face away without directly answering the question.","\"Didn't you notice how Gu Huaian was looking at Shen Tang?\"","Zhou Qinglian's expression changed instantly. How could she not have noticed!","Ever since Gu Huaian arrived, his eyes had been fixed on Shen Tang the entire time. The fondness in his eyes was something she had never seen before.","That's right - fondness.","She also felt that she probably didn't stand a chance anymore, but how would she know for sure if she didn't try?","She was unwilling, unwilling to just give up like this.","YOYO sighed. \"Sister Lian, please don't take this the wrong way, but I think you should just give up. President Gu, he... anyway, you have no chance.\"","Zhou Qinglian pursed her lips stubbornly.","After a period of silence, she finally spoke. \"You know my family circumstances. I have countless half-siblings. If I don't pave a way out for myself, I have no prospects for the second half of my life. Do you have the heart to watch me marry an old man, or go wash dishes for others?\"","YOYO's heart softened once more.","She had grown up together with Zhou Qinglian since childhood, and they had a deep bond. She also understood the messy affairs in the Zhou family.","If Zhou Qinglian didn't find a backer, her father would marry her off to further the family's interests.","The only other path was to forfeit her status and flee, condemning herself to a commoner's life of salt, oil, vinegar and tea for the next half of her life.","People like them were pampered and spoilt. They wouldn't be able to withstand such hardship. Just the thought of having to swallow chaff and vegetables in the future was even more unbearable than death.","\"So what are you planning to do?\"","Zhou Qinglian hesitated. \"Give me some time to think...\"","It seemed unlikely there would be any opportunities from Gu Huaian's side. The only option she could think of was to make a move against Shen Tang.","But Shen Tang's combat abilities were too high. She didn't follow conventions and was as slippery as a loach. Zhou Qinglian found it hard to get a good grasp of her.","Although she wasn't a good person, she still wouldn't go as far as to hire assassins for murder.","She had hit an impasse with this matter.","YOYO heaved another sigh. As a friend, she had already done all she could.","But Zhou Qinglian was clearly one who refused to turn back without driving up against the wall. She couldn't be persuaded, she really couldn't!","She only hoped that Zhou Qinglian wouldn't do anything irreparable."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: I got a Wife and forgot my Brother.","paragraphs":["The car arrived at the villa, and Gu Huaian got out of the car, looking at the two cars following behind with a furrowed brow.","He walked over with large strides, curved his index finger, and lightly tapped on the car window.","The window rolled down, and Cen Songbai's voice sounded puzzled, \"Brother Gu?\"","Gu Huaian spoke in a low voice, \"I'm home.\"","\"I know.\"","\"Aren't you going home?\"","\"It's been a while since I came here. I'll sit here for a while.\"","\"Don't you have your own home?\"","Cen Songbai: \"...\"","\"No, I've been busy all night. Don't you let me come in and sit for a while?\"","\"Did I make you busy?\"","Cen Songbai: \"...\"","Ha, men, they forget their brothers once they have a wife.","Indeed, brothers are like limbs, while women are like clothes. Limbs can be severed, but clothes cannot be lacking.","He declared a temporary break in their relationship!","\"Fine, I'm leaving.\"","After giving them the finger, the car sped away, very fast.","Gu Huaian walked over to Gu Yun'an's car and tapped on it as well.","The window rolled down, and before Gu Huaian could speak, Gu Yun'an said, \"No need to say it, I'm leaving now.\"","So funny, she didn't want to offend this cold and ruthless man right after being scolded.","Shen Tang, who had just gotten off the car and witnessed the whole scene, said, \"...\"","\"Why didn't you let them come in and rest for a while?\"","\"They're in the way.\"","Gu Huaian held Shen Tang's hand and walked towards the house. \"It's been a long time since we've seen each other. I don't want to stay with them.\"","Shen Tang counted on her fingers and realized it hadn't been that long.","Besides, don't they video chat every night?","Inside the house, Tao Sister heard the sound of the car and ran out. Her body was trembling, looking extremely adorable.","\"Madam, you're finally back!\"","\"Tao Sister!\" Shen Tang let go of Gu Huaian's hand and rushed over. The two embraced each other.","Tao Sister had a scent of milk on her, and Shen Tang sniffed it. \"Tao Sister, did you make something delicious again?\"","\"Well, that's why they say it's better to be early than to be on time. I just made a dessert. It's something new I learned. Madam, would you like to try it?\"","\"Yes!\"","Hearing there was food, Shen Tang's eyes lit up.","She hadn't eaten much at the banquet just now, afraid that eating too much would make her belly bulge and stretch her clothes.","Now that she was home, she could eat to her heart's content.","The two held hands and entered the house, leaving Gu Huaian standing in place.","Uncle He appeared out of nowhere, \"Aren't you going in, sir?\"","\"Go in.\"","Gu Huaian pinched his brow. He had forgotten that there were people at home. He shouldn't have come here; he should have gone to the residence next to his company. That way, it would be their own little world, and no one would disturb them.","But after he went in and saw how happy Shen Tang was, he felt that coming back here wasn't wrong either.","Shen Tang would rest for one night and then rush back to the film set to continue shooting. Fortunately, they were in the final stages.","In addition, the TV drama she had previously filmed was about to be released. Shen Tang helped promote it on Weibo, and the stills from the drama became a hot topic.","She casually scrolled through the comments, most of them praising her beauty, but of course, there were also some negative comments, such as:","\"No, isn't the internet's ability to forget so fast? Does no one remember who Shen Tang used to be?\"","\"I know the reason, but I dare not say it, afraid of being sued, hehe.\"","\"Her face seems different from before, did she get plastic surgery?\"","Shen Tang glanced briefly and looked away. It didn't matter, love is love. Anyway, she would retire from the entertainment industry after finishing this film.","She calmly turned off her phone and received a WeChat message from Miao Miao.","\"Miao Miao: Sister Monkey, I think I did something wrong...\"","Shen Tang thought about revealing her true identity again, thinking about the interruption by Gu Huaian that night, she couldn't figure out if it was intentional or unintentional.","Moreover, Miao Miao seemed to treat her as a confidante, and it would be awkward to clarify her identity now.","So, Shen Tang played the role of a caring older sister and began to console her.","She was always good at coaxing children and had a lot of patience, which quickly helped Miao Miao recover.","The door was knocked loudly.","Yuan Yuan ran over and opened the door, only to see Pei Kesong rushing in anxiously.","\"Where's Shen Tang?\"","\"She's in the room...\"","Before Yuan Yuan could finish her sentence, Pei Kesong walked quickly to the bedroom and took off Shen Tang's earphones.","\"Oh, my young miss, it's so late, and you're still playing with your phone!\"","\"What's wrong?\"","Pei Kesong handed her the phone, \"See for yourself.\"","Shen Tang quickly read through it. It turned out that someone had posted the video of her trying to throw YOYO into the pool.","The video had no sound, but it showed YOYO with a pale face begging for mercy, while she remained indifferent.","No, it had been so long, why was it only now being posted online? Who did it? Are they just bored?","This matter could be easily explained. Shen Tang felt that it was unlikely to be Zhou Qinglian and the others who posted it because there was no reason for them to do so.","Looking at the comments section, some said she was bullying others with her strength, while others believed that one should not easily comment since the real situation might be different.","Shen Tang nodded secretly. Yes, this group of netizens actually used their brains and were not influenced by marketing tactics.","\"Did you really throw her into the pool?\" Pei Kesong asked with concern.","Shen Tang shook her head, \"I didn't succeed.\"","\"Wait, what do you mean by 'didn't succeed'?\"","\"Literal meaning, I wanted to throw her in, but I didn't succeed.\"","Pei Kesong covered her chest and staggered back a few steps, \"Sis, why did you want to throw her in?\"","Shen Tang explained the cause and effect, and Pei Kesong's expression changed instantly, \"I see, then it's fine.\"","\"You're not blaming me?\" Her change of expression was quite fast, Shen Tang even suspected that she had learned Sichuan Opera face-changing.","\"If someone doesn't offend me, I won't offend them. She bullied you first, so even if you really threw her in, it wouldn't be excessive.\"","\"That's right!\"","Yuan Yuan, who had been eavesdropping at the door, pushed it open and walked in, looking disgruntled, \"That person is so despicable, actually framing someone like this. Even in novels, they wouldn't dare to write like this!\"","Shen Tang, who had read countless novels on the online literature platform, said that novels actually dared to write like this.","\"Cough, she tried to steal the chicken but didn't get the rice, so there's no need for you to be angry.\"","Yuan Yuan sighed and sat on the sofa, supporting her face with her hands, \"Sister Tang Tang, you must be the protagonist of this world, why are there so many people trying to harm you?\"","Ever since she arrived, various things have been happening one after another, constantly coming to her door.","Shen Tang felt a little guilty. Could it be possible that it was because she meddled too much in other people's affairs?","Except for Zhou Qinglian, who was concerned about Gu Huaian, it seemed like all the other incidents were caused by her own actions.","Of course, she didn't think she had done anything wrong.","Now Pei Kesong has just signed two new artists, which is even more troublesome than Shen Tang. She glanced at her watch and said,","\"I also need to go and check on your junior martial brother. I heard he was bullied and someone maliciously poured paint into the water.\"","Shen Tang stood up abruptly, \"What the hell! This could be fatal! Who did it?\"","\"I don't know. I'll go and take a look.\"","\"I'll go with you!\"","Shen Tang started changing her clothes. Although she wasn't very familiar with this junior martial brother, she could tell from their few encounters that he was a well-behaved person.","He was still a newcomer, and he didn't have many good resources in his hands. He only had a lukewarm variety show. Who could he have offended?","It's just too wicked for someone to pour paint into his water!"]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: Look like it","paragraphs":["\"If Sister Tang is going, then I will go too,\" Yuan Yuan said.","In the end, all three of them went.","The newly debuted junior apprentice was named Shen Yu. Coincidentally, he had the same surname as Shen Tang.","The group took a car to the hospital. Shen Yu was lying in bed looking listless.","Seeing them come in, his eyes lit up. \"Sister Pei, Sister Tang! Why are you here?!\"","Pei Kesong rolled her eyes in annoyance. \"You've been bullied into the hospital, how could I not come?\"","The reason she didn't come directly was because it wasn't too serious. He had only taken one sip before realizing something was wrong and went to the hospital to get his stomach pumped.","Plus she happened to be passing by Shen Tang's place, so there was no rush.","She sighed. \"Did you call the police?\"","Shen Yu nodded: \"I called the police. They've already gone to investigate.\"","Shen Tang clicked her tongue. \"Do you know who it was?\"","\"I don't know yet, but there are only two people who don't get along with me. I just don't know if they'll be able to find out.\"","Just then, Yuan Yuan suddenly said, \"Hey? Your eyes look pretty similar!\"","Hearing this, Pei Kesong looked at them both and nodded in agreement. \"You're right, I didn't notice before, but they do look quite similar, and the ears too.\"","\"We look alike?\" Shen Tang looked left and right, then took out her phone and looked at it. Her heart skipped a beat and she jokingly said, \"Hahaha, maybe we're no more than five generations apart!\"","To be honest, covering the lower half of their faces, they did look quite similar. Shen Tang couldn't help but wonder if he was related to her birth parents.","But when she thought about it, that was unlikely. The world is so big, how could she just happen to meet him so easily?","Shen Yu furrowed his brows, lost in thought.","Pei Kesong said with a laugh, \"What, do you really have a long lost sister?\"","Unexpectedly, Shen Yu nodded.","\"I do have a long lost older sister. She's my aunt's daughter. She went missing not long after she was born. My family doesn't talk about it. I don't know the details either.\"","Shen Tang's heart skipped a beat. This reminded her of the grandmother she had met at the hospital who had mistaken her for someone else.","\"Your aunt wouldn't happen to be called Xiu Xiu, would she?\"","Shen Yu looked up sharply in disbelief. \"How did you know? My aunt is called Shen Xiu. Don't tell me you really are—”","\"No no no, don't get the wrong idea. I met an old lady in the hospital who called me Xiu Xiu...\" Shen Tang briefly recounted what happened that day.","Shen Yu sighed. \"If I'm not mistaken, that was my grandmother.\"","Pei Kesong stroked her chin. \"I think Shen Tang might really be your sister. Do you have a photo of your aunt?\"","\"No, but I can go back and look for one.\"","He started to get out of bed, but Shen Tang quickly pressed him back down. \"Alright, don't move yet. There's no rush for this matter. Get better first.\"","Shen Yu grinned and said softly, \"Actually it's not too serious, but I don't plan to take it lightly. I'm deliberately staying at the hospital for a few more days.\"","\"Good boy, well done!\" Shen Tang gave him a thumbs up.","Shen Yu rubbed his head. \"No no, I learned it all from you!\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","Shen Yu looked at Pei Kesong, \"I just joined the company and Sister Pei told me all about your heroic deeds. I decided to learn from you and become a tr—perfect person!\"","\"I heard that word you didn't finish saying.\" Shen Tang glared at him.","What was he going to say? Troublemaker? Sh*t stirrer?","She didn't want to know the answer. Either one was no good, it was just a matter of which was more vulgar.","Shen Yu gave an awkward laugh. \"That's not important...\"","Since he was fine, Shen Tang was going to head back and continue filming.","On the way back, she eagerly told Gu Huaian about it.","\"I don't know if we're really related, but it would be great if we were. Then I wouldn't be alone in this world...\" Shen Tang wanted to know who her birth parents were so badly. She had always wanted to know one thing: Was she abandoned or was it an accident?","She thought she would never know the answer in her lifetime, but things had taken an unexpected turn. However, Shen Tang didn't dare get her hopes up too high. The higher the hopes, the greater the disappointment.","The distress in Gu Huaian's eyes was about to spill over. \"Don't worry, I'll investigate it for you.\"","\"Thanks for your trouble then!\"","They could directly do a DNA test, but Shen Tang was a little afraid it would be a waste of effort. Also, showing up unannounced to claim kinship would be a bit inappropriate.","Besides, the elderly woman who was likely her grandmother probably couldn't handle the shock.","Anyway, she had waited this long, so a bit more time made no difference. She could afford to wait.","Now that there was a lead, investigating the past would be easier.","When Shen Tang returned, she only had one scene to film, but she NGed several times because her mind wandered.","The director really wanted to curse, but seeing how poor Shen Tang's complexion was, he was also a bit worried.","\"If you're not feeling well, rest first. We can film this scene later.\"","Shen Tang pulled herself together. \"Sorry, let me try again.\"","She couldn't let others take the fall for her mistakes.","NGing twice in a row was already very apologetic. She couldn't delay filming any further.","Her co-star was Qi Yue’s nephew, Tang Shuqing. He didn't really mind.","While the crew was preparing, he sidled up next to Shen Tang and softly asked, \"Sister Tang, are you okay?\"","\"I'm fine. And how many times do I have tell you, don't call me Sister Tang. That makes us unequal. Call me Auntie.\"","Tang Shuqing: \"......\"","\"Go on, call me.\"","\"There's barely any age difference between us.\"","\"You and Qi Yue don't have much of an age difference either. Your auntie and I are best friends. If you don't call me that, I'll tell her you bullied me.\"","Tang Shuqing: \"......\"","Left with no choice, he vaguely called out, \"Auntie.\"","\"Heehee~\" Shen Tang nearly burst out laughing. She wasn't trying to take advantage of him, she just didn't want to seem older than Qi Yue.","The joking around helped restore Shen Tang to her usual self. She passed in one take.","Her scenes were done for the day, but Tang Shuqing still had more to film.","As she was leaving, Shen Tang lightly patted him on the shoulder, \"Nephew, keep at it!\"","Tang Shuqing sucked in a breath of air and rubbed his shoulder.","Watching Shen Tang bounce away, he was filled with confusion. Just how much strength did she use!"]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: She Stole It All.","paragraphs":["With Gu Huaian's help, the investigation progressed exceptionally quickly.","Shen Tang was basically Shen Yu's lost older sister. Judging from the photo, she looked exactly like Shen Yu's aunt, so it was no wonder she was mistaken for her.","The next steps would be easy to handle. They just needed to verify it with a DNA test together with Shen's family.","That day, Shen Tang took a day off and arrived at Gu Hospital early to wait.","She looked composed on the surface, but was actually very nervous deep down.","She couldn't help but start imagining what her relatives all looked like, whether their personalities were good, and whether they would accept her and like her.","Gu Huaian rushed over hurriedly from the other side, still looking exhausted after working all night.","Apparently, he had pulled an all-nighter to clear his schedule for today.","Gu Huaian grabbed Shen Tang's hand and said gently, \"Don't be afraid.\"","\"I'm a little worried...\"","She didn't have to say it out loud. Gu Huaian had already heard all of Shen Tang's uneasiness loud and clear.","\"Don't worry. I've already investigated. Most of the Shen family are good people.\"","If they had extremely bad characters, he wouldn't have agreed to let her find her family.","Shen Tang sighed, \"I hope so...\"","After waiting a while longer, shuffling footsteps sounded from across the hallway. Shen Tang took a deep breath and looked over.","A middle-aged couple and Shen Yu came over together. The man resembled Shen Yu to some extent, which also meant he resembled Shen Tang as well.","The woman also looked at her with maternal love on her face.","After the man saw Shen Tang's face clearly, his eyes instantly turned red. \"Like, so alike...\"","\"Shuqin, doesn't she look exactly like Xiuxiu?\"","The middle-aged woman also nodded with tears in her eyes, \"Very much so. Poor child, you've suffered these years...\"","The woman held Shen Tang's hand and patted it gently.","For some reason, just that one gesture made a surge of emotions well up in Shen Tang, suddenly making her want to cry.","She forced out a smile. \"Uncle, auntie, we—\"","\"Call me uncle. I'm your uncle!\" the man said.","Shen Tang hesitated a little. \"We haven't done the test yet...\"","\"No test is needed. I know you're my sister's daughter. You might not know, but you look exactly like her.\"","The man's hands trembled as he took out an old photo from his pocket and handed it to Shen Tang. \"Look, aren't you two exactly alike?\"","Shen Tang accepted the photo and examined it carefully.","The woman in the photo did look very similar to Shen Tang. Wearing a cheongsam, holding a paper umbrella, smiling charmingly at the camera—it was clear she had been a great beauty.","To be precise, Shen Tang wasn't quite as good-looking as her.","A sour feeling suddenly welled up in her heart, and her throat felt a little choked up. Shen Tang blinked, trying to keep the tears at bay.","She gently caressed the photo. Was this her mother?","She was so beautiful.","\"How did she...\"","\"Ah, it's a long story...\"","Although Shen Yu was also curious, there were more important things to do right now. He tactfully said:","\"Mom, Dad, let's catch up later. Should we get the test done first?\"","The man hastily nodded. \"You're right, let's do the test first.\"","It was also at this time that they finally noticed Gu Huaian's presence. They briefly greeted him, then started the testing process.","The waiting time for the results was quite long. The group didn't stay at the hospital, but went to a private room at a hotel instead.","In Shen Boyuan's—Shen Tang's uncle's—account, Shen Tang heard a tragic story.","The Shen family was a scholarly family, and Shen Xiuxiu was their one precious daughter whom they doted on dearly.","When she started college, Shen Xiuxiu met Wei Xuan. It was like she was bewitched—she started becoming rebellious and insisted on being with him.","Her family didn't forbid her from dating, but after investigating Wei Xuan, they found out he was from a rural village.","Of course, that itself wasn't a big issue.","The main problem was that he had five older sisters who had all dropped out of school early to get married, and their earnings went to subsidizing him as the only son.","His family practiced heavy son preference and daughter discrimination. He also had a girlfriend back in his hometown whom he had gotten pregnant in high school.","But Shen Xiuxiu didn't believe any of it at all. She didn't know if Wei Xuan had brainwashed her, but she felt it was all deliberately fabricated by her family because they looked down on Wei Xuan's background.","In Shen Xiuxiu's eyes, the bowl of plain congee Wei Xuan had personally cooked for her and his attentive caring words allowed her to experience what true love was.","When she heard this part, Shen Tang's expression had already changed.","What? Just a bowl of congee counted as true love?","Her mother was really too naive!","Glancing to the side, Shen Yu's expression was also hard to articulate, but Shen Xiuxiu was still an elder after all so he didn't have the right to criticize.","Shen Yu's mother also helplessly shook her head. She had already married Shen Boyuan back then, so she naturally also knew how ugly things had become in the family.","In the end, Shen Xiuxiu had gotten pregnant out of wedlock.","The Shen family's intention was to make her get an abortion, but with Wei Xuan's goading, Shen Xiuxiu actually ran away from home instead.","When she left, she didn't take a single valuable belonging from the house. All she left behind was a letter.","Shen Tang's grandmother fell ill immediately. She worried all day long, unable to eat or sleep well, and regretted intensely that she hadn't agreed to her daughter's relationship, which led to her running away.","Shen Tang opened her mouth, wanting to say something, but swallowed the words back down in the end.","\"What happened next?\"","A regretful expression appeared on Shen Boyuan's face, and his tone was very heavy. \"At first, we thought she wouldn't be able to endure the hardship and would come back soon. But there was no news at all.","When we went to her university, we discovered she had stopped going to class. That was when we realized something was wrong. We hurriedly started looking everywhere for her, but only found out she had left with Wei Xuan. No one knew where they went.","We even went to Wei Xuan's hometown to look, but they weren't there either.\"","\"Then a year passed, and suddenly we received a call from Xiuxiu. She gave us an address and cried for us to go get her. We immediately set off, but by the time we arrived, she had already...\"","Shen Boyuan turned his face away, covering it as he wept.","Sometimes he couldn't help but think that if they had been just a little faster, his sister might not have died.","Shen Yu's mother gently patted Shen Boyuan's back to comfort him.","She said softly, \"When we arrived, we discovered your mother looked much more haggard than before, and her body was covered in bruises from long-term abuse. This time, she had been beaten in the head and was already on the brink of death when a neighbor sent her to the hospital.\"","\"We went to their home to look for Wei Xuan and the child, but discovered he had vanished without a trace, and you were gone too. Over a decade has passed in the blink of an eye, yet here you are before us again.\"","Shen Tang suddenly felt a little guilty. She had Wei Xuan's blood flowing in her veins—she felt so filthy...","She could never have dreamed she had such a vicious father. Her mother had actually been...","Gu Huaian put his arm around her. \"Tangtang, he and you are two separate individuals. This has nothing to do with you.\"","Shen Yu's mother also quickly added, \"Poor child, don't think too much. You're just an innocent child. You are one of our Shen family, unrelated to that man.\"","\"That's right, you're my sister's child, unrelated to that man, that scum. You must not overthink this.\"","\"That's right, sister...\"","Seeing how much they genuinely cared about her, it made Shen Tang want to cry even more.","Having been alone for two lifetimes, she never expected that coming here would give her a family too.","But...","Shen Tang lowered her eyes. All this was stolen by her.","These were the relatives of the original body, not hers..."]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: Know one's Relatives","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian always had a conjecture that he long understood from Shen Tang's inner voice that her appearance was exactly the same as this \"Shen Tang\". Could it be that they were originally the same person?","However, he couldn't say this, because there was no way to explain how he knew about this matter.","If Shen Tang knew he could always hear her inner voice, his wife would probably be gone.","After sitting together for a day and chatting about many things, they finally asked about the relationship between Shen Tang and Gu Huaian.","\"Tangtang, are you two...dating?\"","Although the Shen family was a family of scholars and didn't pay attention to things online, they were also very familiar with Gu Huaian, who had taken the Gu family business to the next level by himself, and was also ranked among the top of the Forbes rich list.","Plus he didn't have any scandals in his daily life, he was the fifth son of a diamond king that many girls liked.","But Gu Huaian's methods in the business field were quite ruthless, and his mind was unfathomable.","Shen Boyuan still didn't want Shen Tang to marry him.","He hoped she could find a simple man.","Of course, the premise was that Shen Tang herself was willing.","In the end, they were just outsiders with a blood relationship, just making a suggestion.","Shen Tang was a little shy and glanced at Gu Huaian, \"Yes, we are dating.\"","As for that contract, she didn't know what made her not mention it.","Maybe she was afraid of being looked down upon. After all, she was really blind to money at first.","Of course, if she was given another chance, she would still agree. After all, Gu Huaian had given her too much, hehehe~","Shen Boyuan's expression was somewhat tangled. Gu Huaian said, \"I plan to spend my whole life with Tangtang. I will treat her well.\"","Shen Boyuan snorted. What he hated most was hearing this.","The scumbag who deceived his sister back then said things more pleasing than anything.","Gu Huaian was about to explain when his phone suddenly rang. The results were out.","Since the hospital was not far from where they were, they arrived after a few minutes.","The doctor smiled and said, \"Congratulations, you two do have a blood relationship.\"","Shen Boyuan, a grown man, instantly shed tears, \"I knew it, I knew it...\"","He leaned on his wife's shoulder like a big bird relying on a person, crying and trembling, pitiful yet amusing.","Shen Yu was extremely excited. \"I didn't expect sister Tangtang to really be my sister. Do you want to come and live in my house? You don't know, we've always kept your room and auntie's room at home.\"","Shen Tang was stunned for a moment. She hadn't thought about this issue and was somewhat confused for a while.","Shen Yu's mother said with a smile, \"I also hope you can come home and get to know the place. We’re one family from now on, and there will always be a place for you at home. Of course, it would be best if you could move back.\"","Shen Boyuan also suddenly thought of this and said, \"That's right, Tangtang, where are you living now? Why don't you just move back? It’s not safe for you young girls to live alone outside.\"","Shen Tang blinked.","Oh my god, how could she tactfully explain that she was not living alone?","She didn't say she was already married just now, and it wasn't good to say she wasn't living alone now. She couldn't possibly say she was cohabiting before marriage now.","Judging from the Shen family’s ways, she vaguely felt they might not accept this very well.","Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian for help.","Gu Huaian stepped forward. He would never let Shen Tang move back to the Shen family house. Staying for a couple days was fine, but moving out was out of the question.","She was his wife. It made no sense for her not to live in their home and to live in someone else's house instead.","\"Uncle Shen, the thing is, Tangtang is living in my vacant house now, and I live in—\"","\"What?! Living in your house? No, no, no!\" Shen Boyuan shook his head as soon as he heard half of it.","How could it be okay for a young maiden like Tangtang to live in a grown man's house? What's more, a deep-minded old man.","On the other hand, Shen Yu’s mother, who was Shen Tang’s aunt, seemed to be pondering, \"It's normal for young people in love to live together.\"","\"What’s normal about it? It’s not normal at all. What if she gets taken advantage of?\"","\"Um...\" Gu Huaian tried to explain.","Shen Boyuan held Shen Tang's hand and earnestly said, \"Tangtang, come home. Your grandmother misses you too. Oh right, she’s sick now and can’t take stimulation. Why don’t I bring her over now? She still keeps muttering about your mother and you.\"","Shen Tang's heart instantly softened and she nodded, \"Okay.\"","Shen Yu jumped for joy, \"Yay! Sister sister sister sister, let’s go home.\"","Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian a little guilty, \"Then I'll go stay for a few days first and come back later.\"","What could Gu Huaian say?","He sighed and nodded lightly.","Shen Boyuan glanced at him, \"What do you mean come back later? That place is your home. You can stay as long as you like. If anyone bullies you, just tell me or your brother and let him fight back for you.\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He had a bad feeling about this.","Shen Tang smiled and patted Shen Yu on the shoulder, \"Little brother, you have to protect your sister well in the future.\"","Shen Yu bared his teeth in pain, \"Sister sister, take your hand away.\"","\"How are you this weak?\" Shen Boyuan couldn't stand watching, \"I told you long ago not to enter the entertainment industry. What kind of good people are there? You've only been in the industry for a short time and you're already this weak.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She looked at him in surprise. Could her uncle still not know she was a poorly reputed eighteenth-tier female celebrity?","Shen Yu quickly explained, \"Dad, what are you talking about? I'm not weak! Sister Tangtang is just too strong!\"","\"Yes, yes, you're not weak.\" Shen Boyuan didn't believe him at all. Right in front of Shen Yu, he turned to discuss with his wife to cook some medicinal food tonight to nourish the body.","Shen Yu was exasperated. How could he explain that he really wasn't weak?","Shen Tang asked in a low voice, \"Does Uncle know about me?\"","Shen Yu shook his head, \"They don't pay attention to the entertainment industry. Otherwise, with the frequency you become a hot search topic, they would have recognized you long ago. I haven't told them the details about you yet.\"","Shen Tang nodded in understanding. That made sense.","However, she asked worriedly, \"Do they really dislike people in the entertainment industry?\"","Shen Yu sighed, \"Sister Tangtang, don't worry, no matter what your profession is, they won't have any opinion of you. They'll love you and make up for lost time.\"","\"Then why did Uncle...\"","Shen Yu pursed his lips, \"He just wants me to inherit his mantle, but I don't want to at all. I like singing and acting. I want to become as popular as Sister Tangtang in the future!\"","Shen Tang hesitated, \"Aim higher!\"","With so many people in the entertainment industry more capable than her, why did he have to look up to her?"]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Go Home","paragraphs":["Under Shen Yu's watchful eyes, Gu Huaian only exchanged a few words with Shen Tang.","He told himself in his heart that this was his little uncle, he could not hit him.","After tidying up his things, Shen Tang waved to Gu Huaian, \"I'll stay for a few days and come back.\"","\"Well, I'll wait for you.\"","Gu Huaian vaguely felt in his heart that she probably wouldn't come back so easily. He saw that little rascal Shen Yu.","There were not many people in the Shen family, just Shen Yu's family and his grandmother alone.","When Shen Tang arrived, her grandmother had already been waiting at the door for who knows how long, with her caregiver beside her trying to persuade her, but grandmother shook her head.","Seeing Shen Tang, her eyes lit up, \"Tangtang, Tangtang...\"","Shen Tang felt sour in her heart. She put down her suitcase and walked over, squatting gently in front of her, \"Grandma.\"","Grandmother's hand gently fell on Shen Tang's face, not daring to use any strength, as if afraid of hurting her.","As she stroked, her eyes turned red, and her voice became choked up: \"Good child, good child...\"","\"Grandma, it's too cold, let me push you inside.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang pushed the wheelchair, Shen Yu pushed the suitcase behind.","On the way in, Shen Tang kept chatting with her grandmother. This little old lady was really cute.","An old child is an old child. Don't say, when people get old, they're as easy to coax as a child.","Shen Tang directly brought her skills in taking care of children into full play and coaxed her grandmother into smiling from ear to ear.","Shen Yu's eyes turned red behind her. How long had it been since he had seen his grandmother so happy?","The Shen's house was not big, but it was still a small villa. Inside the house, Shen Boyuan and his wife were busy cooking up a storm in the kitchen.","Hearing the sound, Shen Boyuan poked his head out to look over, his hands still stirring the wok without stopping, \"Tangtang is back, sit down quickly, the food will be ready soon.\"","Shen Tang was somewhat surprised and asked Shen Yu sideways: \"Uncle can actually cook!\"","It wasn't that men couldn't cook, it was just that Shen Tang had done some research beforehand. The impression Shen Boyuan gave to others was that he was a aloof master who seemed not to be worldly, she didn't expect him to be so down to earth.","\"Yes, he is very good at cooking, just doesn't do it often. Sister Tangtang, you're lucky today.\"","Shen Yu said, glancing at the kitchen, and muttered softly, \"Don't be fooled by his appearance. He actually lies on the sofa like a old man usually, and is too lazy.\"","A shout of anger suddenly came from the kitchen: \"Shen Yu, are you talking bad about me again!\"","Shen Yu's eyes widened: \"No way, I was so quiet he could still hear me?\"","At this time, Shen Lady walked out, untying her apron and smiling as she explained, \"Whenever he has the slightest headache or sneeze, he feels it's you scolding him.\"","Shen Tang couldn't help but chuckle.","Shen Yu was a little speechless. Although he often grumbled and complained in private, he didn't know everything was blamed on him.","Shen Lady took Shen Tang upstairs, \"Your room has always been kept here, come and see if you like it, don't be shy to say if you don't like it, after all you'll be staying often.\"","Shen Tang's room was on the second floor, the room was very large, and the décor was very nice.","Most of the room was light pink and white, not tacky at all, but very cozy.","There were clearly many things in the room that a child could use, and there was also a large display cabinet with more than twenty gift boxes inside.","Shen Lady explained, \"These were all bought over the years, one for you every year. Because we never got to see you... so we always believed you were still alive, just didn't know where you were. Open them and see if you like them.\"","Shen Tang looked them over one by one. The birth gift was a longevity lock, the first birthday gift was a gold bracelet, the second birthday gift was a rocking horse, the third birthday gift was... all the way to this year's gift, which was a bracelet.","This bracelet was particularly beautiful, and it touched Shen Tang's heart at first sight.","Seeing this, Shen Lady took out the bracelet, \"Come, try it on.\"","\"This doesn't seem right...\"","\"What's not right? This was for you to begin with.\"","Shen Lady forcefully put the bracelet on Shen Tang's wrist. The pink diamonds glittered under the light.","Shen Tang's skin was fair to begin with, and the bracelet made her look even whiter.","Even Shen Lady couldn't help but envy her, \"You're so fair.\"","Shen Tang smiled shyly, \"You are very fair too.\"","\"Me?\" Shen Lady touched her face, \"This is the result of technology, not comparable to your natural complexion. Your mother was also very fair.\"","That's why they felt even more heartbroken when they saw the particularly obvious scars on her body.","It was a pity that there was still no news of that scumbag until now, no knowing where he was hiding.","Not being able to find the person before was one thing, but now they had found Shen Tang.","Shen Tang also looked so much like Xiuxiu, Shen Lady was a little worried in her heart, afraid that the scumbag would come looking for her.","After all, Shen Tang was a public figure. If that person said things that were untrue, people online wouldn't care if it was true or not.","Shen Tang didn't think so much. Seeing so many gifts, her heart felt sour.","She felt a little guilty. Was she not a shameless thief like this? Stealing someone else's happiness?","She even became curious about where the original owner had gone, and why she had transmigrated over.","Because her thoughts weighed heavily on her, her smile faded somewhat.","Shen Lady also took Shen Tang to see her mother's room. The room was spotless, even the corners were clean.","Everything was kept in its original state, the bed sheets and blankets were still on the bed, as if someone had been living there all along.","It was evident that the Shen family had put in a lot of care.","\"Mother would definitely be very happy if she knew.\"","\"Hopefully...\"","Thinking of Shen Xiuxiu, Shen Lady's face also showed a trace of sadness.","She quickly adjusted her expression, \"Well, today is a day of great joy, let's not talk about these things for now. Are you hungry? Your uncle should have finished cooking.\"","Shen Tang touched her stomach, \"I am a little hungry. I heard from Shen Yu that Uncle is a great cook, I'm lucky today.\"","\"Yes, your uncle, he cooks very deliciously, he's just too lazy...\"","The two chatted and laughed as they went downstairs. Downstairs, grandmother kept staring at the top of the stairs, craning to see them.","Seeing Shen Tang come down, she instantly smiled, \"Xiuxiu... \"","Shen Tang knew as soon as she heard that grandmother was ill again, unable to recognize people.","\"Xiuxiu... you're back...\"","\"Grandma...\"","The Shen family was already experienced in dealing with this situation, coaxing her was the way.","Soon, the old lady became sleepy again and the caregiver took her back to the room to sleep.","Sitting on the sofa, Shen Tang asked, \"How long has Grandma been like this?\"","\"For a while, most of the time she's still quite clear-headed, I think it's because she misses Auntie too much. Don't take it to heart, sister Tangtang.\"","\"I have nothing to mind.\" Shen Tang shook her head, feeling a little bitter in her heart.","\"Dinner is ready!\" Shen Boyuan brought out the dishes, \"Let's eat!\"","Shen Yu and Shen Lady pulled Shen Tang over to eat, pushing in her chair and putting food in her bowl, very enthusiastic.","Shen Tang couldn't help thinking to herself, if the Shen family knew she wasn't the real Shen Tang, would they still treat her this way?","She seemed to have fallen into a strange loop of self-doubt, knowing yet unable to get out of it.","She hadn't been this kind of person before, yet now she was actually feeling such anxiety and apprehension.","\"Tangtang, is the taste not to your liking?\"","\"No, it's very delicious.\" Shen Tang said, taking a big mouthful of rice.","She was not lying, the food was indeed very tasty, with a taste of home that she had never experienced before."]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: The Brainless Fan","paragraphs":["After dinner, Shen Yu took Shen Tang to the study early. It was not until Shen Yu turned on the live stream on his computer that Shen Tang realized he was actually a newbie gamer streamer.","Glancing at the number of viewers in the live streaming room, uh, just a few dozen people, it was a bit embarrassing.","Shen Tang was going to sneak in and brush some gifts for him later when she heard Shen Yu shake his phone:","\"Sister Tang Tang, I heard you are very good at playing games, do you want to play together?\"","Shen Tang wondered which big mouth said it out, but she didn't mind.","\"Okay, log in.\"","\"Do you mind if I livestream?\"","Her ID had made it to the hot search because of a quarrel before, of course, later it was reversed with Gu Huaian's help.","But Shen Tang was a little worried that she might be recognized.","On second thought, there were only a few people in this live streaming room, it should be fine.","Besides, she was not showing her face, so Shen Tang said indifferently, \"It's okay.\"","She had forgotten that it was a new season when she opened the game. Shen Tang hadn't been playing games much recently.","When she looked at Shen Yu again, his rank was not high either, only Diamond, Shen Tang couldn't help feeling a little annoyed, I hope this won't be a pit again.","Although she didn't care much about the gaming experience, she enjoyed more the process of playing games with friends.","However, if the teammate was too noob, especially those two friends like Gu Huaian, then she would be afraid.","\"Let's go!\"","The two matched with two girls who main mage and support and a boy who hung three jungler heroes.","How did Shen Tang know he was a boy?","Because he started scolding as soon as he came in.","\"F*ck, matched with three girls again, you girls can only play mages and supports?\"","\"Remake, remake, remake!\"","Yes, Shen Tang also hung three mage heroes.","However, this did not mean that she could only play mid lane. And this guy was too vulgar in his speech. She just didn't feel like remaking on purpose.","She was on the fifth floor and preselected an Lu'an, sent her 78% win rate record and said, \"I'll jungle, carry you guys to victory!\"","\"Huh, win rate so high, got a boy to play for you right, laugh out loud, I hate running into couples the most.\"","\"I'm not playing anymore, remake.\"","The boy on the first floor directly instalocked Little Nether Lady.","Shen Tang said to the girls on the second and third floors: \"Don't worry about the others, just play what you are good at, I can carry.\"","Shen Yu also didn't understand why the gaming environment was so harsh on girls.","Seeing that the two girls had not chosen yet, Shen Yu said, \"I'm a streamer, come on!\"","\"Huh, anyone can become a streamer these days.\"","In the last few seconds before the countdown ended, the two girls finally chose weakened Diaochan and Execute Yaomei respectively.","\"Huh, an Execute on Yaomei, what use do you have?\"","Because the opponent had taken Lu'an, Shen Tang and Shen Yu chose Monkey King and Marco Polo respectively.","The boy started mocking again: \"Turns out it's a girl carrying her boyfriend, laugh out loud, I hate running into couples the most.\"","\"Playing Monkey King? You must be a primary school student, have you finished your homework?\"","\"Huh, I said remake but you didn't.\"","After the game started, the boy kept following Shen Tang back to base and mocking her.","Shen Tang didn't care. She was quite good at playing Monkey King. She was the Agility Monkey King.","Fortunately, although he kept coming back to base to mock her, he didn't steal her buffs.","It was universally recognized that Shen Tang was good at games. She was like playing in the lower ranks. Soon, she got a double kill.","Yaomei also gave up on Shen Yu and kept following Shen Tang.","Whether it was because he lost confidence, the boy also stopped trash talking and prepared to play properly. But he kept getting caught and killed several times.","Shen Tang turned on the mic: \"Huh, that's all?\"","\"I thought you were really good, 0-7-0, 6 minutes in, and you don't even have an assist, how dare you talk about others?\"","\"What's wrong with girls being good at games?\"","To be fair, the two girls in this game played much better than the trash-talking boy.","Just as Shen Tang was about to say more, she found that the boy had turned off his headset and went AFK at the fountain.","Did he go AFK on purpose?","\"Sis, you're so good, you made him shut down completely.\"","In others people's mouths, this form of address had become \"elder sister\".","Although it was 4v5, it was still easy to win. Shen Tang killed them one by one with her staff. She was very strong.","At this point, the two girls dared to speak up too. It turned out that they were only freshmen in college. When they encountered guys who started cursing as soon as the game started, they got a little scared.","They chatted very happily, completely forgetting that they were live streaming.","It wasn't until Shen Yu came back to his senses that he realized the streaming room already had over a thousand more viewers.","\"F*ck! Did I get popular?\"","\"Streamer, you made it to the hot list!\"","\"Haha, this girl is so good at scolding people, I want to learn from her!\"","\"Why does this ID look kind of familiar?\"","Shen Tang almost skipped a beat.","She really didn't want to make it to the hot search again. She was afraid her uncle couldn't take it.","\"Want to keep playing?\"","\"Yes.\"","The two were simply unstoppable and invincible.","The number of people in the streaming room also increased. Of course, with good comments naturally came bad ones as well.","Fortunately, Shen Yu just treated this as entertainment and recreation, so he didn't really care about the audience's feedback.","But when he saw abusive comments towards Shen Tang mixed in there, he couldn't stand it.","They were probably siblings. Shen Yu could also scold them back articulately. Within a few minutes, the streaming room was reported and banned.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"What should we do now? Can it be unbanned?\"","Shen Yu casually put down his phone, \"I only live streamed to practice my skills in preparation for that variety show. If it's banned then so be it.\"","Shen Tang also knew about that show where a group of celebrities played games together and competed for the final championship. She felt most of these variety shows had scripts, so she didn't pay much attention to it.","Shen Yu explained, \"The scripts are useless. If your gaming skills are too weak, the audience can tell at a glance. Sister Tang Tang, you are so good at games, do you want to participate with me? Your TV series should be close to wrapping up right.\"","Shen Tang was indeed tempted.","But she remembered she had agreed to attend a children's show earlier, so she had to regretfully decline.","\"I'll pass. I have other variety shows to attend.\"","Shen Yu was also somewhat disappointed. \"What a pity, your skills are so good, you would definitely win the championship...\"","Shen Tang discovered that her cheap younger brother seemed to have always admired her, for better or worse.","She tentatively asked, \"What makes you so confident about me?\"","Shen Yu held his head high proudly: \"I'm your fan, didn't you know?\"","Indeed Shen Tang didn't know.","But judging by his fanaticism, he must be her brainless fan, who probably even thought her shit smelled fragrant.","Oh my!"]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: I'm not Blind.","paragraphs":["Life in the Shen family was truly enjoyable.","Perhaps out of concern for Shen Tang's comfort, the members of the Shen family were incredibly warm and welcoming when appropriate, while also understanding the need to give her personal space without excessive intrusion.","However, the kinder they were to her, the more guilty Shen Tang felt.","She could never overcome the hurdle in her heart, always believing herself to be a shameless thief.","But she dared not speak it aloud; it was a secret she would never reveal in her lifetime.","After all, not everyone could accept living within the pages of a book.","The filming for the drama soon reached its conclusion, and Shen Tang's role was also coming to an end.","During this time, Shen Tang had become close with everyone, even the crew members were a little reluctant to see her leave.","After all, not everyone was so polite and generous.","The director, for once, was willing to spend some money and planned to treat everyone to a meal at a restaurant.","Qi Yue widened her eyes in surprise, \"The stingy director is actually willing to spend money!\"","The director was given the nickname \"stingy director\" behind his back because, in reality, he was quite thrifty, saving money and investing it all in filming.","Of course, everyone's teasing was in good spirits.","Shen Tang glanced behind her and blinked, pretending not to know, \"What stingy director? I have no idea.\"","\"Are you pretending? It's the director, of course. He's the stingiest. Don't you know? I even saw him rummaging through the trash cans once—\"","\"Speaking ill of others behind their back isn't very nice!\"","The director's voice suddenly appeared behind them, startling Qi Yue.","\"Why don't you make any sound when you walk?\"","\"That's not the point.\"","\"It is the point! You're not exactly light, so why is there no sound at all?\"","The director lowered his head and looked at his protruding belly, then glanced at Qi Yue's thin and stick-like figure, pursing his lips, \"So what if I'm fat? Have you been eating my rice? My weight is agile.\"","Qi Yue raised an eyebrow, crossing her arms, \"Yes, I have been eating your food.\"","Almost forgot, the boxed lunches provided by Qi Yue's family's hotel were now the crew's free meals.","As the saying goes, don't bite the hand that feeds you. After eating Qi's food for so long, the director couldn't stand straight in front of Qi Yue.","He shifted his gaze away, cleared his throat, and said, \"Anyway, um, the restaurant is already booked, we're just missing the two of you.\"","\"Let's go then.\"","Everyone was excited, thinking they could finally take advantage of the director, but to their surprise, when they arrived at the place, it turned out to be a shabby restaurant.","The place was small, not enough room for everyone to sit, and some even had to sit outside.","\"Director...\"","It's not that they couldn't eat the food here, they just had higher expectations, and the gap was too big, making it a bit hard to accept.","The director, with his hands behind his back, cleared his throat, \"Don't judge this place by its size. In fact, the food here is excellent, especially the Sweet and Sour Pork, it's absolutely exceptional. I come here often to eat.\"","The owner of the restaurant came out with a smile to greet the guests. He was an old man with graying hair, but he was spirited and walked briskly, showing no signs of aging.","\"Everyone, please come inside and take a seat. Order whatever you like.\"","Everyone gradually took their seats.","Shen Tang noticed that although the place was small, it was very clean. There were no stains in the corners, and the tables, chairs, and stools were all wiped spotlessly clean.","The boss wore a chef's hat and a mask, and had good personal hygiene.","Maybe the food here was really good.","Shen Tang initially planned to sit next to Qi Yue but was pulled by her to sit between them, away from Tang Shuqing.","The director sighed.","Shen Tang felt somewhat helpless.","Ever since the incident the last time, Qi Yue and Tang Shuqing had been at odds with each other. It all started when the director gossiped about Qi Yue being the sugar mama of Tang Shuqing. Qi Yue had been holding a grudge ever since and would take any chance to tease him.","Of course, it wasn't entirely Qi Yue's fault. After all, he was the one who was falsely rumored to be in a relationship with her nephew.","The boss handed them the menu, but the director didn't even look at it and directly ordered six dishes.","Qi Yue looked disdainful and said, \"There are ten people at this table, and you only ordered six dishes?\"","The director nonchalantly replied, \"You wouldn't understand.\"","Qi Yue couldn't be bothered with him and turned to ask, \"Why hasn't your nephew arrived yet?\"","As if on cue, Tang Shuqing finally arrived. While everyone else was dressed casually, he was wearing a formal suit and had styled his hair.","As he got closer, Shen Tang caught a whiff of his cologne.","Tang Shuqing grabbed a small chair and squeezed himself between Shen Tang and the director. He asked, \"Can I sit here?\"","The director accommodated Qi Yue, but that didn't mean he would accommodate Tang Shuqing. He scoffed, \"You've already sat down, why bother asking?\"","Upon hearing this, Tang Shuqing leaned towards the director and said, \"Oops, sorry, did I squeeze you?\" He said it, but he didn't make any attempt to move away.","And so, the two of them ended up sitting tightly together. If someone didn't know any better, they would think they had a good relationship.","The director sighed.","It seemed like everyone from the Qi family had a grudge against him!","Thinking about the Qi family's investment, he decided to endure it!","As mentioned before, the director was very strict when it came to filming, but in daily life, he was more friendly. Wherever there was gossip, he would be there.","Sure enough, as soon as Tang Shuqing turned his head to talk to Shen Tang, the director's eyes lit up.","Tang Shuqing had something to say, but he couldn't say it under the director's gaze.","The director blinked and urged, \"Carry on with your conversation, don't mind me.\"","However, as a grown man, it was impossible for him to pretend not to see anything.","Hearing the director's words, Qi Yue's body leaned slightly, her ears perked up.","Shen Tang didn't mind, but Tang Shuqing was infuriated.","He clenched his teeth and squeezed towards the director again, saying, \"Do you two not have anything else to do?\"","\"No, we're just waiting for the food,\" Shen Tang replied.","As soon as she finished speaking, the boss brought the dishes.","Each plate was very large, bigger than a face, and there was a generous portion of food in each. The plates were so full that they were almost overflowing.","But with only six dishes, the table was completely filled.","Everyone at the table, except for the director, couldn't help but open their mouths wide in surprise.","\"Why are there so many dishes?\"","\"Oh my god!\"","The director smirked triumphantly and said, \"For those who claim it's not enough, you must finish these dishes before leaving today.\"","Qi Yue: \"......\"","Why don't you just give me your ID card directly!","As soon as the dish arrived, Shen Tang couldn't wait to take a bite, and the taste was indeed good.","Then she buried her head and ate voraciously.","Completely oblivious to the occasional glances from Tang Shuqing beside her.","It was Qi Yue who noticed this and rolled his eyes disapprovingly.","With his mindset, it was as clear as day to everyone except Shen Tang, who remained clueless.","But she thought he didn't stand a chance.","Although he was handsome and wealthy, he was nothing compared to Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang wasn't blind, she didn't want pearls, she wanted fish eyes."]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: You Touch China","paragraphs":["In the time it took to finish a meal, Tang Shuqing never managed to find an opportunity to talk to Shen Tang because her attention was entirely focused on eating.","As Shen Tang would say, now that she had finished playing the role of a strict character with demanding physical requirements, why not indulge herself at this moment? When else would be a better time?","After the meal, Tang Shuqing finally found a gap and asked, \"Tang Tang, do you have some free time now?\"","Seeing Shen Tang tiptoeing over, Tang Shuqing held his breath in excitement.","\"Great nephew, what's your name again?\" Shen Tang asked.","Tang Shuqing: \"......\"","Qi Yue burst into laughter beside them.","She patted Tang Shuqing's shoulder. \"Nephew, don't worry about all those things. The beautiful flower already has an owner.\"","Shen Tang was taken aback. So Tang Shuqing had feelings for her...","She had never noticed because she always thought of him as Qi Yue's nephew, and since she had such a good relationship with Qi Yue, she could understand why he would be close to her.","She never expected that he would have such thoughts about her.","Shen Tang opened her mouth, not knowing what to say.","She didn't want to hurt her great nephew's feelings, nor did she want to give him any hope.","\"Um, don't you know that I'm married?\" she said.","Now it was Tang Shuqing's turn to be surprised. \"Isn't that just a rumor?\"","\"Well, of course it's true. Why would you think it's a rumor?\" Shen Tang and even Qi Yue were surprised.","If she remembered correctly, Shen Tang had mentioned this matter on the set before, and many people were shocked at the time.","There were also some rumors online, but some people believed it while others thought it was false.","After all, Shen Tang was still young and at the peak of her career, so getting married at this time was like digging her own grave.","Tang Shuqing really had no idea.","He had heard about what Shen Tang said on the set at the time. Later, when he saw Shen Tang's Weibo post, he thought both of those things were fake, but he never expected...","He was feeling a bit embarrassed now.","As for how much he loved Shen Tang, he didn't, he just liked her and was uncontrollably attracted to her.","He had always called her Tang Tang sister to try to be on the same level as her, that was his little scheme.","He never expected that she had already stepped into the grave of marriage...","\"Aunt, why are you so reckless...\" Tang Shuqing said.","Shen Tang shrugged. \"There's nothing I can do. He offered too much.\"","If it weren't for those billions, she would have been able to hold on to her self-control.","Suddenly, Shen Tang thought of the billions that Gu Huaian had transferred to her. Ahem, there were really a lot.","Seeing that both of them were feeling a bit awkward, Qi Yue intervened, \"Alright, it's getting late. Let's go back early and pretend that this never happened.\"","Pretending it never happened was impossible, Shen Tang decided that she would keep her distance from Tang Shuqing in the future. After all, he was also an adult man.","Tang Shuqing also knew this would be the result, but he didn't expect his first secret crush to come to nothing. He felt a bit sad.","However, everyone maintained a normal appearance on the surface. After all, when people grow up, the first thing they learn is how to pretend.","Back at the hotel, Shen Tang packed her things and prepared to check out and leave.","After such a long time, she had a lot of stuff, and it took several large suitcases to pack everything.","Yuan Yuan was exhausted. \"Tang Tang, how did you end up with so much stuff?\" She remembered that they didn't have this much when they arrived.","Shen Tang guiltily touched her nose. Wasn't it because she got hooked on online shopping?","\"I don't know either. Did the car arrive?\" she asked.","While Yuan Yuan made a phone call to inquire about the driver, the door was knocked on the other end. To her surprise, it was Gu Huaian.","\"Why are you here?\" Shen Tang's voice was filled with joy.","Gu Huaian pulled Shen Tang into his embrace, burying his face in her neck, taking a deep sniff.","\"I missed you so much,\" he said.","Shen Tang could feel Gu Huaian's strong and vigorous heartbeat.","She wrapped her arms around his waist. \"I missed you too.\"","Just as Yuan Yuan finished her call, she witnessed this scene, and her heart skipped a beat. She really wanted to ask, \"Do you have to hug each other at the hotel room door? Can't you come in and close the door? You couldn't wait a moment longer?\"","Yuan Yuan worried like an old mother, afraid of being spotted and ending up on the hot search rankings.","Fortunately, Gu Huaian let go after a while. \"Is everything packed? I'll drive you back home.\"","\"It's all packed, just a little bit too much.\"","\"It's fine, my car is spacious.\"","Shen Tang was still wondering how the three of them would manage to carry so many suitcases downstairs when she saw two figures appearing at the door. Oh no, it was actually two heads.","\"Hello, sister-in-law!\" Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng greeted loudly, giving Shen Tang the illusion that she was the wife of a gang leader.","Yuan Yuan's expression also looked a bit confused. Her eyes widened, seemingly startled.","Shen Tang quickly explained, \"Don't be afraid, they are good people.\"","After saying that, she realized something was wrong. The words she used had a feeling of \"the guilty flee when no one pursues.\"","But these two were just a bit simple-minded; their nature was still good.","At first, Yuan Yuan was a bit reserved, but soon she got along well with the two. Although they were wealthy, unlike Gu Huaian, Yuan Yuan was afraid of him, but she felt more at ease talking to Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng.","With each person carrying a suitcase, they walked downstairs together. Just as they reached the parking lot, Shen Yu suddenly emerged from the side.","He really did appear out of nowhere.","Several people were startled.","\"Sister, I'll drive you home!\" Shen Yu said provocatively, glancing at Gu Huaian.","Gu Huaian tightened his grip, nervously asking, \"Tang Tang, do you want to go with him?\"","Shen Yu clasped his hands together and waved them in front of him. \"Sister Tang Tang, come back with me. Dad, Mom, and Grandma are all waiting for you at home.\"","Gu Huaian pursed his lips and remained silent, just looking at Shen Tang with a profound sense of grievance in his eyes.","Shen Tang couldn't bear to see him like this.","[What should I do? It's so difficult to decide...]","[Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah!]","[On one side is my family, on the other side...]","Shen Tang couldn't make a decision for a moment.","She heard Gu Huaian lower his eyes, his voice filled with disappointment. \"It's okay, Tang Tang. You can go with him. I can manage on my own. After all, they are your family. Even though you've been living with them all this time, I haven't seen you in a long time. It's okay, I can endure it.\"","Shen Yu's eyes widened in astonishment. What a green arrow!","\"You're exaggerating too much! Tang Tang, don't let this guy deceive you!\"","Even Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng secretly raised their thumbs from behind.","Wow, they didn't expect Gu Ge (Gu Huaian) to have such a side to him.","Shen Tang was also surprised.","[Wow, the aroma of this tea is so strong that it's almost overflowing. How many pots of tea did he drink before coming?]","[But this Gu Huai'an is so adorable, sob sob, it's really hard to choose.]","Seeing that Shen Tang was taking a long time to make a decision, Shen Yu became anxious. He walked up and pushed Gu Huai'an, wanting to stand between the two.","Unexpectedly, Gu Huai'an fell directly to the ground, his palms scratched and bleeding.","Shen Yu exclaimed, \"Damn it! I didn't use much force at all!\"","You motherf***er, you're faking it!"]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: How can it be So Coincidence","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian's eyebrows slightly wrinkled, \"It was me who wasn't careful, ouch!\"","His fragile appearance made the two silly brothers behind him stare with wide eyes.","Who was the one that got injured without making a sound?","Why is he so delicate now?","That's right, delicate.","Shen Yu's eyeballs were about to pop out too.","He had a hundred sentences starting with \"f**k your mom\" that he wanted to say.","Shen Tang also doubted that Gu Huaian was pretending, after all he was so capable.","But the wound on his palm was real. She pulled the person up and said to Shen Yu, \"I'll go to his place first, then go to your place after a couple days.\"","The corner of Gu Huaian's mouth tilted up slightly.","Shen Yu happened to see it and shouted while pointing at him, \"Sis Tang, look, he's smiling, he must be pretending!\"","Shen Tang pinched between her brows, she didn't expect that there would be such a day.","\"Be good.\"","Since Sis Tang said so, Shen Yu had no choice. He rolled his eyes at Gu Huaian, \"Green tea b****!\"","Then he strode away arrogantly.","Shen Tang looked towards Gu Huaian, \"Are you alright?\"","\"I'm fine, it just hurts a bit.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","No way, Gu Huaian you were the stoic, aloof male lead riding high above normal people. How did you become like this now?","Don't you feel you have damaged your character image?","Gu Huaian indicated that he didn't think so.","After putting the luggage away, Shen Tang and Gu Huain sat in the car. Yuan Yuan was about to get in but was pulled by Cen Songbai, \"Come come, Yuan Yuan you sit in our car.\"","He figured, how could this girl be so ignorant, she even wanted to be the third wheel.","With the way those two are clinging to each other, isn't she afraid of being choked to death by dog food?","Yuan Yuan also realized, she quickly said, \"I won't sit in the car, you guys go ahead, I'll get a taxi home later.\"","\"Which part of town do you live in, we'll give you a ride.\"","\"Yeah, we're free anyway.\"","Yuan Yuan hesitated a little.","\"What, are you afraid we'll eat you?\" Cen Songbai said, and winked greasily.","Yuan Yuan: \"......\"","Oh my god... She felt her eyes were assaulted!","Although Yuan Yuan was young, having been in the entertainment industry where people either boosted you up high or stamped you down low, she understood a lot.","To be honest, acting like him, he was simply the dummy son of a landlord. If put in a TV drama he probably wouldn't survive one episode.","\"Thanks but no need, I live very close by.\" Yuan Yuan declined politely.","She really didn't want to get on that car.","For no other reason than it looked too tackily flashy.","That gaudy pink sports car was encrusted with a ring of crushed diamonds, it made Yuan Yuan feel as if she had gone back to the days when non-mainstream culture was a trend.","Another thing was the exceptionally bright hair colors those two had, she really didn't want to squeeze together with them.","Cen Songbai thought she was just being shy. He went ahead and took action directly.","Before Yuan Yuan could react, she was pushed onto the car and buckled up.","Excuse me?","\"Don't be shy, we're all friends here. Go on, where do you live?\"","\"Wait, I'm not—\"","\"Sit tight, here we go!\"","And so, the car sped away swiftly, leaving a trail of dust behind.","Fu Junsheng stood behind the back of the car stupefied.","Was this yet another c*nt-struck fool?","He looked towards Gu Huaian's car that hadn't left yet, hoping: \"Brother Gu...\"","Gu Huaian lightly coughed and said, \"There's no space in my car, call yourself a cab or something.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, his car zoomed away swiftly, as if afraid that Fu Junsheng would get on.","Fu Junsheng stood in place, clutching his chest.","We're breaking up! Breaking up with all of you!","Not a single good egg between them!","Saying there's no space, how fat is your ass, there's totally space.","Blatant lies without blinking an eye.","In the car, Shen Tang looked back a few times, \"Is it really ok to just leave them like that?\"","\"Don't worry, that adult can find his way home without getting lost.\"","Shen Tang wanted to say something but held back.","No way, their brotherly bonds are all superficial...","She even suspected that Gu Huaian was never any better before, and probably bullied those two a lot too.","Gu Huaian lightly coughed again. \"Tang Tang, you don't have other things coming up later right?\"","\"Not necessarily, will depend on the situation. I may have to do publicity for the movie later.\"","Although she wasn't the lead actress, her character was also quite important.","She definitely wouldn't be able to slip away when the time came.","\"Oh...\"","Curiously Shen Tang asked: \"Do you have something going on?\"","\"Nothing much.\"","Shen Tang curled her lips disdainfully.","Who you lying to, you wouldn't ask if you had nothing going on!","Gu Huaian suddenly laughed out loud.","Shen Tang thought there must be something wrong with his brain.","Gu Huaian had an incessant upturned corner of his mouth, as if he was thinking of something wonderful. Shen Tang felt a little indignant looking at it. She glanced at the hand he was using to drive and asked: \"Your hand doesn't hurt anymore?\"","\"It doesn't hurt.\"","Right after saying that, Gu Huaian made a pained expression again, \"Actually there's still a bit, but I can endure it.\"","\"Oh stop pretending already! I didn't see you make a peep when your head got smashed the other time.\"","Shen Tang snorted derisively. Just now she hadn't pointed it out because of her concern messing up her rationale, but when she thought about it clearly there's no way he's that delicate.","\"Cough, you don't like when I'm like that?\"","Shen Tang's gaze drifted around.","She recalled a line that she had read before - The reason people dislike green teas is because the object of her (or his) affections isn't you.","That was so real.","She had to admit, earlier, mixed with her annoyance was a bit of secret pleasure.","But could something like that be said out loud?","Absolutely not to Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang maintained her frosty expression and indifferently said, \"It's ok.\"","\"I understand, then I won't be like that in the future.\"","That was how Gu Huaian responded.","Shen Tang immediately snapped her head towards him: \"I only said it was ok! I didn't tell you not to be like that in the future!\"","\"Ok means so-so, rather forced. I understand you. Don't worry, I won't make you uncomfortable in the future.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","No wait, that's not what she meant at all!","Shoot, how could she explain this now!","Does she have to say that she actually really enjoyed it? Nope, absolutely could not say that out loud!","Gu Huaian heard all the incoherent thoughts in Shen Tang's heart and could not hold back an amused chuckle.","Caught in your own trap.","Indeed Shen Tang was stuck anxiously and was very curious what Gu Huaian originally wanted to ask her about, saying only halfway was the worst kind of tease.","Seeing from Shen Tang's thoughts how she had inwardly raved at and abused him, Gu Huaian said helplessly: \"Want to know why I asked you that way earlier?\"","Shen Tang hurriedly nodded her head: \"I really want to know! Very much!\"","\"Kiss me and I'll tell you.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","To be fair they had kissed multiple times before. But Shen Tang initiating herself could be counted on one hand's fingers and...","\"Bro, you're driving right now you know!\"","\"Waiting until we're home works too.\"","Shen Tang had originally thought to ask him to change the condition. But since he still wanted a kiss even when they got home, better to just kiss him now, at least he couldn't make any moves.","But taking the initiative to kiss was still a bit embarrassing and Shen Tang needed to psych herself up for quite a while inwardly.","Just when she leaned in close, Gu Huaian slightly turned his head, and their lips bumped then parted right away.","Shen Tang unbelievingly covered her mouth.","She had only wanted to kiss his cheek but somehow landed on his mouth!","\"Why'd you turn your head?\"","\"I seemed to have seen something flash by the roadside.\"","To be honest Shen Tang wasn't too convinced, but she had no proof either.","How could it be so perfectly timed?","Speaking of which, Gu Huaian's lips were very soft, like jelly, and even had a subtle minty scent.","Pfft, this guy didn't put on lip balm did he!"]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Is this man born in the year of the dog","paragraphs":["Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian doubtfully. Gu Huaian's body suddenly stiffened for a moment, afraid of being discovered, then slowly relaxed again.","Shen Tang looked closely and found that Gu Huaian's hair was carefully styled and his clothes were also carefully matched. The whole person looked more handsome, not at all like a man approaching forty.","(Gu Huaian: ???)","Wait, he seemed to smell a little fragrant.","Shen Tang leaned in to get a clearer whiff when Gu Huaian suddenly said, \"We're here.\"","\"Huh? That fast?\"","Shen Tang looked left and right. Outside was pitch black. Where exactly were they?","\"Where is this place?\"","Seeing Gu Huaian unbuckling his seatbelt, Shen Tang became a little nervous. \"Where are you going?\"","She didn't dare get out of the car, but she was even more afraid to stay in the car alone.","Unexpectedly, Gu Huaian directly leaned over, one hand supporting the back of her head, the other holding her chin. His hot lips heavily kissed hers, following her breath.","\"Mmph...\"","In the dim light, Shen Tang even forgot to close her eyes. She could clearly see Gu Huaian's eyelashes.","【So long...】","\"Concentrate.\" Gu Huaian retracted one hand to cover Shen Tang's eyes, then continued swirling in her mouth.","Shen Tang was tightly pressed against the passenger seat, arched her slender and fair neck, and could only passively endure his dominance and aggression.","The two people's breathing intertwined with each other, their scents blending together, indistinguishable from one another.","After a storm, feeling the girl's obedience below him, Gu Huaian's actions involuntarily became gentler. He lingered on her glossy pink lips, gentle and lingering.","Shen Tang's cheeks were flushed. Her heart pounded like a drum. A numb tingling sensation spread from the base of her spine and she unconsciously let out a moan.","Gu Huaian’s body stiffened. He moved his lips away, resting at Shen Tang’s neck, breathing deeply.","Shen Tang gave him a push. “You’re poking me!”","“Don’t move.” Gu Huaian’s voice sounded hoarse, with a hint of seductiveness.","Shen Tang instantly stopped. She had thought it was his belt poking her...","The inexperienced Shen Tang also panicked a little. Was he going to... here?","Although there were car scenes in romance novels, she didn’t want that here!","All kinds of R-rated scenes flashed through Shen Tang's mind, then she began to worry anxiously.","Under her ever-changing thoughts, Gu Huaian gradually calmed down.","He propped himself up and gently pecked Shen Tang's lips again before returning to the driver's seat.","\"Stop thinking randomly. Let's go home.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","He was somewhat like a scumbag denying everything after getting his pants back on.","\"Don't you have anything to say?\"","\"Say what?\"","\"Why did you suddenly kiss me?\"","\"Because I wanted to kiss you.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Great, that answer was useless.","The corners of Gu Huaian's mouth turned up slightly, his whole body radiating a feeling of delight.","After arriving at their destination, Shen Tang saw through the car window that they hadn't returned to the villa, but to an apartment building near Gu Huaian's company.","Shen Tang quietly complained as she got out of the car: \"Why did we come here? I miss Peach...\"","She had barely taken a step when Gu Huaian pressed her against the car door.","He lowered his head. Shen Tang quickly turned her face away. \"You still——Mmph——”","Before she could finish speaking, she was silenced by fragmented yet scorching kisses.","By the end, Shen Tang didn't even know how they got back to the room. The two almost went too far before Gu Huaian rushed into the bathroom for a cold shower, ending it.","Shen Tang's clothes were disheveled, her lips red.","She felt like her mouth was swollen from the kisses. She gently touched the corner of her mouth. Ouch! That hurt.","Something must be broken there!","Damn, this man must be part dog!","Fortunately, besides kissing her mouth, Gu Huaian didn't do anything too out of line.","If she hadn't felt a certain part of him, Shen Tang probably would have thought he couldn't perform.","After tidying up her clothes, Shen Tang lay in bed waiting for him.","But soon drowsiness overtook her and she fell asleep unknowingly.","In her dazed state, Shen Tang seemed to hear the pitter-patter of water. Was he still showering?","That was the only thought that flashed through her mind before she entered dreamland again.","In the bathroom, Gu Huaian glanced down at his too impressive brother, helplessly taking one cold shower after another.","Water droplets fell from his hair, sliding past his sexy Adam's apple, slowly flowing down into his white shirt, evoking naughty thoughts.","Gu Huaian's hands were clenched into fists against the icy walls, bulging veins apparent throughout his drenched body which clung tightly to him, perfectly showcasing his fit figure.","He had a premonition that if he kept showering like this, he might get a fever.","Fortunately after another while, that part finally calmed down.","Gu Huaian grabbed a towel and casually dried his hair without blow-drying it.","Entering the bedroom, he first checked on Shen Tang.","Hmm, alluring sleeping posture.","After carefully tucking Shen Tang in, Gu Huaian tiptoed out, closed the door, and started working.","Putting on his glasses, his eyes behind the lenses became sharp and aggressive, completely different from how he was in front of Shen Tang.","Shen Tang woke up the next morning still half-asleep, groping around for her phone out of habit before she even opened her eyes.","This was probably a common addiction amongst young people today, unable to separate from their phones.","But she didn't find her phone. She touched firm flesh instead.","Were those... abs?","Shen Tang moved her naughty hand down further until the big hand grasped her's tightly. \"Don't make trouble.\"","Shen Tang instantly stopped moving. Was it too late to pretend she was still sleeping?","She lifted her eyelids slightly, and said weakly, \"Uh... If I said I didn't mean to, would you believe me?\"","Gu Huaian shook the \"evidence\" in his hand. \"I believe you.\"","Shen Tang was embarrassed for a second before confidently stating, \"You're my boyfriend. What's wrong with me touching you a bit?\"","\"You're right, girlfriend. Go ahead now and exercise your rights.\"","Shen Tang swallowed nervously. \"Really?\"","Did that mean she could take a look down there? No, no! How could she think like this? It must be Qi Yue who corrupted her!","The smile at the corner of Gu Huaian's mouth deepened as he guided her hand to roam his abs, slowly moving down towards his waistband...","Right before touching it, Shen Tang hastily retracted her hand. \"Um, I need to pee urgently. I'll touch more next time!\"","She then dashed to the bathroom.","Gu Huaian noticed her ears and the back of her neck had turned red. He laughed out loud.","\"I'll be waiting for your return, girlfriend.\"","Shen Tang almost tripped at his words.","How could this man be so naughty!","She had only wanted to touch his abs, not down there!"]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Is it because You can hear Me","paragraphs":["There were only two people in the room, so the two lived an unabashed life.","Not at all.","Gu Huaian turned into a clingy puppy, wanting to kiss all the time and being very clingy, making Shen Tang feel a bit overwhelmed.","She didn't know how many times she had pushed Gu Huaian away, \"Don't you have anything else to do?\"","\"Kissing you is the most important thing.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Alright, she had nothing to f**king say.","Gu Huaian leaned in, she hurriedly turned her face away, and the kiss landed on her cheek instead.","\"Wait, can you stop kissing me, my lips are swollen.\"","Shen Tang felt that Gu Huaian was like he was in heat, kissing non-stop. Which good family kisses dozens of times a day!","Gu Huaian's gaze lowered, slowly falling on Shen Tang's red, shiny, watery lips.","His eyes darkened slightly, his Adam's apple rolled, and he said in a low voice, \"Very beautiful.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She was wrong.","She shouldn't have rejected Shen Yu back then and chosen to come back with Gu Huaian.","If she hadn't come back with Gu Huaian, she wouldn't have ended up like this.","\"I'll count to three, let go of me or I'll go back to live at the Shen house.\"","Shen Tang didn't notice that she said \"back\", which actually meant she already considered the Shen house her home.","Perhaps this is what relatives connected by blood are like. Although they didn't spend much time together, thinking of them still filled her heart with joy.","Gu Huaian was reluctant, \"One last time...\"","\"Three!\"","Gu Huaian let go instantly, \"Wait, where's one and two?\"","\"I counted them in my heart.\"","Shen Tang didn't actually want to leave. She missed Gu Huaian too.","But this kind of kissing really wouldn't do. Her tongue was sore.","Which boyfriend kisses like you do so relentlessly!","She glared at the culprit fiercely. However, Gu Huaian looked completely innocent, as if he didn't know what he had done.","【Hmph, just keep pretending!】","【You shouldn't be a CEO, you should be an actor. You'll definitely win next year's Oscar!】","【Acting like you've never touched a woman before, kissing nonstop】","【I'll eat raw garlic later. Let's see if you still dare to kiss me!】","Hearing this, Gu Huaian almost laughed out loud.","Having his sweet, soft, long unseen girlfriend by his side, it really was difficult to restrain himself.","Also, he felt like he had shown restraint already.","However, even if Shen Tang ate garlic, he wouldn't mind.","Although the smell was a bit strong.","Of course Shen Tang didn't actually eat raw garlic. She could only accept it as an ingredient in dishes. Eating it raw was still not an option.","But she ordered a bowl of snails, a plate of stinky tofu, and two durian puffs.","The three intense flavors stacked together, her entire body seemed to be pickled in flavor.","But it was really delicious, hehe~","Gu Huaian couldn't stand the smell. His face turned purple. He could only sit diagonally far away with the AC and fan on full blast.","He sprayed some perfume, but the fragrant stinky smell blended together into an arousing scent.","\"Tangtang...\"","\"Come on, kiss me!\"","Shen Tang deliberately puckered her lips high.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","His thin lips pressed into a straight line. He slowly said, \"Tangtang, I'm a petty man.\"","\"So?\"","Shen Tang didn't care.","\"So I hope you eat these three things every day.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She had an ominous feeling.","Shen Tang wanted to pack up and run away.","But she didn't get to run.","Because this Gu Huaian was like he installed surveillance around her. Whenever she wanted to leave, he would suddenly appear out of nowhere.","Just like the creepy headteacher in high school.","Shen Tang felt something was wrong.","If it was just guessing, it was too accurate.","But if it wasn't guessing...","Shen Tang searched the house carefully from top to bottom, and there were no surveillance cameras or strange devices.","Nothing strange on her body either.","She was a bit confused. There's no way Gu Huaian was a tapeworm in her stomach that knew everything she was thinking!","Not far away, Gu Huaian's eyebrow twitched.","He thought he was exposed, but unexpectedly Shen Tang started thinking about something else.","【Sigh, Gu Huaian is a bit old. I hope there won't be a generation gap between us in the future. 】","【My brother smells nice. Kind of regret not accepting his confession last time.】","【Qi Yue said a new club opened with male strippers and audience participation. I'll go check it out in a few days...】","Shen Tang secretly glanced at Gu Huaian. His face did turn dark. Could she have guessed right!","【F**k!】","Couldn't help but curse in her heart.","Shen Tang forcefully made her mind blank and didn't think about anything. She went back to her room to pack up.","She only had one thought. It was impossible to keep living here.","Shen Tang always had a lot of thoughts, but now she exceptionally had nothing in her mind.","Gu Huaian was a bit worried. He came to the door and gently knocked.","\"Tangtang...\"","Shen Tang didn't want to talk to him and didn't say anything.","\"I'm coming in.\"","Shen Tang sneered. Anyway it's your house, come in if you want. Why ask me?","Gu Huaian heard this sentence. He already knew Shen Tang was angry, though not exactly why. After all he had provoked her several times today too.","\"Tangtang...\" He reached out, but Shen Tang dodged away.","\"What do you want?\"","\"You...why are you packing?\" Gu Huaian was a bit panicked.","\"Of course I'm going home.\"","\"But this is your home.\"","Shen Tang zipped up her suitcase, stood up, looked Gu Huaian in the eyes and enunciated word for word: \"No, this is not my home.\"","【My home is in another world.】","Gu Huaian panicked. They were fine before. How did it become like this all of a sudden?","\"Tangtang, this is your home.\"","\"If I did something wrong, tell me directly okay? I'll change. Don't say things like this. I'm scared...\"","The usually strong Gu Huaian rarely revealed a hint of fragility on his face.","Seeing him like this, Shen Tang felt bad for a second.","Shen Tang ah Shen Tang, you really have no backbone.","She took a deep breath and steeled herself to say: \"You know I'm not the original Shen Tang right.\"","Seeing that Gu Huaian didn't look too shocked, Shen Tang laughed mockingly at herself.","\"You did know after all.\"","\"Gu Huaian, is there anything you want to tell me?\"","Gu Huaian immediately pulled Shen Tang into his embrace, murmuring: \"I'm sorry Tangtang, I can explain...\"","\"Is it because you can hear my thoughts?\"","Even though Shen Tang tried her best to control herself, she still leaked some thoughts that Gu Huaian heard.","【Why?】","【Why hide it from me】","【Was tricking me fun?】","Gu Huaian's heart raced. He didn't expect to be found out so quickly.","He actually thought about telling Shen Tang before, but never knew how to bring it up.","He was afraid that after she found out, she would be scared and leave him.","He didn't expect it to turn out like this.","Gu Huaian softly explained: \"Tangtang, I didn't trick you...\"","Saying this was already admitting it.","Shen Tang couldn't describe how she felt in that moment. Her whole body went cold, her face extremely pale, her heart felt violently squeezed, making it almost hard to breathe.","No wonder, no wonder Gu Huaian treated her differently from how the book described. No wonder he always knew what she was thinking.","So he could hear her thoughts all along.","What difference was there between being by his side and being naked? There was no privacy at all.","Shen Tang couldn't accept this.","She forcefully pushed Gu Huaian away, eyes red as she said: \"Don't say any more, I don't want to listen. Please, let me calm down okay?\""]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Will You Come Back","paragraphs":["Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng were carrying two bags of ingredients upstairs while chatting.","\"Do you think we might get locked out by Brother Gu if we just show up like this unexpectedly?\" Fu Junsheng seemed a little hesitant as he had not forgotten about the time when a certain someone was left outside a hotel room door.","However, the person involved was not too bothered. \"That won't happen. Anyway, we're here to keep Sister-in-law company.\"","\"Are you sure it's not about making money?\"","Cen Songbai lightly coughed and glared at Fu Junsheng. This guy really didn't know when to keep his mouth shut and just had to spell things out.","\"Tsk, talking all self-righteous when it's really just for your own selfish motives.\"","\"Enough! Can you say that you don't want Sister-in-law to make money with you?\"","Fu Junsheng fell silent. Alright, he did want that too.","\"But...last time when we played together, we didn't win a single round?\"","\"That's because of you!\" Cen Songbai refused to take the blame. Naturally, a good buddy should be the one to shoulder it.","Just as Fu Junsheng was about to say something more, the two had arrived at Gu Huaian's door. After pressing the doorbell for a while without anyone coming to open up,","\"Do you think no one's home?\"","\"Or did they go out on a date?\"","After pondering for a long time and pressing the doorbell a few more times, the door was suddenly opened.","It was already night time, yet the room was pitch black. Gu Huaian only opened the door a crack, concealing himself completely in the darkness so that his features could not be made out clearly.","A strong smell of smoke and alcohol wafted out from the room, quite pungent.","Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng exchanged glances, both having an ominous feeling.","Even their voices unconsciously lowered, \"Brother Gu, are you alright?\"","Gu Huaian opened the door wider. The light from the corridor shone on him but could not dispel the gloom surrounding him.","His hair was disheveled, stubble already appearing on his chin, looking extremely haggard.","\"Where's sister-in-law?\"","Cen Songbai had just finished speaking when Fu Junsheng pulled him. This guy, whether foolish or smart, clearly could not read the situation.","With Brother Gu looking like this, it definitely had something to do with sister-in-law.","Gu Huaian switched on the light. The coffee table was strewn with cigarette butts and ash, with empty beer bottles lying haphazardly in a row on the floor.","The two were shocked speechless. When had they ever seen Gu Huaian so decadent?","At another glance, the room was deathly silent except for the three of them. Obviously, sister-in-law was not at home.","\"Brother Gu, what happened?\"","\"Tangtang left.\" Gu Huaian sat on the sofa, rubbing his brow wearily.","The story rewinds to some time ago.","Upon hearing that Shen Tang wanted some time alone, Gu Huaian became extremely anxious. \"Can you go back to stay at Aunt Peach's place?\"","Shen Tang remained silent but answered in her heart, [No.]","Gu Huaian was truly panicking now. He didn't know if he should beg her forgiveness or listen to her request for some quiet time.","\"Tangtang, I'm sorry. I can explain. I didn't say anything previously because—\"","Shen Tang forcefully covered her ears with both hands. \"I don't want to listen. Can you let me be alone for a while?\"","Gu Huaian's mouth opened and closed before he finally uttered an \"Okay.\"","After waiting for who knows how long, maybe half an hour or maybe one hour, the room remained deathly silent.","Not a hint of a thought wave either. The room was so quiet it was as if only he was present.","Before long, the door was knocked on. The expected visitor had arrived.","Gu Huaian had just opened the door when Shen Yu rushed in.","\"Sister Tangtang!\"","Shen Tang came out with a suitcase. \"I'm here. Let's go.\"","Gu Huaian reached for the luggage but Shen Tang dodged his grasp. Shen Yu hurriedly took over instead. \"Let me, let me!\"","As if to say, see this!","\"I'll send you off.\"","\"No need.\"","Shen Tang and Shen Yu walked side by side ahead while Gu Huaian silently followed behind until they reached the parking lot.","As Shen Tang opened the car door, Gu Huaian tremblingly asked, \"Tangtang, do I still have a chance?\"","Shen Tang pursed her lips.","[I don't know...]","She got into the car without looking back and drove off.","Gu Huaian's eyes were red-rimmed. He staggered two steps and leaned against the wall.","\"Tangtang...\"","In the car, Shen Tang sat in the back seat with eyes tightly shut. Yet tears flowed forth like a snapped strand of pearls.","The more she endured it, the more anguished she felt.","Shen Tang's body shook uncontrollably as muffled, agonized sobs escaped her.","Utterly heart-wrenching despite the lack of audible sounds.","Shen Yu was rather worried. As he drove, he kept glancing at the rearview mirror, barely daring to breathe.","He didn't know what had happened but could sense the deep sorrow emanating from Sister Tangtang.","Gu Huaian!","If he had mistreated Sister Tangtang, he would make him pay!","Shen Yu swore in his heart.","Soon, the car stopped. Shen Tang wiped her tears and forced a smile. \"Don't tell Auntie and the rest about this.\"","She didn't want them to worry for her.","Shen Yu pointed at his eyes. \"I don't think I need to say... it's obvious from these reddened, swollen eyes that you've been crying.\"","Shen Tang sighed. \"It's fine. We'll sneak upstairs later and you can help me cook an egg.\"","\"Okay.\"","However, the plan was foiled. The two had just entered the living room when they bumped right into Shen Boyuan coming downstairs for tea.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Tangtang, you've been crying?\"","\"It's nothing much...\"","Shen Tang assumed her uncle would ask for details but surprisingly, he said nothing more. Instead, he pulled her to sit on the sofa.","\"Go ahead and cry if you want to. But remember, no matter what happens, don't bottle things up. Uncle will always be your staunch pillar of support.\"","Shen Yu also hurriedly nodded. \"Me too!\"","Shen Tang smiled through her tears. What had she done to deserve such a family?","The gloom shrouding her heart lightened considerably.","\"Thank you, Uncle.\"","\"Ai~ we're family. What's with all these thanks?\"","Shen Yu pointed at himself.","Shen Tang laughed and ruffled his hair. \"And little brother Shen Yu too.\"","Shen Yu grinned from ear to ear, practically baring his throat. He looked just like the silly young master of a wealthy household.","Shen Boyuan asked, \"If it's not too inconvenient, you can tell Uncle what happened. Having lived for so many years, Uncle may be able to offer some advice. If not, it's fine not to say anything.\"","Shen Tang hesitated. Mind reading was far too incredulous to speak of.","Moreover, the whole matter revolved around mind reading abilities. Without mentioning that, she wouldn't know what else to say.","\"I...\""]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Are You Having trouble with Gu","paragraphs":["Shen Boyuan comforted: \"Don't worry, you can take your time thinking about it. Of course, I'm old and sometimes may not have the same topics to talk about as you youngsters. If you have anything going on, you can also discuss it with your younger brother.\"","Shen Yu nodded like a chick pecking at rice.","\"Sister Tang, don't worry. If anyone bullies you, I'll beat them up!\"","As he said this, he waved his not very strong arms.","Shen Tang thought to herself that if he really wanted to hit someone, she could easily overpower him herself.","With his skinny arms and legs, she reckoned she could take him out in just a few moves.","But she had to give her little brother some face, so Shen Tang smiled and played along: \"Yeah, I'll take you to beat someone up tomorrow.\"","Shen Yu was taken aback. \"You're not serious, are you Sister Tang?\"","\"I'm joking.\"","Shen Tang sighed. How could she bear to beat up Gu Huaian?","She really was heartbroken and still felt bitter inside, but the truth was that it wasn't entirely Gu Huaian's fault either. He had only erred in keeping it hidden from her all this time.","And it was just so awkward...","Thinking about all the naughty thoughts she used to entertain about him that he now knew about, Shen Tang couldn't help curling her toes tightly.","She really didn't want to see him right now.","Seeing Shen Tang's face flashing through various colors, Shen Yu and Shen Boyuan exchanged a glance without saying anything.","Shen Boyuan patted Shen Yu on the shoulder and mouthed: \"Take good care of your sister, or I'll skin you alive!\"","Shen Yu: \"...\"","What a scumbag dad!","Now that he had a niece, he didn't even want his own son anymore!","He took advantage of the fact that Shen Boyuan couldn't scold him in front of Shen Tang by rolling his eyes dramatically and pulling down his lower eyelids.","Shen Boyuan: \"...\"","I really went too easy on him.","Does he think he'll never get a beating again?","Coming back to her senses, Shen Tang saw that her uncle had already left and Shen Yu was dozing off beside her.","\"You're feeling sleepy already so early?\"","\"It's not early, sister. Look at what time it is.\"","When Shen Tang checked her phone, she realized it was already nighttime. There were many messages on WeChat. She opened it up and saw that Gu Huaian had only sent one message. The rest were from Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng, those two fools.","[Gu Huaian: Tang, I'm sorry. I didn't say anything before because I didn't know how to bring it up.","At first, I just thought it was very interesting. Then I accidentally discovered your secret and found out you don't belong to this world.","I don't know when it started, but I had already fallen in love with knowing things about how cute you are that only I know about.","I did think about telling you, but I was afraid that once you knew, you would choose to leave me.","Ultimately, things got to where they are today because I hid things from you. I will find a way to get the master to resolve this problem.]","Shen Tang did not reply. Instead, she opened Cen Songbai's WeChat and took a look.","[Brother-in-law, did you and Brother Gu have a falling out?]","[Brother Gu drank a lot and smoked so many cigarettes. [Image.jpg] [Image.jpg]]","When Shen Tang enlarged the images, there were over a dozen bottles visible. There was also a candid shot of a haggard-looking Gu Huaian that looked nothing like his usual self.","Even looking awful, he was still so handsome.","Catching herself thinking this way, Shen Tang scolded herself harshly for a second.","Shen Tang ah Shen Tang, you really are a sucker for good looks. You're hopeless.","[Sister-in-law, when are you coming back?]","[OMG! Brother Gu looks like he wants to become a monk! He's having people look for very spiritual temples and Taoist abbeys!]","[Sister-in-law....]","Shen Tang felt this person was a duck that had cultivated into a spirit. How could he talk so much?","When she opened up Fu Junsheng's WeChat, it was barely any different from Cen Songbai's.","However, unlike Cen Songbai, he didn't ask when Shen Tang was coming back. He just carefully wrote down everything Gu Huaian said and forwarded it to her, adding: [Sister-in-law, I stand staunchly on your side. Brother Gu must have done something wrong. Don't worry. From now on, I'll be your insider and tell you about all of Brother Gu's comings and goings.]","Shen Tang: \"...\"","To be honest, she was a little dubious about trusting him.","What if Fu Junsheng were to say the same kinds of things to Gu Huaian about her?","It wasn't entirely impossible.","After thinking about it for a bit, she typed up a reply and sent it over.","[Alright, I'll play some ranked matches with you later.]","[Fu Junsheng: Thank you sister-in-law! Let's secretly duo without Cen Songbai. He feeds too much. If it weren't for him last time, we wouldn't have lost with just one hand!]","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Was it possible they were evenly matched and not that far apart in skill level? Then stop with the pot calling the kettle black.","[Hopeless Romantic Monkey: Sure]","On the other side, just as Shen Tang expected, as soon as the message was sent, Fu Junsheng happily slapped his thighs and exclaimed, \"Hahaha! I knew it. Sister-in-law truly loves me!\"","Right after he said this, he felt the temperature around him drop.","He quickly changed his words: \"What I meant is that sister-in-law truly takes me as her little brother.\"","Only then did Gu Huaian withdraw his gaze. He couldn't help asking: \"Did she...mention me?\"","Fu Junsheng briskly shook his head. \"No.\"","Beside them, Cen Songbai was green with envy and hatred. He took a look at his phone and saw that sister-in-law indeed didn't reply to him. Was it that she didn't like him?","But right then, an emoji got sent over.","Even though there were no words, it was still a reply!","Cen Songbai was also excitedly running circles around the sofa.","\"Ahhhh! Sister-in-law replied to me too!\"","After making two rounds, he stopped in front of Gu Huaian and blurted out: \"Brother Gu, sister-in-law replied to you too right? Did she say when she's coming back?\"","Fu Junsheng: \"...\"","Inner OS: Where does this guy get off calling me stupid? Isn't he way dumber than me!?","Gu Huaian's hand paused. Looking at the empty chat window, his heart sank.","But being not deleted or blocked was also good news.","Gu Huaian turned off his phone screen and got up saying: \"I'm going back to my room first. You guys take it easy.\"","He had to thoroughly look into how to get rid of this mind reading ability.","He had a feeling that until the mind reading went away, Tang wouldn't come back.","So the most important thing right now was finding the most famous temples, Taoist abbeys and masters nationwide.","On the other side, Cen Assistant had just gotten off from overtime work at the company when he received this request.","Cen Assistant wanted to curse out loud. He opened up his phone and took a look at the balance inside that could easily last him half a lifetime. Instantly, he became perfectly calm and peaceful.","[Of course, Boss Gu!]","But he was rather curious why Boss Gu would suddenly ask for these things.","Could it be related to compatibility fortune-telling or something?","Could it be good news is approaching?","Cen Assistant pushed his glasses up the bridge of his nose, mouth turning up at the corners. As the matchmaker here, wouldn't he then get to receive red packets?"]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Can't be a love brain","paragraphs":["After lying at home for two days, Shen Tang started working again. It's hard to say, working people don't even have time to be sentimental. The movies and TV shows she shot before are finally going to be released, and there are a lot of things to be busy with in between, Shen Tang is busy day and night, and has no time to think about Gu Huaian at all.","In addition, the \"Cute Baby Charge Forward\" that she had previously promised Anran and Wuyang is also about to start shooting. Although Shen Tang didn't want to see Gu Huaian, she didn't have much opinion on the two little ones. She made an appointment with them in advance and was going to meet to discuss the variety show in detail.","Recently, Shen Tang has been coming home very late every day. At first, the Shen family waited for her to come back before resting, and even heated up meals for her. Shen Tang felt sorry, so she told them not to wait anymore.","Shen Boyuan worried, \"Why don't you let Shen Yu pick you up every day? You are a girl, it's not safe so late.\"","There was not the slightest reluctance on Shen Yu's face. \"Yeah, sister Tangtang, I'll pick you up.\"","Although the driver is often used by the family, there are still incidents of drivers hurting people. Plus Shen Tang is beautiful herself and has money.","Shen Tang waved her hand, \"Have you forgotten about my strength? I'm strong, taking down two adult men is not a problem.\"","Shen Boyuan still wanted to say something, Shen Yu squeezed in and sat between him and Shen Tang.","He looked at Shen Tang's arm admiringly, \"Sister Tangtang, how did you get such great strength? Is it innate?\"","Shen Tang hesitated for a moment before nodding, \"It's innate.\"","Shen Yu was extremely envious. \"How come I didn't inherit it, even though we are siblings?\"","Shen Tang was a little nervous. She didn’t understand the other Shen family members, and didn’t know if this strength was inherited from her mother. Carefully recalling the original, it seemed that she had never exposed that she had great strength. Shen Tang even suspected that this might have been brought over from her previous life.","She looked at Shen Boyuan and his wife nervously, only to see Shen Boyuan sigh, \"I heard your grandma say before that her father, your great grandmother, was also very strong. At that time, it was still during the war, she single-handedly tore the Japanese soldiers apart and saved a whole village of people. I thought she was exaggerating to trick me at the time. Now it looks like it might be true.\"","After speaking, he looked at Shen Tang expectantly.","Shen Tang: \"???\"","Wait, uncle, why are you looking at me?!","Tearing Japanese soldiers apart by hand?!","Shen Yu was shocked with his mouth wide open. This is a plot that can only be seen in TV series!","He hurriedly asked, \"Sister Tangtang, can you tear people apart?\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","\"Well... murder is illegal, and I've never tried it. Anyway, tearing stuff is quite easy.\"","Shen Yu and Shen Boyuan both regretfully retracted their eyes.","Wait, why the hell are you guys regretful?!","That day, when Shen Tang came home from work at night and had just gotten out of the car, a black shadow darted out, giving her a fright.","In the light of the street lamp, she saw the person who came was Gu Huaian.","Carefully calculating, it seemed that the two hadn't seen each other for a while.","He seemed to be well dressed, but his eyes were black, looking extremely tired.","\"You......\"","Just as she was about to care about him, Shen Tang remembered the mind reading and quickly took a few steps back.","Gu Huaian also took a few steps back and hid in the dark.","Although he could still hear her at this distance, he was desperately trying not to think.","\"Tangtang, I came to tell you that I'm going away for a while, maybe for a long time before I come back.\"","\"Where...where are you going?\"","\"Cen Assistant found out that a great master is very powerful. He is wandering around right now and his whereabouts are uncertain. Some people said they saw him in Tibet. I'm going there to take a look.\"","In fact, Gu Huaian didn’t have much hope in his heart, but in any case, he had to go take a look.","Also, no one else could know about this. He had to go himself.","During this time, although the two had not contacted each other, Gu Huaian had been silently paying attention to Shen Tang all the time, knowing that she was very busy recently. He was also sensible enough not to bother her.","However, this time, he didn’t know how long he would be away. He planned to find the grandmaster before returning.","So he selfishly wanted to come and see Shen Tang once.","He had waited here for a long time and thought of hundreds of scenarios, but never expected that Shen Tang would have almost no reaction, as if he was an unimportant stranger.","Gu Huaian’s heart sank.","It was quiet all around with the two standing face to face a few meters apart. Only the sound of the night wind could be heard.","Shen Tang clutched the corners of her clothes and said, \"Well then, I wish you a smooth journey.\"","Gu Huaian slowly nodded, \"Okay, you take good care of yourself too. If anything comes up, you can ask Cen Assistant or Cen Songbai for help. \"","\"Um. I'll go in first then.\"","\"Okay.\"","Gu Huaian looked at Shen Tang longingly and painfully as she walked step by step into the gate until she disappeared from sight.","He leaned against the wall and clicked softly, a point of crimson lit up.","Gu Huaian lit a cigarette and took a puff, gently exhaling it out.","He didn't used to smoke much, only occasionally one or two. But now he actually got addicted to the feeling.","Just then, footsteps sounded and Gu Huaian looked at Shen Tang who had returned with a cigarette in his mouth.","He panicked and quickly took out the cigarette and put it out.","\"Tangtang......\"","Shen Tang looked away, holding out what was in her hand, \"This is for you.\"","\"Don't get me wrong. I placed the order a long time ago, it just arrived these two days.\"","Gu Huaian was overjoyed and eagerly took the bag, \"I'll keep it well.\"","\"What I gave you is yours now. Do whatever you want with it. I'm leaving.\"","Shen Tang walked two steps and then stopped again, saying, \"Oh right, it's best if you smoke less.\"","\"Okay!\"","Until Shen Tang left, the smile on Gu Huaian's face never faded.","Tangtang gave him a gift and cared about him. Doesn't this mean she still cares about him!","Gu Huaian's previous decadence was completely swept away, and he regained his spirit.","He habitually reached into his pocket for cigarettes, suddenly remembering Shen Tang’s words. He immediately threw away a whole pack of cigarettes into the trash can.","No more smoking!","After Shen Tang returned to the room, she couldn’t help but keep thinking about Gu Huaian.","When she was busy there wasn't much impact, but meeting him this time, the suppressed love surged up like a huge wave, almost drowning Shen Tang.","She couldn't help wondering if he was okay, and if he had been missing her.","From the looks of it, he did. Shen Tang's heart couldn't help but stir up some sneaky joy.","But letting her pretend nothing had happened and be together like before was impossible.","She could only hope that on this trip, he could really find the so-called grandmaster and resolve this matter.","After sitting by the bed for a long time, Shen Tang still couldn't help herself. She walked to the window and gently pulled the curtains aside to look towards the door.","The distance was a bit far and she couldn't see too clearly. But there was no light, so she guessed the person should have left already.","Shen Tang felt a little disappointed, yet thought it normal. After all, it was very late now, even the Shen family members had gone to bed early.","Just then, a figure emerged from the dark side and looked at the window before leaving.","Shen Tang didn't know why, such a trivial matter actually made her feel a little happy.","She couldn't be a lovesick fool, could she!"]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: Someone's not gonna Break the Guard.","paragraphs":["It had been a few days since Gu Huaian said he would go find the master, and although Shen Tang and he hadn't been chatting, she could see Gu Huaian's latest updates on her social media feed every day.","She knew those updates were meant for her.","As for Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng, they didn't go together.","Days went by in an orderly fashion, and on this day, Shen Tang finished work early and returned home.","Since she arrived home, Shen Tang hadn't seen any other members of the Shen family. Tonight was the banquet hosted by the Shen family's main branch.","Their branch was not particularly famous, and they held no real power in the company, receiving only a small dividend each year.","But Shen Tang actually thought it was fine this way. After all, her uncle and aunt's personalities were clearly not suited for dealing with people in the workplace.","As soon as Shen Tang arrived home, her aunt came to greet her.","She linked her arm with Shen Tang's and said as they walked, \"Tang Tang, you finally came back. The evening gowns have been delivered. Take a look and see which one you like.\"","\"I can go with any of them.\"","\"No, you must pick the one you like the most. Our Tang Tang will definitely dazzle everyone at the event.\"","It had to be said that her aunt had a great sense of aesthetics. Every gown was beautiful and had a Chinese style to it.","When Shen Tang put one on, at first glance, one would think she was a gentle and graceful beauty from Jiangnan.","Of course, that was on the condition that she didn't argue with anyone.","After all, her mouth was too sharp.","Her aunt was a bit hesitant and looked at Shen Yu, saying, \"Xiaoyu, which one do you think looks better?\"","\"Whatever Tang Tang wears will look good.\"","\"Pick the one that looks the best.\"","Shen Yu was quite conflicted and said, \"I can't decide.\"","\"What's the use of you then?\"","Shen Yu: \"...\"","He couldn't argue with his dad, but he still didn't dare to argue with his mom. He stood there, feeling wronged and not daring to say a word.","Shen Tang realized that it seemed like everyone in the Shen family had a bit of decision-making difficulty.","She chose a lotus pink dress that wasn't too plain or too flashy, just right.","\"Okay, then this one. The others can be saved for another time.\"","After everything was packed up, the family got into the car and headed to the banquet.","It wasn't Shen Tang's first time attending a banquet, but it was the first time she felt so nervous.","Her aunt gently patted her hand and said, \"Don't be afraid, most of the people in the Shen family... um, are good people. The main purpose of going this time is to introduce you to them, just meet each other. If you don't want to see them in the future, you don't have to. Anyway, the relationship isn't that good.\"","Hearing these words, Shen Tang suspected that there was something she didn't know.","However, \"What do you mean by 'most of the people are good'? Are there bad people too?\"","There shouldn't be anyone doing anything wicked, right?","Her aunt hesitated and didn't say anything, but Shen Yu didn't care about those things and said directly:","\"It's nothing, just that some people are very focused on their own interests, preparing to sell their daughters. In the end, that sister didn't even come back home.\"","Shen Tang inexplicably felt that these words sounded familiar, but upon careful consideration, it seemed unlikely. The world couldn't be that small, right?","After they arrived at the banquet, Shen Tang unexpectedly found out that the world was indeed that small.","After briefly greeting the people from the main branch of the Shen family, Shen Tang was free to move around.","It has to be said, the outfit I'm wearing today is quite deceiving, as many men who approached were turned away by Shen Yu.","He whispered, \"Sister Tangtang, I know all these guys, none of them are any good.\"","Although he didn't like Gu Huaian, compared to these people, Gu Huaian was still better.","Shen Tang was curious and couldn't help but ask, \"What's wrong with them? Any juicy gossip?\"","\"See that guy with the big quiff? He has eighteen mistresses. Last week, I saw him going to the urology clinic for a check-up.\"","Shen Tang widened her eyes. Wow, there's actually gossip, and it's such an exciting one.","\"Wait, how did you know?\"","She became suspicious. Could it be that Shen Yu also...","Should she tell her uncle and aunt about this?","Shen Yu: \"...\"","\"No, I was just driving by.\"","\"Oh~\"","Shen Yu took a deep breath and looked at another man wearing a floral shirt. \"Don't judge him by his playboy appearance. In reality, he's quite innocent. He was deceived by his online girlfriend and still hasn't gotten over it.\"","\"Why doesn't he go after her?\"","\"What's there to pursue? That online girlfriend turned out to be a guy.\"","Shen Tang almost burst out laughing. How amusing, she never expected to encounter an online joke in real life.","But it seems like this guy is also quite pitiful.","\"Don't feel sorry for him either. When he was younger, he did some bad things, like bullying a female classmate. And that online girlfriend seems to be the brother of that girl.\"","Wow, it's like a novel plot.","Suddenly, Shen Tang noticed someone familiar not far away.","She tapped Shen Yu's arm and said, \"I'm going to take a look ahead, wait for me here.\"","Shen Tang walked over, and when she saw the person walking faster, she couldn't help but quicken her pace and jogged over.","Just as she turned the corner, she was pressed against the wall.","\"Tangtang?\"","\"What are you doing here?\" Shen Lan let go.","Shen Tang was pleasantly surprised, \"Sister Lan, it's really you!\"","\"I came with my family.\" Shen Tang briefly explained what had happened recently.","Shen Lan sighed, \"I heard about it before, but I never expected that person to be you.\"","\"Yeah, I never thought I had family either. By the way, Sister Lan, why are you here too? Are you also a member of the Shen family?\"","A trace of mockery flashed across Shen Lan's face, \"I'd rather not be a member of the Shen family.\"","\"I came back this time to see my mom. I heard she was sick, but it turned out she faked it to trick me into coming for a blind date.\"","\"Huh?\"","Shen Tang was truly surprised this time. She never expected someone to do something like that.","\"So, what about you now?\"","\"I was originally planning to leave, but since you're here, I won't go just yet. It's been so long since I've seen you. How have you been? And what about Gu Huaian? Didn't he come with you this time?\"","Shen Tang awkwardly smiled. She didn't even know what relationship she and Gu Huaian had now.","If she said they were together, they wouldn't even contact each other.","If she said they weren't together, there's still the marriage certificate lying there, and they both have feelings for each other.","\"He didn't come.\"","Shen Lan noticed that Shen Tang's expression seemed off and tactfully changed the subject.","The two of them had an incredibly engaging conversation, and Shen Tang couldn't help but think that there was no such thing as an instant connection. It turns out that there was a predestined relationship between them all along, and unexpectedly, Lanjie (older sister) turned out to be her sister.","\"Miss Shen, I didn't expect to find you here.\"","A male voice sounded, and Shen Tang looked over to see a handsome man standing not far away, a faint smile playing on his lips.","Shen Lan's face instantly changed.","Shen Tang was a bit confused and refrained from speaking rashly.","\"I don't know who this is...\"","The man looked at Shen Tang, a hint of amazement flashing in his eyes.","Shen Lan shifted her position, placing herself between Shen Tang and the man. \"This is my younger sister. What business do you have with Young Master Zhou?\"","The man named Young Master Zhou regretfully withdrew his gaze. \"Can't I look for you if there's nothing going on? After all, we are engaged.\"","Shen Lan's face turned cold as she spoke, \"Young Master Zhou seems to have misunderstood something. I never agreed to it.\"","Young Master Zhou's expression also became unusually ugly. \"What do you mean?\"","Shen Tang poked her head out from behind Shen Lan. \"Sir, can't you understand? Sister Lanjie said she didn't agree to the engagement with you.\"","\"Heh, do you think I'm willing to be engaged to you? Besides a little bit of looks, what else do you have? If it weren't for your father begging my family, do you think you would have a chance to be engaged to me?\"","\"You don't have to worry about that, Young Master Zhou.\"","Shen Tang couldn't hold back and retorted, \"Better to have some looks than to have none at all. If you don't have a mirror, there's always urine. Why don't you take a look at yourself and see if you're worthy!\"","Young Master Zhou's face turned livid, and he couldn't help but raise his hand.","Shen Tang sarcastically said, \"Oh dear, is someone losing control and about to hit a woman? Surely not!\""]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Deep Deep of Tang Dynasty","paragraphs":["It had to be said, Shen Tang was simply unparalleled when it came to being annoying.","Young Master Zhou was so angry that he was practically grinding his teeth, he was just about to get violent.","However, even if he did get violent, Shen Tang was unafraid. With his weak physique, she could take out ten of him with one punch.","\"Who are you from? Do you know who I am?\" Young Master Zhou looked Shen Tang up and down, \"If you apologize now, there's still time. Otherwise...\"","\"Otherwise what? Go home and tell your dad to kill me?\"","Young Master Zhou: \"...\"","Why was this person so different from everyone else he had met?","His family was still somewhat famous, how could there be someone unafraid of him?","\"Hmph, I'll remember you. What's your name?\"","Shen Tang stood up straight, \"A person's name is given by their parents, I'm called Tang Shenshen!\"","Shen Lan stifled her laughter.","Tang Shenshen, Shen Tang, pfft!","Surname Tang?","No matter how much Young Master Zhou thought about it, he couldn't figure out which Tang Family she was from.","He had a feeling that continuing this conversation would only embarrass him further, so Young Master Zhou glared viciously at Shen Tang and Shen Lan and said, \"Good, very good. Just you wait!\"","\"Go ahead, I'll be right here waiting for you. Remember to go find your parents quickly!\"","Shen Lan nearly laughed out loud. Shen Tang's sharp tongue really made people love her and hate her.","Shen Lan played along, \"Young Master Zhou is an adult, he wouldn't go tattling to parents, would he?\"","Young Master Zhou: \"...\"","He did actually want to tell his parents.","\"Haha, how could that be?\"","Having his thoughts seen through was a bit embarrassing. He shot the two another fierce glare before leaving.","Shen Tang felt awful, \"Sis Lan, how could your family arrange a marriage for you with someone like him?\"","Firstly, arranged marriages themselves were wrong to begin with, especially since Sis Lan already had a girlfriend. Just forcing her back home through deceit and marrying her off to a worthless man was truly disgusting.","Shen Tang couldn't imagine how Sis Lan felt right now.","Shen Lan stroked Shen Tang's head, \"Don't worry about me. I broke ties with them long ago. I just didn't expect my mother to deceive me using illness this time...\"","\"Rest assured, I won't be coming back here ever again.\"","Shen Tang nodded firmly, \"That's right, never coming back here again.\"","While the two were happily chatting on one side, Shen Yu had been standing in the same spot the entire time waiting for people, to the point his legs were numb.","He wanted to leave, but was afraid Shen Tang wouldn't be able to find him when she came back, so he continued standing there like a fool.","He kept standing there until Shen Tang returned.","Shen Yu complained aggrievedly, \"Sis Tang, did you forget about me?\"","Shen Tang lightly coughed. She did actually forget about him.","But could she admit that? Of course not.","She righteously declared, \"How could that be? I just ran into an annoying pest of a man earlier which held me up a bit.\"","Well, it wasn't a complete lie, she just omitted how little time it took to scare the guy off.","Shen Yu instantly forgot about what just happened, \"Sis Tang, who was it? Did he bully you? I'll go beat him up for you.\"","\"A man surnamed Zhou.\" Shen Lan looked at Shen Tang and said, \"It was Young Master Zhou.\"","Shen Yu instantly deflated, \"No good, I can't beat him.\"","\"Is he very powerful?\"","\"It's not that he's powerful, but his mom is.\"","Shen Yu looked left and right before lowering his voice, \"Everyone knows his dad has money, but in reality it's all from his mom. His maternal grandfather runs the black market, his mom is a mob princess.\"","Shen Tang was a little apprehensive afterwards, \"I didn't offend him too badly did I? It won't bring trouble to the family right?\"","\"His mom isn't an unreasonable person. Generally speaking, if he provoked things first, then there's no issue.\"","Only then did Shen Tang relax.","\"That's good. I gave him a fake name anyway.\"","Not knowing the other party's strength, it would be foolish to give a real name.","Shen Lan smiled, \"Don't worry, I know his mom. She's a very good person. He said he wouldn't tell his parents, so he definitely won't, since he can't lose face like that.\"","These rich second generation kids did have one advantage, most cared a lot about face, so they usually kept their word.","Shen Tang was completely reassured after that.","That guy was clearly the type who cared too much about face.","Only then did Shen Yu notice that Shen Tang and Shen Lan seemed quite close.","\"You two...know each other?\"","Shen Tang hugged Shen Lan's arm, \"Yup! I didn't expect Sis Lan to actually be my sister!\"","Shen Yu wasn't actually very familiar with Shen Lan, but he did know about her past. It could be said no one in the Shen Family didn't know.","To be honest, Shen Yu quite admired her deep down. After all, not everyone could bear to give up such wealth and status.","\"Sis Lan, then you coming back this time is...\"","Shen Tang directly knocked Shen Yu on the head, \"Why do you talk so much!\"","\"Seems like there's nothing else right now. Can we go? I'm getting a bit hungry.\" Shen Tang rubbed her stomach.","After working she had started getting dressed up and came straight here. Not to mention eating, she had barely drank anything.","It wasn't like she couldn't eat here, but it made her uncomfortable. She'd rather not eat.","Of course, the most important reason was she was afraid of running into Young Master Zhou again.","Shen Yu nodded, \"Then let me go tell my mom first.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang and Shen Lan went to the small garden in the yard to wait.","Soon after, they saw the butler leading several men in black directly over.","Shen Tang inexplicably felt they were here for her and Shen Lan, and they were up to no good.","She took a step forward, shielding Shen Lan behind her.","Sure enough, the butler stopped right in front of them.","\"Miss.\"","Shen Lan ignored him.","\"Pardon me.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the men behind the butler rushed forward together.","Shen Tang was caught off guard. What was this? Boldly assaulting people in broad daylight?","Oh no, it seemed they wanted to abduct them instead."]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: He's in the Shower","paragraphs":["Shen Lan was very angry: \"What you are doing is illegal!\"","\"Young lady, don't be so stubborn,\" the butler sighed deeply, as if he were a man of high morals looking at an unruly child.","A man of high morals? Bah!","Shen Tang punched and kicked with all her might. With a left hook and a right hook, plus the thought of protecting sister Lan fueling her, she soon beat those men down.","But they would not stop unless the butler told them to, even if they were injured.","If this dragged on, Shen Tang would eventually become exhausted.","Shen Lan closed her eyes. \"Call them off if I go back with you.\"","\"Sister Lan!\"","\"You can't go back with him!\"","Who knows if you would be married off to Young Master Zhou then, ruining your life!","Shen Lan bit her lip. She didn't expect her family to send people to abduct her like this - it was practically tearing off all pretense.","Even though there was no love lost between them, Shen Lan still didn't think they would take such measures.","She gave Shen Tang a reassuring look and stepped forward. \"Stop it now!\"","The butler smiled and said, \"That's right, know when to quit when you're ahead, young lady. This way please!\"","Shen Lan walked forward a few steps. Shen Tang wanted to follow but was blocked by the men.","She was furious and regretted not properly learning some self-defense, having wasted all her strength.","She must save sister Lan!","After the people left, these men also dispersed.","Shen Tang couldn't wait to find Shen Yu, wanting to know more details about sister Lan's family.","Upon hearing about this, Shen Yu's brows furrowed and he didn't look happy.","\"Is it very difficult?\"","\"It's quite difficult. I forgot to tell you earlier, sister Lan is the daughter of the Shen family's main branch. Her father engaged in shady dealings early on, but no one could find evidence because he has connections up top.\"","Shen Tang's heart sank.","This was bad. Could she only watch as sister Lan gets married off like goods?","She couldn't accept that.","Shen Tang touched her phone. The only person she could think of was Gu Huaian.","But their relationship was a little awkward now and she felt bad about asking him for help.","However, besides him she really didn't know who else to look for.","After some hesitation, sister Lan's safety was still more important.","Shen Tang opened WeChat, found Gu Huaian's profile, and sent a message: [Are you there? I need your help with something.]","She didn't get a reply after waiting forever and felt restless.","He must be busy, she told herself.","Soon her phone rang. Shen Tang looked expectantly but her face instantly froze.","The screen read: [Sorry, he's showering. Ask him to call you back later!]","Shen Tang blinked in confusion, stunned for a moment.","She looked closely - it was indeed Gu Huaian's WeChat.","She typed and deleted several drafts before erasing everything.","Shen Yu noticed Shen Tang's sudden change in expression and grew very concerned. \"Sister Tang, are you alright?\"","Shen Tang clutched her chest. It hurt so much... Her eyes stung as if tears would fall any second.","She tilted her head back, forcefully suppressing the urge to cry, and shook her head. \"I'm fine.\"","Shen Yu was even more worried.","You don't look fine at all.","He secretly glanced at the screen and naturally saw the message too.","Good going, Gu Huaian. You just left and are already looking for girls. Still wanting to get back together with my sister? Keep dreaming!","\"Sister Tang, a three-legged toad is hard to find but two-legged men are everywhere. Don't worry, I'll find you ten or eight fresh meat that are definitely better than that scumbag ex.\"","If he couldn't win in quality, at least he could in quantity, right? Also, Gu Huaian was already in his thirties while little milk dogs and wolf cubs were fragrant. Who knows if that old guy was even capable anymore?","Shen Tang managed a smile but it looked worse than crying.","Just then, WeChat rang again. Shen Tang lowered her eyes and froze again.","[Gu Huaian: Tang Tang, my friend sent that message earlier. What's the matter?]","Then a video followed, panning the room to show it empty except for a bald man grinning at the camera.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","So she got sad over nothing?","Shen Yu also saw the video and got furious.","\"This guy has problems! Saying misleading things on purpose!\"","Shen Tang deeply agreed.","Looking closely at the chat record, it seemed that person didn't actually send anything inappropriate. They had just assumed the worst.","Perhaps from reading too many melodramatic stories, Shen Tang's first thought was of Gu Huaian with some girl...","It was also then she realized her lack of security and trust in Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang inwardly reprimanded herself for a second.","Getting back on track, Shen Tang hastily explained sister Lan's situation.","Gu Huaian immediately called.","\"Don't worry, Tang Tang, I'll handle this.\"","\"Okay, thanks.\"","\"We don't need to be so polite. Oh right, you didn't misunderstand about my friend earlier, did you?\"","Shen Tang guiltily rubbed her nose. \"No, I know you aren't that kind of person.\"","The other end emitted a laugh that didn't belong to Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang's face instantly flushed.","How annoying!","Gu Huaian walked a few steps before tentatively asking, \"Tang Tang, how have you been lately?\"","What he really wanted to ask was if she missed him at all.","But he was afraid of getting an answer he didn't want to hear.","Shen Tang hesitated without replying. Instead she asked, \"Do you have any leads on the mage's whereabouts?\"","\"Tang Tang, it's grandmaster, not mage.\"","Right after Gu Huaian finished speaking, more laughter sounded from the phone.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Damn it, too much King of Glory made her look dumb!","She tried to salvage her dignity, \"Cough, close enough. After all, grandmasters with those kinds of abilities aren't ordinary people either.\"","\"Right, what Tang Tang said makes sense.\" There was a hint of laughter in Gu Huaian's agreeing words while Shen Tang pretended not to notice.","Luckily the distance made things less awkward since her toes were already curling from embarrassment.","Really, all this toe aerobics was tiring indeed.","On the other hand, Shen Yu walked away, not wanting to bear witness to their dog food flirting. Still, bits of Shen Tang and Gu Huaian's conversation entered his ears.","He noticed his sister Tang's voice unconsciously became gentler whenever she talked to Gu Huaian.","Tsk, women. Saying no but loving it to death inside.","Shen Yu clucked his tongue. Luckily today's misunderstanding got resolved, otherwise he wouldn't let Gu Huaian off if the guy really wronged Sister Tang.","Although the Shens didn't have much power, they could always handle things more underhandedly.","Sack beating still worked as punishment, humph. He'd get each and every one of them."]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Cherish the Moment","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian did not know what method he used, but the next day, Shen Tang received a message that she could go pick someone up.","When she arrived at the Shen family's door, Lan Sister had just been released by the Shen family.","Shen Tang jogged over, \"Lan Sister, are you okay? Did they bully you?\"","Shen Lan shook her head, \"No.\"","It was just being locked up over and over again.","When she was young, she was very afraid of being locked in the little black room, but now that she had grown up, using that to deal with her was useless.","The steward's expression did not look very good, as if he was enduring anger.","He sent Shen Tang to the front gate and said, \"Miss, instead of living a life of wealth and nobility, why do you insist on living such a bitter life?\"","\"I just like to suffer,\" Shen Tang replied.","\"Humph, there is a saying that goes, 'rely on the mountain and the mountain will collapse, rely on the person and the person will run away.' I hope your mountain can always be there.\"","Shen Tang interjected, \"Don't worry, even if you die, he won't collapse.\"","The steward was so angry that his beard stood on end and his eyes glared.","He really wanted to scold her, but was afraid to offend the Gu family, so he could only grit his teeth and swallow this humiliation.","\"Haha, Miss Shen is joking.\"","\"I'm not joking, I'm telling the truth. Looking at you, you must be seventy or eighty years old already. Working as a housekeeper at such an old age, tsk tsk, it must be tiring.\"","Steward: \"...\"","\"Humph, sharp tongue.\"","\"Well, I am a bit sharper than you, old man. Those teeth of yours must be dentures, right?\"","Steward: Ahhhhhhhh!","I really want to sew up that mouth. What a pretty girl, but her words are so unpleasant!","He was afraid that he would die from anger if he kept talking, so he hurriedly turned and left.","Shen Tang made a grimace at his back.","Don't say she doesn't respect the elderly, she just couldn't respect this kind of person.","Judging from his looks, he was not a good person.","Shen Tang stated this directly. Shen Lan looked at her in shock for a moment, \"You can even read faces?\"","\"No, I just had a feeling. Lan Sister, don't you think he looks just like a villain's lackey?\"","Shen Lan held back her laugh and nodded, \"That's right, he is not a good person.\"","Although she had left home early, she still knew some inside information. The steward's hands were stained with blood.","However, the time was too long ago, and there was no evidence, so the matter could only be left unsettled.","Hearing this, Shen Tang frowned. \"So did he bully you before?\"","She had noticed earlier that although the steward addressed her as \"Miss\", he did not actually show any respect, and he did not go easy on Lan Sister either.","Shen Lan seemed to think of something, her face extremely ugly, but still shook her head with a smile, \"It's all in the past.\"","In fact, when she was little, she had a very good relationship with the steward.","Since her parents did not pay much attention to her, with her father busy with work and her mother busy shopping, it was just her and the steward at home.","At that time, she truly respected him as an elder.","Until he stretched out his sinful hands towards her...","Shen Lan blinked. Fortunately, it was all in the past, and she had completely moved on.","However, she would not let this old guy off the hook. She would let him enjoy for a while first.","Shen Tang sensitively sensed that Lan Sister was hiding something from her, but she did not intend to get to the bottom of it. Judging from her expression, it was definitely not something good.","She hugged Shen Lan, \"It's over now, it's all in the past. If they dare to bully you again in the future, I will hit them.\"","In her heart, Shen Tang weakly added: If I can't beat them, I'll ask Gu Huaian for help.","She understood very well about acting tough when you can't back it up. Anyway, no effort wasted, cough.","Shen Tang sent Shen Lan home and was about to leave when Shen Lan pulled her back.","\"Do you want to meet my girlfriend?\"","\"Is that okay?\"","\"Why not?\"","Shen Lan had few confidantes until she met Shen Tang, so she did not mind showing her weakness to her.","Following Shen Lan, Shen Tang saw a comatose person for the first time.","She had thought that comatose people would just lie still in bed. Later, she accidentally saw some science articles explaining that comatose people can move, laugh, eat, drink, pee and poop, they just don't have their own consciousness. Just thinking about it made Shen Tang feel sad.","Now, when she first saw Lan Sister's girlfriend, she had neat short hair and was very beautiful, a good match for Lan Sister.","When she saw Lan Sister, she curved her lips slightly and smiled.","Shen Lan walked over and kissed her cheek, \"Did you miss me while I was away?\"","Naturally there was no answer.","There were usually high-end caregivers here, but Lan Sister preferred to take care of her girlfriend herself.","As Shen Tang watched her help her girlfriend wash her face, brush her teeth, change her clothes and eat, her eyes grew hot.","Perhaps this was true love, unconstrained by gender.","\"I wasn't naturally gay, I just happened to fall for someone of the same sex,\" said Shen Lan.","She looked at Shen Tang, \"Accidents and tomorrow are unpredictable, so I hope you can cherish the present and every day you have with your loved one.\"","Shen Tang pursed her lips. Although she and Lan Sister were close, she still could not say her biggest secret.","\"Our situations are a bit different.\"","Shen Lan's movements paused for a moment. \"Yes, they're different.\"","Shen Tang reacted and quickly explained, \"Lan Sister, I didn't mean anything else. I just wanted to say, Gu Huaian and I—\"","\"No need to explain, I understand. But I still hope that you two can be happy together. I've known him for many years too, and this is the first time I've seen him so serious.\"","Shen Tang nodded. \"When he comes back, I will forgive him.\"","It was just mind reading anyway, no big deal, just a bit embarrassing.","Shen Tang tried hard to reassure herself, but it was useless.","Mind reading was quite scary after all, boo hoo hoo...","She could only hope that Gu Huaian really found the master and completely resolved this problem.","It was not until dusk that Shen Tang returned home, only to find her family sitting on the sofa waiting for her.","Shen Tang had the urge to run away. She carefully recalled and was sure she didn't do anything, right?","Her uncle lightly coughed. \"Tangtang, why are you only coming back now?\"","\"I went to a friend's house.\"","\"Oh oh, nothing happened on the road, right?\"","\"Nope.\" Shen Tang was a little confused. She really didn't encounter anything on the way.","Seeing that her uncle was beating around the bush, her aunt became impatient and asked directly: \"Tangtang, do you know Second Young Master Zhou?\"","Shen Tang looked at Shen Yu first. Seeing that he was also confused, her heart tightened for a moment.","\"I do, I'm sorry, I—\"","Her aunt nodded knowingly. \"No wonder his mother wants to meet you.\"","Shen Tang was speechless halfway through her sentence. \"Huh?\"","Second Young Master Zhou's mother wanted to meet her?"]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: Help me discipline my Son.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang's unexpected behavior surprised not only Shen Yu but also Shen Boyuan.","According to reason, Second Young Master Zhou shouldn't have gone to complain to his mother.","Both of them had obvious guilty expressions, and Uncle Shen Boyuan narrowed his eyes and asked, \"What's the matter? Are you hiding something from us?\"","Shen Tang and Shen Yu exchanged a glance, but neither of them understood the secret signal the other was trying to convey.","\"Well...\" Shen Tang hesitated.","\"No!\" Shen Yu firmly interrupted.","Shen Boyuan raised an eyebrow, \"Hmm?\"","Shen Tang and Shen Yu exchanged another glance and quickly changed their tune, \"No, nothing!\"","\"Yes, you do!\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","This was an utter mess. It was rare to see them so out of sync.","Shen Yu covered his face directly, realizing they were in deep trouble.","Before they could confess honestly, Shen Boyuan had already grabbed his belt and started to lash out.","Auntie Shen stood by and turned a blind eye, ignoring Shen Yu's pleading gaze.","\"Oh, so it's your fault for corrupting your sister! I asked you to protect her, not lead her astray.\"","As Shen Boyuan was about to strike, Shen Tang reached out and blocked him.","The whip wasn't too heavy, but it wasn't light either. Shen Tang's small arm immediately turned red.","She hadn't even done anything, but the Shen family was worried sick.","Auntie Shen pushed Uncle Shen aside and blew on Shen Tang's arm, \"Does it hurt?\"","Then, she glared fiercely at Shen Boyuan, \"You can't even hit a person properly. Besides your mediocre calligraphy, what else can you do?\"","Now it was Shen Boyuan who felt guilty.","\"I didn't expect...\" he started to say.","\"You still dare to speak?\"","After Shen Boyuan finished, Auntie Shen turned her gaze to Shen Yu, \"What are you standing there for? Go get the medicine!\"","\"Oh, right, right.\"","\"It's okay, it doesn't hurt at all.\"","As soon as Shen Tang spoke, Auntie Shen secretly pinched her hand, \"Good child, don't talk nonsense. It hurts badly.\"","Shen Tang blinked and received the signal from Auntie Shen, so she changed her statement, \"Well, it does hurt a little, but I can bear it...\"","On the other hand, Uncle Shen Boyuan felt heartbroken, completely forgetting about the previous matter. Now, he only blamed himself and felt guilty.","When Shen Yu returned with the medicine, he heard Shen Boyuan's words and also felt heartbroken, \"Sister Tang, you don't have to shield me. I'm used to being beaten by him!\"","The three words \"used to\" revealed so much heartache.","Uncle Shen Boyuan, who was standing beside them, became unhappy and quickly explained, \"Don't listen to his nonsense, Tang Tang. I've only hit this brat less than ten times since he was young. Don't believe him.\"","Shen Tang couldn't distinguish what was true and what was false, so she looked at Auntie Shen, whose expression was also surprised.","\"What? Don't you beat Shen Yu every day?\"","Shen Boyuan raised the belt in his hand, \"You little brat, you're making up stories about me everywhere!\"","He didn't even dare to think about what others thought of him.","Shen Tang felt a bit worried, but Auntie Shen held her and sat down on the sofa, saying, \"Don't worry, this brat has tough skin and can't be beaten to death.\"","Shen Tang fell silent, \"...\"","Indeed, he couldn't be beaten to death.","Shen Boyuan could be seen chasing after Shen Yu from behind, while Shen Yu was running ahead, leaping and bounding like a monkey, making one suspect that his true species was actually a monkey.","In the end, Shen Yu won because of his youthfulness.","Shen Boyuan, being older, couldn't run for long before he started panting heavily, exhausted.","\"You...you brat...\" Shen Boyuan said between breaths.","Shen Yu was also exhausted. \"Don't scold me, I'm afraid you might pass out all of a sudden.\"","Shen Tang thought to herself, feeling that it was not unjust for him to be beaten.","After this incident, Shen Boyuan had already forgotten about what happened earlier, but Aunt Zhou still remembered.","She whispered, \"Tang Tang, what happened between you and that Second Young Master Zhou? Aunt Zhou isn't prying into your privacy. It's just that his mother wants to meet you, and I'm worried.\"","\"Is his mother very formidable?\"","Aunt Zhou's eyes flashed with admiration. \"She is indeed formidable. It's just a pity that she didn't marry well and gave birth to a son who isn't that great. There is no successor.\"","Shen Tang nodded in agreement. Zhou Jin wasn't impressive indeed. His mother probably didn't expect to give birth to a piece of roast pork.","Shen Tang explained in detail what happened earlier and then apologized softly, \"I'm sorry, I was too impulsive at that time and didn't consider the family.\"","Aunt Zhou breathed a sigh of relief. \"Don't talk nonsense. You don't need to blame yourself. You did the right thing in this matter. You may not know, but that Second Young Master Zhou isn't a good person. He has flirted with countless women. Maybe it's because you're the first person who made him leave in anger that his mother became curious and wanted to meet you.\"","Shen Tang sighed, \"I hope so.\"","The meeting place was a bar, which surprised Shen Tang.","As soon as she arrived at the entrance, someone led her to a private room.","After entering the room, Shen Tang saw a sexy lady with fiery red lips. She thought she had come to the wrong place and quickly apologized, \"I'm sorry, I must have come to the wrong place.\"","The lady smiled and walked over, extending her hand. \"No, you're not mistaken. Miss Shen, I am Zhou Jin's mother.\"","Zhou Jin was the Second Young Master Zhou.","Shen Tang was taken aback for a moment before extending her hand. \"You look so young.\"","No woman can resist sincere compliments.","\"Really?\"","\"Really, you look like a big sister who is a few years older than me, and you don't look anything like Zhou Jin.\" Shen Tang sincerely said.","Zhou Jin was quite handsome, but compared to his mother, it was like night and day, a world of difference.","\"Hehe, I take good care of myself. Have a seat.\"","Madam Zhou opened a bottle of red wine, poured a glass for Shen Tang, and pushed it over. \"Have some?\"","Shen Tang didn't refuse and took a sip. It was sweet and delightful.","She couldn't help herself and drank it all in one gulp.","Then she looked at the wine bottle, feeling a bit incomplete.","Madam Zhou poured her another glass. \"Drink slowly, this wine packs a punch.\"","This time, Shen Tang just took a small sip.","\"I still don't know why you wanted to see me...\"","\"I heard that my son was left speechless by you when you confronted him, and I thought you were interesting. Now that I see you, you really are quite intriguing.\"","Shen Tang awkwardly smiled.","\"I did get carried away back then...\"","\"But, I do have a favor to ask this time.\"","\"What is it?\"","Madam Zhou set down her wine glass and said, \"I want you to help me discipline my son.\"","Shen Tang was taken aback; she felt like she must have misheard.","\"You didn't mishear me. I want you to take charge of him. You know very well about his terrible reputation. I don't expect him to become a great person, but I hope he stops embarrassing me everywhere.\"","Shen Tang opened her mouth wide, pointing at herself in disbelief. \"Me, discipline him?\"","\"Yes, you are the first person in these many years whom he somewhat fears.\"","Shen Tang thought to herself, that's because you two rarely meet.","In the end, it all boiled down to her sharp tongue, right? There are plenty of people in the world who can scold others like her.","Perhaps guessing what Shen Tang was thinking, Madam Zhou smiled and said, \"I'm sorry for checking your background without your consent. After considering everything, I believe you're the most suitable.\"","Shen Tang felt a bit displeased deep down. What's the point of asking for permission after the investigation is already done anyway?","Just as she was about to refuse, Madam Zhou said, \"Twenty million.\"","\"After the matter is done, I'll give you twenty million.\"","Shen Tang's firm refusal instantly wavered.","\"What if I fail?\"","\"Then it will be only five million.\"","Suddenly, Shen Tang felt a dryness in her mouth.","Is this what wealthy people are like? They call five million \"only\"?","After downing the rest of her red wine, she heard herself say, \"I agree.\"","Hilarious, only a fool would refuse.","Even though she has money now, who would reject more money?","\"But, my methods might be a bit... you mustn't get angry.\"","\"You can scold and beat him as you like. If he dares to bully you, come find me.\"","With that reassuring statement, Shen Tang was completely at ease.","Hehehe, Second Young Master Zhou, here I come!"]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: There are perverts here","paragraphs":["Zhou Jin was the only son in his family. He had been spoiled since childhood and was rarely disciplined. The only exception was his previous encounter with Tang Shenshen.","\"Tang Shenshen...\" Zhou Jin gritted his teeth as he muttered the name. He was determined to win back what he had lost in that place sooner or later.","The phone suddenly rang. Zhou Jin hurriedly sat up and took a deep breath before answering, \"Mom.\"","\"I found you a home tutor. She'll be here soon.\"","\"You found me a what?\" Zhou Jin cleaned out his ears, thinking he must have misheard.","\"A home tutor. You have to respect her and not bully her, or I'll cut off your allowance.\"","That threat was too frightening. Zhou Jin quickly promised, \"Don't worry, I won't bully the tutor.\"","He just didn't understand why he needed a home tutor at his age. What, was he going back to school?","But just because he couldn't take the initiative to bully her didn't mean he couldn't drive her away.","Zhou Jin already had several ideas about how to make this so-called tutor beg to leave.","Shen Tang had agreed with Elder Sister Liang to come at her own convenience for a month. It sounded difficult, but Shen Tang wasn't afraid.","There was a saying, \"Spare the rod, spoil the child.\" She would simply beat Second Young Master Zhou until he behaved.","She wasn't kidding. For adults like him who were already set in their ways, the best method was to make them understand what it meant to be afraid.","Shen Yu looked at the ruler in Shen Tang's hand and was silent for a moment. \"Sis Tang, are you serious?\"","\"I've never been more serious.\"","\"Aren't you afraid of his mother?\"","Shen Tang's expression instantly changed—not because she was scared, but because she admired Elder Sister Liang.","\"Elder Sister Liang is very nice. Don't speak badly of her.\"","At first, Shen Tang had called her Mrs. Zhou, but Elder Sister Liang said she didn't like being addressed that way. It made her seem like someone's accessory. So Shen Tang changed to calling her Elder Sister Liang.","By age, Elder Sister Liang could be her mother. But since she looked so young, Shen Tang just couldn't call her that.","As for the generation gap between her and Second Young Master Zhou, she didn't care at all.","Elder Sister Liang had been very generous. Not only did Shen Tang get a year-long VIP membership to that bar, but she also received a limited edition handbag that couldn't even be bought domestically.","Shen Tang didn't actually want to be bribed, but Elder Sister Liang had given her too much!","She couldn't betray money, so she could only betray her principles.","Anyway, Shen Yu had seen Shen Tang all the way to the Zhous' door.","Seeing her get out of the car, he quickly called, \"Sis Tang, yell if anything happens. I'll be waiting right here!\"","Shen Tang waved her hand. \"Don't worry!\"","She wouldn't need to ask for help. It was Second Young Master Zhou who might end up begging for mercy.","Shen Tang entered the password and went inside. The room was empty with no one inside. The place was a total mess, looking as if there had been a party the night before.","Shen Tang's face was filled with disgust as she walked further inside, until she discovered a bra on the sofa. She suddenly had an urge to turn around and leave.","But when she thought of the huge payment, Shen Tang steadied her resolve.","The first floor was visible at a glance. Obviously no one was here.","Shen Tang went upstairs.","Elder Sister Liang had already told her which room was Second Young Master Zhou's. Shen Tang headed right for it.","Before she could knock, she heard some indescribable sounds.","Shen Tang paid them no mind and lightly knocked on the door.","The sounds inside grew even louder.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Silence was golden.","No, silence was her today. This situation made her even more speechless than Dunkirk.","What, was she part of their play too?","Shen Tang knocked harder, clearly conveying that she would keep knocking if they didn't open the door.","She wanted to see if they could keep going.","Sure enough, it quieted down after a while.","The door was ripped open and Second Young Master Zhou stood there with only a white towel wrapped around him, annoyance all over his face. \"I said, who the h*ll...Tang Shenshen? Why are you here?\"","Hearing the name, Shen Tang was startled. It seemed Elder Sister Liang hadn't told him her real identity.","That made things easier.","Shen Tang cleared her throat lightly. \"I'm your new home tutor.\"","\"I already graduated from college. I don't need a tutor.\"","\"I see. Then please recite 'Zhao Wei's Later Inquiry of the Qi Envoy' and 'Zheng Bo's Segment for Yanchang'.\"","Second Young Master Zhou was completely confused. \"Zhao what smells his sh*t? Why does he want to smell sh*t?\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","This was hopeless. She was tired.","\"Then tell me about the significance of Marxism.\"","Second Young Master Zhou: \"......\"","\"How could I remember that stuff when I already graduated?\"","\"I guess you never remembered it to begin with.\"","Second Young Master Zhou: \"......\"","There's a saying, \"Do not strike one's face or expose one's shortcomings when attacking others.\" Haven't you heard of it?","\"Yes, I didn't study properly, but what business is that of yours? Even without schooling, my family has more money than we can spend. Those college graduates still end up working for my family's company.\"","Shen Tang felt like she had been stabbed in the chest.","She took out the ruler and a first grade textbook. \"It's not my business, but Elder Sister Liang asked me to tutor you in moral character and teach you how to be a decent human being.\"","\"Elder Sister Liang?\" Second Young Master Zhou was so shocked that his jaw nearly dropped.","\"You call my mom Elder Sister Liang?\"","\"Is there a problem?\"","Shen Tang tapped the ruler in her palm. \"Now, get properly dressed. It's time for class.\"","Second Young Master Zhou felt this whole situation was ridiculous. Things were not going as he had imagined. How was Tang Shenshen involved with his mother too?","He rolled his eyes and directly started undoing his towel. \"Teacher won't mind if I change here, right?\"","\"I don't mind.\" Shen Tang took out her phone to record video. \"You shouldn't mind everyone enjoying it together, right?\"","Second Young Master Zhou: \"......\"","He hurriedly clutched the lower half of his body.","Pervert! There's a pervert here!","\"Aren't you a woman?!\"","\"Obviously I am. But I'm not so sure if you're human.\""]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Who Is Tang Shuan","paragraphs":["With a \"bang\", the door was slammed shut.","After waiting for a while, it was opened again from the inside. Second Young Master Zhou came out with a frown on his face, \"Where are you going for class?\"","Shen Tang took a peek into the room, \"Isn't your girlfriend coming out?\"","\"I don't have a girlfriend.\"","Shen Tang was somewhat surprised: \"Huh?\"","\"What are you looking at, there's no one in the room.\"","He had deliberately played a dirty movie earlier. Although he liked beautiful women, he was not so perverted as to let others watch that kind of thing.","Shen Tang nodded in understanding, \"I see, then let's find an empty room.\"","Zhou Jin had the look of a good gentleman, covering his collar, \"What are you trying to do?\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Don't worry, I'm not so desperate yet. I already said it's for a class, with the place downstairs so messy, where else can we go?\"","Zhou Jin's old face turned red. He had deliberately left the place messy, and now it was a bit embarrassing.","However, \"I'm handsome and rich, how can you use the word 'desperate' to describe me?\"","Shen Tang raised her eyebrows in surprise: \"Are all men as confident as you?\"","Zhou Jin: \"...\"","He finally understood why his mother had asked her to tutor him. When it comes to verbal battles, he was no match for Tang Shenshen. He suddenly had some idea why his mother wanted her to tutor him.","They went to the study room. Shen Tang sat in the main seat, while Zhou Jin sat at the table next to her.","\"Let's officially start class now.\"","Zhou Jin was playing on his phone. Shen Tang's ruler came down with a \"slap\".","He quickly retracted his stinging hand, \"Wait, you're really hitting me?\"","\"No playing with your phone during class time.\"","What followed next was Shen Tang teaching a proper ideology and morals lesson, leaving Zhou Jin to nearly fall asleep from boredom.","\"Classmate, please repeat what I just talked about.\"","Zhou Jin: \"...\"","How would he know what she had just talked about?","He was extremely impatient, \"Enough. Tang Shenshen, I've had my fill of this teacher-student charade. You can leave now.\"","Shen Tang shook her ruler, \"Oh? It seems this student has not been listening carefully. That deserves punishment.\"","\"Tang Shenshen, you - Ouch! Stop hitting, stop!\"","Shen Tang turned a deaf ear, \"Disrespect towards teachers deserves punishment.\"","\"Sleeping in class, deserves punishment!\"","Zhou Jin was furious, \"Are you even a woman? How is your strength so great!\"","He didn't even have the strength to fight back. Shen Tang had chased him all over.","\"You can't even match up to a woman, and still dare say that?\" Shen Tang said, landing another heavy blow on Zhou Jin's back.","She admitted that she was doing it on purpose. She was getting back at him for bullying Sister Lan earlier.","In the end, it was the feeble Zhou Jin who couldn't run anymore.","\"Tang Shenshen! Don't think you're truly my teacher. I'll tell my mother you hit me!\"","Shen Tang stopped and Zhou Jin smiled smugly, \"Scared, aren't you!\"","Shen Tang took out her phone and flipped to a photo, \"Look.\"","\"What is it?\"","Zhou Jin moved closer to the screen and read out the words one by one, \"Feel free to hit, even to death, I'll take responsibility, Liang Yi.\"","Zhou Jin's eyes bulged wide, \"My mother actually wrote this!\"","Shen Tang mimicked Zhou Jin's smug look from earlier, shaking her head, \"So you now have two options.\"","\"What two options?\" Zhou Jin nervously swallowed.","Shen Tang raised a finger, \"First, listen properly in class and cooperate with me fully. In a month, I'll leave and you'll be free.\"","Just hearing there was still a month left made Zhou Jin's head hurt.","He quickly asked, \"What's the second option?\"","\"That is, if you do not listen, I'll continue hitting you until you do.\"","Zhou Jin: \"......\"","So in essence there was only one choice.","He would have to be an idiot to choose the second.","However, he still wanted to fight for some bargaining power, \"But Tang Shenshen, did you consider that the note from my mother was just a spur of the moment thing? I'm her only son. She dotes on me usually. How could she just stand by to watch you hit me?\"","\"Don't worry, I can control my strength. I won't leave any scars or beat you to death. I'll only make you hurt without any visible wounds.\"","Her words were truly frightening. Coupled with the faint smile on Shen Tang's face, even more so.","\"Were you from the East Factory in your past life?\"","Just what evil karma had he created to meet someone like her!","\"Come, which do you choose?\"","\"O-one, I choose one!\"","Zhou Jin obediently sat back down, \"You're sure you'll leave after a month?\"","\"Sure, if you cooperate with me properly, I might even leave in less than a month.\"","Of course those words were false. No matter what, she would stay for the full month.","Hearing Shen Tang say that, Zhou Jin felt a glimmer of hope. If he behaved better, this harbinger of doom might leave earlier!","\"Alright, let's get back to class! Quick battle, quick decision!\"","Yet before long, Zhou Jin was struggling again. What kind of nonsense was all this, and how could there be pop quizzes too?","He had been a poor student in school. And now older, plus staying up late nightly bar hopping, his brain was worse than when he was young. It was like listening to heavenly scriptures.","He barely endured until the lesson ended, collapsing limply over the table looking utterly miserable.","\"Teacher Tang, you'll be going now, right?\"","\"Yes, in a bit. Just let me assign some homework first.\"","Zhou Jin: \"......\"","It was just homework. He would endure. After all, he had so many good buddies who could do it for him.","As if guessing his thoughts, Shen Tang gave an wicked smile, \"Don't worry, no writing assignments. I'll ask you questions from it tomorrow.\"","Zhou Jin wailed incessantly, \"Tang Shenshen, how can such cold words come from your thirty-seven degrees mouth?\"","\"Because I'm a cold and heartless person. Class dismissed!\"","Meanwhile, Shen Yu had been waiting outside the Zhou house all along. Initially very worried, as time passed and Shen Tang still didn't emerge, he gradually relaxed.","After all, with Sister Tang's great strength, that degraded Second Young Master Zhou whose mind had been addled by wine and women could surely not overpower her.","Thinking thus, Shen Yu took out his phone and started playing games while waiting. After interacting with Shen Tang for so long, Shen Yu's cursing skills had increased.","Just then, someone said nasty things in the game, and he directly turned on the mic to retaliate, cursing until the other side closed their microphone and exited the game.","This was the scene Shen Tang witnessed when she came out.","She nodded approvingly, \"Not bad. You've quite inherited my style.\"","Although unclear about the context, she believed Shen Yu was not the kind to provoke others. The other side must have provoked first.","\"Of course, look who I learned from.\"","As it turns out, 4 can still beat 5.","After Shen Yu won a round, his gaming addiction acted up a little. He looked hopefully to Shen Tang, \"Sister Tang, want to play a round?\"","Shen Tang checked the time. Still early, and nothing else to do for now, so she agreed.","On the other side, after Tang Shenshen left, Zhou Jin had kept peeking to watch her. He saw her get into a car but not come back out.","The car just remained there parked.","Zhou Jin kept waiting and waiting, but there was no movement.","\"What is she doing in the car? Could she be——\"","Zhou Jin's expression suddenly changed, seeming disgusted and exasperated.","He thought for a bit, then went out carrying his phone to knock on the car door.","The window wasn't lowered, further affirming his guess.","He said loudly, \"Tang Shenshen, open the door. Don't pretend you're not there, I know you're inside.\"","The car window slowly rolled down, and Shen Yu looked utterly confused, \"Who are you looking for?\"","Zhou Jin stuck his head in to peek around, \"Where's Tang Shenshen? Ask her to come out.\"","\"Who's Tang Shenshen?\""]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Gu Huaian Is Injured","paragraphs":["Shen Tang didn't expect that one sentence from Shen Yu would directly expose her true identity.","Zhou Jin was so angry that he stomped his feet and shouted, \"Well done Tang, you actually tried to deceive me with a fake name!\"","Shen Tang rolled down the car window and replied shamelessly, \"At that time, I didn't know who you were, so why should I tell you my real name? What if you wanted to do something bad to me?\"","\"What could I do?\"","\"That's for you to say.\"","Zhou Jin: \"...\"","\"What's your real name?\"","\"I won't tell you.\"","Zhou Jin sneered, \"Do you think I can't find out if you don't tell me?\"","\"Then go ahead and check. Shen Yu, drive the car.\"","\"Roger that!\"","Whoosh, the car sped away in an instant.","Zhou Jin was startled, he didn't expect this kid to actually dare to drive the car.","\"Hmph, I can still find out even if you don't say.\"","That Shen Yu kid, he knew him. It would be easy to investigate the women around him.","Before nightfall, Zhou Jin had already discovered Shen Tang's name.","When he noticed that she was quite close with Gu Huaian, Zhou Jin rubbed his chin in distress.","\"Are they together?\"","\"Probably.\"","\"That makes things difficult...\"","Although the Zhou family was also wealthy and influential, they still couldn't compare to the Gu family, especially that stingy old Gu Huaian. He didn't dare to offend him recklessly.","The other person added: \"But I heard that the two of them recently broke up.\"","Zhou Jin's eyes lit up, \"Really?\"","\"Even more real than pure gold.\"","\"That's great then!\"","Aside from being happy that he could get back at Shen Tang, Zhou Jin also felt a vague emotion that he couldn't explain clearly and didn't think too deeply about.","\"Shen Tang, Shen Tang, if you dare to come again tomorrow, I'll make you pay!\"","Today he was at a disadvantage because he wasn't prepared. He decided to bring along some bodyguards. Let's see how Shen Tang can still beat him!","On the other side, on the drive home, Shen Yu felt a little guilty, \"Sister Shen Tang, sorry, I blurted it out just now.\"","\"It's fine, he would've found out sooner or later anyway.\"","Shen Tang didn't really mind. She just didn't expect her identity to be exposed so quickly. She wanted to trick that young master Zhou for a while longer!","\"Did he bully you?\"","\"Him bully me? It's impressive that I didn't bully him.\"","Shen Yu nodded silently. That's right, his question just now was rather unnecessary.","\"Now that he knows you tricked him, will something happen tomorrow?\" Shen Yu still felt that taking the job as a home tutor for young master Zhou was extremely unreliable.","He vaguely felt that something was off, but couldn't figure out what.","This young master Zhou had already graduated, so why did he still need a home tutor?","Could it be that Madam Zhou was after his sister!","As he thought of this possibility, Shen Yu slammed the brakes and Shen Tang's phone dropped to the floor.","\"What's wrong?\"","\"Sister Shen Tang, I just thought of a possibility!\"","Shen Yu shared his worries. Shen Tang laughed and said, \"You're overthinking it. Sister Liang probably doesn't have that intention.\"","If she really had any schemes, she wouldn't have told her so many embarrassing stories about Zhou Jin's past.","Like that time he tried to play the hero and save the beauty but ended up getting beaten up instead, or when he pulled a little girl's hair and got his own head shaved in return...there were countless such examples, most of which were due to him acting recklessly and then getting taught a lesson.","Hearing these stories made Shen Tang secretly gleeful. She felt that this young master Zhou totally deserved it.","No wonder he still had this kind of attitude after growing up, turns out he was never a good person to begin with.","Shen Tang scoffed disdainfully. If it wasn't for the generous payment from Sister Liang, she really didn't want to interact with him.","How could such a nice person like Sister Liang give birth to something like this?","Don't think she didn't notice the look in his eyes just now. It obviously showed that he suspected she was doing something indecent in the car.","Hmph, it takes one to know one.","When she returned home, Auntie and Uncle were waiting in the living room. Their first reaction was to care about her well-being, which touched Shen Tang deeply.","Although she still felt a bit guilty, Shen Tang had learned to reassure herself—","Since she's already here, then just accept it. This transmigration wasn't something she asked for, strictly speaking she was also a victim.","Moreover, if she let them know she was an imposter, wouldn't that break their hearts?","That's right, that's how it is.","It definitely wasn't because she couldn't bear to leave...","After dinner, Shen Tang went back to her room and scrolled through her friends' updates for a while.","Strangely, Gu Huaian didn't post anything today. Could he be very busy?","Long distance relationships easily make people anxious. Moreover, the current state of Shen Tang and Gu Huaian's relationship was still not great.","She opened Gu Huaian's WeChat chat window and spent a long time typing and deleting messages. In the end, she only asked: [Are you okay today?]","After waiting for a while, the other party still didn't reply.","Shen Tang told herself: \"He must be busy.\"","She was quite worried, after all the journey was long and that friend of his didn't seem reliable either.","Just then, her phone suddenly received a call from an unknown number.","Shen Tang had a hunch it was related to Gu Huaian. She quickly picked up, \"Hello?\"","\"Hello, is this Miss Shen?\"","\"Speaking, may I ask what this is regarding?\"","\"It's like this. Mr. Gu is injured and currently unconscious. We found your number in his contacts list. Would it be convenient for you to come over? I'll send you the address.\"","\"He's injured? Where is he now?\"","Shen Tang's mind went blank. At this moment, she had no time to think about anything else and simply noted down the address before hurriedly packing and preparing to head out.","Right before she was about to open the door with her suitcase, she suddenly felt something was off.","Since they already knew her number from Gu Huaian's phone, why use an unknown number to call her instead of his phone? Weren't they worried she wouldn't pick up or wouldn't believe it?","Shen Tang took a deep breath and forced herself to calm down.","She told herself that even if Gu Huaian was really injured, a few minutes wouldn't make a difference.","First, she contacted Cen Assistant, Cen Songbai, Fu Junsheng and others to ask if they had contacted Gu Huaian today.","Finding out they hadn't, she then had someone investigate the number. It did indeed belong to Tibet.","At this point, whether Shen Tang wanted to believe it or not, she had no choice but to believe that Gu Huaian was indeed injured!"]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: Dreams Are All Backwards","paragraphs":["Shen Tang didn't act recklessly. The injury to Gu Huaian was quite serious, so she contacted her sister, Gu Qingan.","Gu Qingan also had doubts about the situation but couldn't reach Gu Huaian directly. So, she decided to go with Shen Tang to see what was going on.","Given the urgency of the situation, they couldn't book plane tickets and had to take a private jet to fly over.","As they sat on the plane, Shen Tang still couldn't fully grasp the situation and stared blankly at the night sky outside the window.","Gu Qingan sighed and held Shen Tang's hand, saying, \"Don't worry, Huaian will be fine.\"","\"I hope so.\"","Shen Tang pursed her lips. She wished it was all a lie, that someone was intentionally deceiving them to go there.","But what was the purpose? What was the motive?","Her mind was in a whirl, and she couldn't think straight at the moment.","\"I'm inclined to believe that this whole thing is a scam. Huaian might be held up by something, or as you said, if the other party could unlock Huaian's phone and find your phone number, why couldn't they just call directly? And if I remember correctly, Huaian's phone password should be difficult to crack,\" Gu Qingan said.","Shen Tang perked up a bit. \"His phone seems to have been modified. Except for him and me, no one else should be able to unlock it. But nothing is absolute.\"","\"Exactly. I think that person wants to deceive you into going there, but as for what they plan to do, I can't think of it at the moment.\"","Though Gu Qingan said that, she also worried about her brother's safety.","After all, it was just the two of them in their family. They had no other siblings.","She had already lost her husband and couldn't bear losing her brother as well.","Both of them felt heavy-hearted.","Shen Tang closed her eyes and tried hard to recall the original plot of the book, but she couldn't come up with anything.","Moreover, the storyline had deviated so much that even the original author wouldn't recognize it. Even if she remembered, it would be pointless now.","Shen Tang felt anxious, restless. The few hours of flight time made her feel like several days had passed.","It was her first time coming here in her two lifetimes, and she didn't understand anything. On the other hand, Gu Qingan had prepared some medicines and such, just in case.","When they disembarked from the plane, Shen Tang noticed that there were ten well-built individuals accompanying them. She was taken aback and asked, \"Who are they?\"","\"These are our protectors,\" Gu Qingan blinked.","Shen Tang wasn't going to take any chances. She wouldn't let the two of them fall into danger.","With a wave of her hand, the several individuals dispersed among the crowd, making it impossible to tell at a glance.","\"That person said they would send someone to pick you up. Why don't you call and ask where they are now?\" Gu Qingan suggested.","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang called, but there was no answer.","She tried a few more times, but it was the same result.","Shen Tang grew frustrated. Ever since she heard the news of Gu Huaian's injury, she had become irritable, unable to control her emotions.","Gu Qingan hung up the phone. \"Don't worry, if his target is you, they will contact us sooner or later.\"","\"You're right.\" Shen Tang took a deep breath, trying hard to calm herself down.","She couldn't panic. If the other party truly was a scammer, then panicking would only play into their trap.","Furthermore, she brought her older sister along. If anything happened to her sister because of her, she wouldn't be able to forgive herself.","Instead of waiting in one place, they found a nearby hotel to rest for a while.","Sitting on a plane for several hours can be very tiring.","Shen Tang lay down and at some point, she fell asleep.","In her dream, she saw Gu Huaian lying unconscious on a hospital bed, with a pale and bloodless face, looking extremely terrifying.","She wanted to push the door and go in to see him, but several hands pulled her back, and she kept walking further away.","She screamed frantically, but the people around seemed as if they couldn't see her, allowing her to be dragged into an abyss.","\"No!\" Shen Tang woke up abruptly.","She sat up suddenly, drenched in cold sweat, her back soaked.","Gu Qingan put down his notebook and walked over to touch Shen Tang's forehead. \"Did you have a nightmare? You have a fever. We need to go to the hospital.\"","\"I'm fine. I'll just take some fever-reducing medicine. I dreamt that Gu Huaian got injured and was lying motionless on a hospital bed.\"","What Shen Tang didn't say was that he looked as if he were dead.","She couldn't bear to recall the details of that dream; it was just too frightening.","She couldn't imagine a life without Gu Huaian. What purpose would she have staying here?","Shen Tang forced herself not to dwell on these thoughts and tried to focus her attention elsewhere, but she couldn't do it.","\"Dreams are the opposite of reality, don't be afraid. Huaian will definitely be fine.\" Gu Qingan sighed, hoping for his safety.","Just then, the phone rang.","Shen Tang hastily answered, \"Hello?\"","\"Miss Shen, I'm sorry for the delay. Have you arrived?\"","\"Yes, I'm currently at a hotel near the airport. You mentioned someone would come to pick me up. When will they arrive?\"","\"Did you come alone?\"","Shen Tang hesitated for a moment, unsure how to answer. She looked at Gu Qingan, who nodded, so she said, \"I came with a friend. I'm not familiar with this place. Is there a problem?\"","\"No problem. Excuse me for asking, but is your friend a male or female?\"","\"Female. Why are you asking all these random questions? When will you come to pick us up? How is Gu Huaian doing now?\"","\"Please don't worry. I had a reason for asking those questions. I'll explain when we meet. Mr. Gu's condition is still critical. Our people have already gone to pick you up. You can wait downstairs, and they will arrive shortly.\"","\"Okay.\"","After hanging up the phone, Shen Tang strangely felt calmer.","\"As expected, something's not right.\"","She even suspected that the person on the other end had already arrived. They deliberately asked her those questions to see if she was lying.","Gu Qingan also felt the same way.","Since the other party wanted to deceive Shen Tang into coming, they must have made some preparations.","\"What do we do now? Sister, maybe you should stay here?\" Shen Tang had strength on her own, and she still had some confidence. But with another person to take care of, she didn't have the assurance to bring them out unscathed.","Gu Qingan smiled and flexed his biceps. \"Do you know why I dared to come with you? I forgot to mention that I've been studying martial arts since I was a child and have won the national championship.\"","Shen Tang was shocked. \"A champion!\"","Now it seemed that she was the one slowing them down.","\"Is Gu Huaian just as impressive?\"","Gu Qingan proudly replied, \"He's not as impressive as me. He prefers to outsmart people with his brain.\"","Shen Tang nodded in agreement. Yes, this guy's brain seemed to be wired differently.","Oh, no, it should be said that the brains of the Gu family are all very clever. It must be a genetic thing.","Thinking like this, Shen Tang suddenly felt the desire to have children with Gu Huaian.","With their excellent genes, their child would undoubtedly be very intelligent!"]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: I double Up","paragraphs":["Shen Tang had a premonition that the van that was approaching was the person coming to pick them up.","Sure enough, the van stopped next to them.","At this time, there were not many people around. Besides Shen Tang and Gu Qingan, there were about ten people scattered around pretending to be passersby but who were actually bodyguards.","The van stopped, and just as Shen Tang was about to speak, a sack was put over her head.","Wait, you guys are so direct? Grabbing people in broad daylight? Don't you have any manners?","Shen Tang did not resist and let them take her onto the van.","Gu Qingan was also very cooperative. She trembled and asked in a crying voice, \"What are you going to do? Please let us go, we have money...\"","Then, Shen Tang heard a \"slap,\" as if Gu Qingan had been hit.","Shen Tang was so angry she wanted to hit back. But her sister secretly pulled her, which was the signal telling her to keep calm.","Shen Tang adjusted to a more comfortable position. \"Um...excuse me, where are you taking us?\"","It was quiet, nothing could be heard except the sound of the van.","Shen Tang continued asking, \"Things are like this already. Why don't we chat? After all I can't escape.\"","\"You talk too much,\" a man said hoarsely with contempt.","\"Hey, I'm idle anyway. Brother, how many years have you been doing this? Is the pay high for this job? Do you get benefits and social security? How much is your year-end bonus?\"","The man fell silent again.","Shen Tang asked again, \"Brother? Are you there?\"","\"Shut up!\"","Judging by his voice, Brother was clearly angered with embarrassment.","Shen Tang quickly explained, \"Brother, don't get me wrong. I didn't mean anything else. I just wanted to say, the security guards at my home get a base salary of 20,000 yuan per month. They get benefits and social security too. And they often get imported fruits, hairy crabs, all kinds of pastries to eat. After all I can't finish them by myself.\" After saying that, Shen Tang smacked her lips, seemingly reminiscing about the taste of those foods.","Although Shen Tang couldn't see, she clearly felt the atmosphere in the car become abnormal.","After a moment of silence, Brother asked, \"Really that much?\"","Another slightly shrill male voice persuaded, \"Brother Biao, don't believe what she said. She must be tricking us.\"","Shen Tang sighed. \"Do you know who I am?\"","\"I know. Aren't you some female celebrity or something?\"","\"Yes. Then you should know female celebrities are very rich, right?\"","\"I know. Isn't it 2.08 million a day?\"","Shen Tang was silent. She didn't make nearly that much. As a C-list celebrity, making 2.8 million would be good. But even 2.8 million was more than what many people make.","\"Yes. So how much are they paying you to kidnap me? I'll pay double. No, if you mend your ways, I'll also provide you jobs and school admissions. Oh right, I almost forgot to ask, do you have kids?\"","\"...Yes.\"","\"Brother Biao!\" The other person sounded a little unpleasant. \"Brother Biao, you actually believed her words? She'll send us to prison first thing!\"","Shen Tang sighed again. \"Then what good would that do for me? That would just make two more enemies. To be honest, no one's hands are clean in this circle. Everyone needs people to do some dirty work. I've never hired people to do that kind of work. Of course I don't do things like murder or arson either. I'm a law-abiding good citizen.\"","\"The school admissions you mentioned...\"","\"I don't have kids yet and don't plan on having them any time soon. Even if I did, they'd be going to aristocratic schools. And I have several empty houses just sitting there. Might as well give them to people who need them.\"","These words sounded rather hateful, yet logical and tempting at the same time. It was hard not to be moved.","Even the other person who had been advising caution seemed to hesitate and fell silent.","\"I'm telling the truth. Whether you believe me or not is up to you. Sometimes opportunities pass in the blink of an eye. Once you leave this village, the shop will be gone.\"","\"I can't let you go.\" Brother Biao said in a low voice.","Shen Tang's heart sank. Although she didn't actually expect anything, hearing his refusal still inevitably disappointed her.","\"But I can help you later.\"","\"Brother Biao!\"","\"Shou Zi, are you going to advise me some more?\"","\"No, I wanted to ask if you could bring me too! We do risky work every day for just a few thousand yuan a month. What can we even do with that?\"","Listening to Shou Zi's complaints, Shen Tang felt this matter had a high probability of success.","\"Alright, then I'll need you to help me with a few things.\"","...","Time passed. The van had arrived at its destination.","Shen Tang couldn't see the time but guessed that the drive was about an hour judging by the distance.","It was quiet around them without the roar of cars or hawker calls. With two men propping them up, Shen Tang and Gu Qingan got out of the van.","There was still a sack over Shen Tang's head but two small holes were made in it to allow her to see the surroundings clearly.","It was an abandoned factory. No wonder it was so quiet around them.","Because she had successfully swayed the two men earlier, they were gentler with Shen Tang and Gu Qingan now.","The old metal gate was pushed open from inside. A blond haired man sneered, \"Yo, Brother Biao, how come you're being so gentle today?\"","Brother Biao remained silent. Shou Zi retorted, \"None of your damn business!\"","He now stood up very straight. After all, they would no longer be of the same social class soon.","\"Oh? Shou Zi you've got guts now?\"","As Yellow Hair Man rolled up his sleeves about to punch Shou Zi, Brother Biao spoke in time, \"Enough. Let's finish the boss's business first.\"","\"Hmph, just you wait!\"","Yellow Hair Man left Shou Zi with fierce words before walking over to rudely yank the sack off Shen Tang's head, then squeezed her chin while looking left and right. His eyes showed a trace of obsession. \"Tsk, female celebrities sure are good-looking. Her skin's so fair it's whiter than milk.\"","Brother Biao walked over and pulled his hand away. \"Enough. Where's the boss?\"","\"Inside.\"","Yellow Hair Man still looked at his fingers yearningly. He licked his lips disgustingly. It almost made Shen Tang yue* right there.","She hadn't seen anyone so greasy in a long time.","He was a hundred times more unpleasant than Zhou Ershao*.","Compared to him, Zhou Ershao almost seemed handsome now.","The group entered the room. Everyone inside immediately put down their cards and looked over.","The man sitting in the middle looked somewhat familiar but Shen Tang couldn't remember who he was.","\"Excuse me, sir. May I ask why you called me over?\"","The man sitting in the middle coldly laughed and strode over. \"Miss Shen really does forget easily. You've already forgotten me?\"","Shen Tang racked her brains but just couldn't figure out who he was.","\"Excuse me sir, you are...\""]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: Good Acting","paragraphs":["“Haha, back then you took more than ten of our cargo and ran away, and even sent my brothers to prison. Now you’ve forgotten about it?” Shen Tang suddenly realized, “So you’re the one who slipped through the cracks!”","After speaking, Shen Tang stared at his face for a while, “Did you get plastic surgery? You look a little different from before. I didn’t even recognize you.”","The veins on the man's face twitched wildly, even Brother Biao was a little worried that if Shen Tang kept talking like this, she might get hit.","He walked over and said, \"Boss, let's focus on what's important.\"","The man took a deep breath, \"You're right, what's important comes first.\"","Shen Tang looked around, \"By the way, where's Gu Huaian? Is he here?\"","\"Haha, still thinking about your lover? He's dead.\"","Shen Tang scoffed, \"Make up something more believable. Does that sound plausible even to you?\"","\"I believe it. He really fell off a cliff and died!\"","The smile on Shen Tang's face was barely maintained, \"Impossible!\"","\"Oh, are you angry? Sad? Haha, this is how I felt when you sent my brothers to jail.\"","\"I don't believe you. When did this happen to him?\"","\"Just a few days ago, I happened to find out he came here alone. When I went after him, he misstepped and fell off the cliff.\"","Gu Qingan, who still had a hood over her head, had two hidden holes that allowed her to observe the situation.","She noticed that when the boss spoke, he looked directly at Shen Tang without making any facial expressions of recollection. She guessed this was probably false, or half true and half false.","Shen Tang had also learned a little about acting. She thought of this as well.","However, since the other party said this, it means he hopes she is heartbroken. Then she'll put on a show for him to see how good she is. She also wanted to see what this man was up to.","\"Impossible, impossible... you must be lying to me...\"","Shen Tang shook her head crying, her eyes red, with tears hanging on her face that made people feel heartache.","Even Shou Zi couldn't bear to look away, but the boss was unmoved.","He even calmly criticized, \"Not bad acting.\"","The corner of Shen Tang's mouth twitched. This man really is...","She pretended to want to wipe away her tears, but realized her hands were still tied up. She was just going through the motions. She almost tore it open.","She quickly put her hands down, sniffed and said, \"Thanks for the compliment. I should get the Oscar for Best Actress next year, right?\"","\"You're so smug just from me praising you once?\"","\"Brother, let's be honest. Why did you bring me here? If it's for revenge, go ahead and do it!\"","After Shen Tang spoke, she closed her eyes, lifted her head, and exposed her fair, delicate neck.","Gu Qingan next to her took a step forward, frightened.","This little sister was a bit fierce.","\"It is for revenge, but you still have another use. Take her away and lock her up.\"","Yellow Hair Man wanted to come over but was beat by Brother Biao and Shou Zi. He was a little unhappy. Shou Zi grinned and said, \"Let me handle this rough work.\"","He and Brother Biao were grasshoppers in the same boat as Shen Tang now. Their bright future was right before their eyes. He couldn't let this uncontrollable pervert Yellow Hair Man ruin their future boss.","Shen Tang and Gu Qingan were taken to a small room with only one window, sealed with iron bars, and a big iron door that was airtight.","Shen Tang found a slightly cleaner place to sit down. \"Did something really happen to Gu Huaian?\"","Brother Biao shook his head. \"We're not sure. Shou Zi and I joined later, we weren't core members so we weren't involved in these things and don't know the details. But from what I know of the boss, it's probably not entirely false.\"","Shen Tang's heart also sank. She guessed it was like this too. Gu Huaian may have really gotten into trouble, but they didn't know the specifics of the situation yet.","They didn't know anything, and couldn't find anyone if they went to look for him blindly. It was better to stay here and let this boss look for him, and then take all these people down once he was found.","Shen Tang looked at Gu Qingan, wanting to say something but ended up closing her mouth again.","Although Brother Biao and Shou Zi said they wanted to join her side, Shen Tang didn't completely trust them yet.","Those who betray once can betray again. Who knows if they might sell her and Gu Qingan out someday too.","Shen Tang looked at Brother Biao and was about to speak when she heard the sound of spitting next to her.","Shou Zi had just spit up phlegm and was about to spit it out when he was scared by Shen Tang's threatening gaze and quickly swallowed it back down.","Shen Tang happened to see it almost come out.","Gu Qingan next to her also couldn't stand it and looked away, forcing herself not to imagine that scene.","Brother Biao was also disgusted by Shou Zi and scolded, \"Can you be more civilized!\"","Shou Zi looked aggrieved. \"Miss Shen wouldn't let me spit on the floor...\"","\"Can't you spit outside? Is holding it in for a while going to kill you?\"","Shou Zi pouted and said in a low voice, \"I'll pay attention next time, alright?\"","He didn't think much of it, and even felt they were making a big deal out of nothing.","These young ladies from rich families were just pretentious. What was wrong with spitting? If they saw him peeing and pooping, wouldn't they be scared to death?","Shen Tang whispered a few words to Brother Biao. Shou Zi didn't hear clearly and wanted to move closer to listen. But the two had already separated.","He felt a little unhappy inside. What were they saying that he couldn't hear?","\"Miss Shen, is there anything you need me to do?\"","Shen Tang smiled. \"Not for now. I'll need to see what his next move is before I can make arrangements. Brother Shou, I'll be relying on you to protect us these next few days.\"","Hearing Shen Tang call him brother, Shou Zi's back straightened again. He patted his chest and said, \"Don't worry, leave it to me.\"","The two couldn't stay in the room for too long. After a simple chat they went back out.","Only after Shen Tang and Gu Qingan thoroughly checked for cameras did they huddle together to whisper.","\"Tangtang, you were too reckless with what you said earlier.\"","Shen Tang felt a little guilty. She touched her nose and instead asked, \"Sister, what do you think he plans to do with us?\"","\"Look at his goals. His target seems to be Huaian. He probably won't do anything to us.\"","Of course, this was just her guess.","After all, they were females. There were a few perverts like Yellow Hair Man. If someone came to grope them at night, it wouldn't be good.","Although Shou Zi promised to protect them, she guessed that when they really needed him, he might not be much help at all.","This kind of person always put themselves first.","\"But Gu Huaian shouldn't have any grudge against him, right?\"","Shen Tang carefully recalled the matter. Gu Huaian had only come to pick her up, and that warranted holding a grudge?","However, Gu Qingan understood Gu Huaian better. \"I feel that maybe Huaian did something against them behind your back.\"","She also knew about that incident. Shen Tang was more severely injured. Based on Huaian's personality, it was likely he got angry on behalf of his beauty and went to take revenge on those people.","Just sending them to jail certainly wouldn't be enough, especially for this one who slipped through the cracks. Perhaps he couldn't stay anywhere else so ran to hide in these remote mountains and forests.","Gu Qingan felt her guess was probably 70-80% true.","And the reason Tangtang didn't think of so much was perhaps because Huaian only showed her his good side when they were together.","Everyone had a dark side, including him.","Gu Qingan sighed. She only hoped Tangtang could also happily accept it when she saw Huaian's other side."]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Don't You Poop","paragraphs":["Shen Tang certainly hadn't seen Gu Huaian's shady side.","Shen's family also said Gu Huaian was shrewd, and his business tactics weren't exactly aboveboard.","But Shen Tang felt this was perfectly normal—if he wasn't shrewd, he would have been swallowed up long ago.","If she knew Gu Qingan's thoughts, Shen Tang would definitely tell her she was worrying too much.","But right now, thinking about all that was useless. The most important thing was to see if they could find Gu Huaian.","Of course, people on their end were also looking, just more covertly.","If the outside world found out, Gu Corporation's stock might plummet.","Shen Tang clasped her hands together and prayed in her heart: Gu Huaian, you have to be okay...","The sky gradually darkened, and Shen Tang closed her eyes to nap. Suddenly, she heard the sound of the doorknob turning and snapped her eyes open.","Moonlight streamed in through the high little window, illuminating the doorway.","Shen Tang sat in the dark, expression invisible.","Gu Qingan shifted next to Shen Tang and whispered, \"Shall we do it?\"","Shen Tang nodded, then realized she couldn't see it, so she whispered back, \"If he's rude, take care of him.\"","Although they wanted to stay and uncover the truth, it was on the condition of protecting themselves first.","The two of them were capable of self-defense, and the bodyguards they'd brought weren't pushovers either. Otherwise, Shen Tang wouldn't have been so bold as to plunge into the tiger's den.","Without backup, coming here would be suicidal.","The door opened, and Shen Tang and Gu Qingan instantly narrowed their eyes. Fortunately, their long lashes and the dim light kept their reactions hidden.","Sure enough, Yellow Hair Man came in.","She'd felt his greasy, disgusting gaze earlier already. Brother Biao also said this guy had committed many offenses due to lack of self-control. So Shen Tang was prepared.","Yellow Hair licked his lips and gently closed the door. Then he eagerly pounced at Shen Tang. Before he could touch her, he went flying back with a loud thud against the door.","The commotion woke everyone up. People started streaming into the room, and the lights flashed on brightly.","Shen Tang and Gu Qingan pretended to have just woken up, blinking blearily. \"What's going on?\"","\"Ah, so bright!\" Gu Qingan hastily closed her eyes and turned her face away from the glare.","Big Brother finally arrived, shirtless, and people automatically cleared a path for him.","Seeing Yellow Hair on the ground and the innocent-looking Shen Tang, his expression was ugly. \"What happened?\"","Yellow Hair mumbled incoherently, unable to explain.","Shen Tang blinked blankly. \"Why is everyone here? Is there business to attend to?\"","On the surface, it seemed Shen Tang truly didn't know anything.","But since she was an actress, Big Brother still had doubts about the situation.","Yellow Hair was also confused. He felt like he'd been kicked, but seeing Shen Tang's reaction made him question his senses.","But...","He touched his aching stomach. That was proof he hadn't imagined it earlier.","Having already made similar mistakes before due to lust, if he slipped up again this time, he'd surely be punished.","His eyes shifted back and forth as he quickly said, \"I came to check they hadn't escaped.\"","Surprisingly, Big Brother actually believed the far-fetched excuse.","Big Brother stroked his chin and said, \"Oh right, I almost forgot how strong you are.\"","Strong?","Yellow Hair touched his throbbing stomach. Damn it, so it was Shen Tang who'd kicked him.","He glared fiercely at Shen Tang several times but could only swallow this injustice.","Big Brother left briefly then returned,","holding several long ropes in his hands. \"Better tie them up tight just in case.\"","Brother Biao reached to take them, but Big Brother drew back his hands.","He took it upon himself to tie up Shen Tang completely, leaving only her face and feet exposed.","Shen Tang was speechless. \"Big Brother, isn't this overkill? Tied so tight, how will I use the bathroom?\"","\"Wear diapers.\"","Shen Tang hesitated then compromised, \"Well, if you guys don't mind the smell...\"","Gu Qingan nearly broke character beside her.","Big Brother paused as if considering the feasibility of this.","He got up and asked, \"Any chains around?\"","\"No...\"","This was just an abandoned factory. Where would they get chains? Those would've been stolen and sold off long ago.","Even these ropes were brought by them.","After a moment of silence, Big Brother slowly untied Shen Tang's lower half, leaving just her upper body tightly bound.","Shen Tang impatiently reasoned, \"Then can you loosen my sister's restraints? Like this I can't eat or use the bathroom either.\"","\"You're always spewing crap about piss and shit, are you even a woman?\"","\"What's wrong with that? The cycle of the five grains is very normal. Don't you even shit?\"","\"Of course I—\" Big Brother shut his mouth and stopped talking.","He realized that talking to Shen Tang easily let her lead him by the nose.","The best approach was to ignore her.","Not only did he ignore Shen Tang himself, he ordered his men to also ignore her unless she needed food, drink, or the bathroom. Otherwise, nobody was to enter this room.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Isn't that a bit excessive?\"","\"Not at all.\" Gu Qingan weakly echoed beside her.","She too noticed Shen Tang's mystical ability to nearly convert all these kidnappers. So it was prudent of Big Brother to take precautions, or else Shen Tang might sway them all.","Brother Biao and Shou Zi were examples already.","\"No way, those were exceptions.\" If she were that capable, she would've swayed Big Brother long ago.","Gu Qingan nodded at the door. \"Then how do you explain the guy who's been bringing you meals several times a day? Are you a bottomless pit?\"","\"Is it possible he was bringing food for you?\"","\"He didn't even glance at me.\"","Shen Tang sighed. \"Maybe he likes my youthful body.\"","\"Oh~ So you're saying I'm old?\"","Shen Tang: \"!!!!\"","\"No no, that's not what I meant! Sis, you're my real sister! Don't get the wrong idea!\"","Gu Qingan laughed aloud. Of course she knew Shen Tang didn't mean that, but teasing her was quite entertaining.","Just then, a commotion suddenly erupted outside, mixed with yelling.","Shen Tang wriggled up and went to listen by the door. As a result, the door burst open, slamming into her.","\"Holy shit!\""]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: What was His Purpose","paragraphs":["With a single phrase that epitomized Chinese culture, Shen Tang was propelled into the air. Luckily, Gu Qingan reacted quickly and shielded her, preventing her from crashing into the wall too hard. Nevertheless, the impact between the two of them was still substantial.","Shen Tang took a couple of deep breaths, trying to steady herself. The person who opened the door was Brother Biao, and he seemed bewildered. However, he quickly regained his composure and said, \"Sorry, someone's here. Let's take advantage of the chaos and run!\"","\"Who's coming?\" Shen Tang asked.","Brother Biao was momentarily stumped, but just then, Shou Zi ran over and exclaimed, \"Hey, why are you still here talking? The police are here! Let's go!\"","Upon hearing that the police had arrived, Shen Tang untied the rope and started running with the two men. However, after running for a short distance, she realized something was amiss. She was the victim, so why was she running?","As soon as Shen Tang stopped, Shou Zi grabbed her sleeve and said, \"Miss Shen, can't you run anymore? I'll carry you!\"","Shou Zi squatted down, as if he really intended to carry her.","His thinking was simple—to impress Shen Tang and perhaps leave a good impression on her. After all, he would be her future boss, so it was important to make a favorable impression.","Suddenly, Brother Biao halted and said, \"Look, I panicked. Shen Tang doesn't need to run. The police are probably here to rescue them.\"","Shou Zi smacked his forehead and exclaimed, \"Oh no, Brother Biao, what should we do then?\"","Shen Tang had no intention of unloading the burden. \"Don't worry, I will tell the police the truth and won't falsely accuse you.\"","Shou Zi was overjoyed, already envisioning a life of luxury. He would use the money to marry a beautiful wife and have chubby children.","Brother Biao, on the other hand, grasped the underlying meaning.","After a moment of silence, he asked, \"Does your previous job and the school district still matter?\"","\"They matter,\" Shen Tang replied earnestly.","\"Alright, I trust you.\"","The group turned around and headed back. By now, the ones who needed to be caught had already been apprehended. The once imposing Big Brother was now pinned to the ground, unable to move.","Shen Tang flashed a triumphant smile at him. How the tables had turned.","Big Brother seethed with anger, struggling fiercely, but the more he struggled, the tighter he was held down.","Among the group of police officers, there was a man dressed in civilian clothes. He had narrow, phoenix-like eyes that made him appear unapproachable. However, a perpetual smile softened that impression.","Upon seeing Shen Tang and Gu Qingan, he walked straight towards them. \"Sister, sister-in-law.\"","Shen Tang didn't recognize him, but Gu Qingan nodded calmly and said, \"Long time no see.\"","\"Have you seen Huaian?\" the man asked, glancing at Shen Tang. He seemed hesitant, as if there was something difficult to say.","Shen Tang's heart sank, sensing something ominous. \"Has something happened to him?\"","Seeing Gu Qingan also nod, the man reluctantly said, \"Huaian was seriously injured. He broke his leg and is currently in the hospital. He didn't want me to tell you.\"","Shen Tang frowned. If he was injured, why wouldn't he want her to know? Could it be...","She blurted out, \"Could it be that he broke his 'third leg'?\"","Gu Qingan also looked up abruptly, his words caught in his throat. The man hurriedly shook his head, \"No, no, his 'third leg' is fine.\"","Shen Tang looked at him suspiciously and asked, \"If it's all good, why didn't you tell us?\"","The man choked for a moment, then sighed and shook his head. \"Ah, you'll know when you get there,\" he said.","\"Oh, by the way, who are these two?\" Shen Tang asked.","Shen Tang truthfully recounted the events that had happened earlier, including their kidnapping of her and her attempt to persuade them to change their ways.","Shou Zi looked bewildered and said, \"No, Miss Shen, how can you say that?\"","\"Did I say something wrong?\" Shen Tang questioned.","\"Well, you did promise us earlier that you would let us become security guards,\" Shou Zi retorted.","Shou Zi looked at Brother Biao and said, \"Biao Ge, say something!\"","\"Don't worry, if you both sincerely change and repent, I will fulfill my promise,\" Brother Biao admitted outright.","Shou Zi was dumbfounded and was also escorted onto the vehicle with the others.","Later, Shen Tang learned that Brother Biao had a daughter with autism, and the treatment and special schooling required a lot of money.","He used to work in construction, but the company absconded with the funds, leaving him with no choice but to take the wrong path.","Fortunately, he hadn't committed much wrongdoing yet, and Shen Tang was his first victim.","On the other hand, Shou Zi was already a small-time thug, and he was the one who brought Brother Biao here.","Shen Tang sighed and donated some money for the treatment of Brother Biao's daughter.","Of course, that is a matter for later, not to be mentioned for now.","At present, Shen Tang and Gu Qingan couldn't wait to rush to the hospital where Gu Huaian was.","Besides Shen Tang, Gu Qingan, and the man, there was also a driver. The four of them traveled in one car.","Shen Tang and Gu Qingan sat in the backseat.","During the journey, Shen Tang learned from the man, whose name was Xie Yuan.","She guessed that Xie Yuan might be the one responsible for the misunderstanding between her and Gu Huaian last time.","Shen Tang didn't have a very good first impression of him; he couldn't compare to Cen Songbai and Fu Junsheng.","She sensed that Gu Qingan's attitude towards him was also average, not particularly affectionate.","From Xie Yuan's account, they learned that Gu Huaian had been discovered by hikers in the mountains and they called for help.","His phone was not working, and he still hadn't replaced it for some reason.","When Shen Tang heard this, she felt something was off. How could Gu Huaian, who was a workaholic and used his phone every day, not get it replaced?","She glanced at Xie Yuan from the corner of her eye; he seemed quite normal and didn't look like a bad person.","But bad people don't have \"bad person\" written on their faces.","Shen Tang asked, \"Did Gu Huaian say anything when he woke up?\"","Xie Yuan shook his head. \"He just told me not to tell you anything and then fell unconscious again. His leg injury is serious; he might need amputation.\"","Shen Tang's heart skipped a beat. \"Amputation? That serious?\"","\"Yes, but the surgery hasn't been performed yet. Huaian doesn't know about it yet, and I'm afraid it will greatly affect him,\" Xie Yuan explained.","Shen Tang nodded in understanding and casually asked, \"By the way, how did you know we were here? And why did you bring the police to rescue us?\"","Gu Qingan, sitting beside her, also raised his head slowly.","She also wanted to know the answer to this question.","She had thought earlier that it was Gu Huaian who sent him to rescue them, but now it seemed that wasn't the case.","They had only arrived here a couple of days ago, and few people knew about this matter.","So, how did Xie Yuan find out?","Xie Yuan chuckled softly, \"Sometimes, being too clever isn't a good thing.\"","Shen Tang smiled faintly, \"But being not clever isn't necessarily a good thing either.\"","Shen Tang thought that this person was about to reveal his true intentions, but unexpectedly, Xie Yuan sighed and continued, \"Yes, what Huai'an said is true. We couldn't deceive you after all.\"","\"Now that you've asked, I'll tell you the truth. In fact, it was Huai'an who sent me to pick you up, but he didn't want you to know about it. His injuries are quite serious, and there's a high probability that he won't be able to keep his leg. He doesn't want to see anyone.\"","Shen Tang furrowed her brows.","She was contemplating the truth of this matter.","She had a skeptical attitude towards every word spoken by this man named Xie Yuan.","Moreover, his words seemed inconsistent and contradictory, changing his stance from time to time.","Putting herself in his shoes, if she were facing the prospect of amputation, she might also not want to see anyone.","But Gu Huaian shouldn't be like that.","She was certain because Gu Huaian had promised her that he would tell her everything, no matter what happened.","Therefore, Shen Tang believed that Xie Yuan was lying.","So, what was his motive?","Wasn't he Gu Huaian's friend?"]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: I'm Going to Have a Cigarette.","paragraphs":["There was no idiot in the car except for the driver.","Of course, anyone who could drive for Xie Yuan must be his confidant, not stupid.","Looking at it this way, two on two, it was quite fair.","Shen Tang did not rashly expose Xie Yuan's lies, but started to chat casually.","During the chat, she would ask some questions about Gu Huaian or about Xie Yuan himself from time to time.","She did not care about his answers.","However, it could be seen from his attitude that perhaps he had not found Gu Huaian.","Either that or Gu Huaian was actually in his hands but seriously injured.","Neither of these two results were very good.","Shen Tang did not have a cell phone on her at the moment, she looked at Xie Yuan: \"Brother Xie, can I borrow your phone for a moment?\"","Xie Yuan did not immediately agree.","Shen Tang asked again: \"Is it inconvenient?\"","\"Not really.\"","Just as Xie Yuan was about to take out his phone, he saw the driver hand over his phone, \"Miss Shen, use mine.\"","\"Okay, thanks.\"","Shen Tang was sitting in the back seat, which made it convenient for her to operate the phone without Xie Yuan seeing clearly.","However, she noticed that Xie Yuan's eyes kept glancing over from the rearview mirror from time to time.","Shen Tang imperceptibly curled the corners of her mouth, this person was suspicious as expected.","She just didn't know if the police who had come before were real or fake. If they were fake, then Brother Biao and Shou Zi would not get into trouble, right...","Shen Tang even had an idea that Xie Yuan and that boss were in cahoots.","On second thought, that seemed unlikely. If so, it would be too scary.","At this moment, the driver asked, \"Miss Shen, are you done with the phone?\"","Shen Tang didn't intend to do anything in the first place. She returned the phone, \"Thank you, I'm done.\"","Next, the car was unusually quiet and no one spoke.","Xie Yuan seemed a little restless, tapping his fingers on his thighs.","Shen Tang guessed that he might want to know what she had just done with her phone.","Hilarious, she hadn't actually done anything, just deliberately mystifying things, and he had really taken the bait.","Shen Tang glanced at Gu Qingan and saw her surreptitiously nodding her head, so she continued sitting nonchalantly, enjoying the scenery outside the window.","This place was different from the city full of high-rise buildings, the sky was extraordinarily blue, the clouds extraordinarily white, and even the air was extraordinarily fresh.","Shen Tang rolled down the window and breathed the fresh air, feeling cleansed inside and out.","Not long after, the car suddenly stopped.","There was nothing ahead or behind here, only the vast prairie and forest around them.","\"What happened?\"","The driver awkwardly smiled, \"Sorry, I need to use the restroom.\"","Shen Tang slightly raised her eyebrows, here it comes.","Xie Yuan also lit a cigarette and nodded at Shen Tang and the other woman, \"I'll go have a smoke.\"","The two left one after the other into the forest. Shen Tang looked ahead and saw that the car keys had been removed, this was to prevent them from driving the car away.","Were they that kind of person?","Okay, she was.","Shen Tang did have that idea.","Drive the car away and leave Xie Yuan behind.","After all, they also had mobile phones. They couldn't possibly fail to call someone over right.","But then she wouldn't know what his purpose was.","In fact, both sides were just short of poking through the window paper at this point, but Shen Tang still wanted to see if Gu Huaian was really there.","Even if there was only a one in ten thousand chance, she didn't want to miss it.","\"Sis—\"","As soon as Shen Tang spoke, she saw Gu Qingan \"shush\" and shook her head at the rearview mirror.","Shen Tang squinted at it and vaguely saw a flashing red dot there.","Damn! She didn't know if this was a camera or a listening device.","Shen Tang lightly coughed and deliberately said, \"Sis, I wonder why Xie Yuan still hasn't come back? Could it be constipation!\"","Gu Qingan chuckled at this. \"Well, it's not impossible.\"","\"Oh, saying he's going for a smoke, I reckon he just wants to take a dump but is too shy to say so. This guy, he's just not sincere at all.\"","Shen Tang glanced at the rearview mirror, and said in a voice that could be clearly recorded: \"Spending too long on the toilet can lead to hemorrhoids. I wonder if he actually has hemorrhoids.\"","This time Gu Qingan couldn't help but laugh out loud.","Still, Tang Tang's annoying little gestures were quite charming.","After laughing enough, she covered her mouth with her fist and lightly coughed twice, \"Cough, hemorrhoids can be cured, no problem.\"","\"Yeah, I wonder if he needs a doctor referral. Concealing illness is not good...\"","Soon after, Xie Yuan came back with a dark face.","Shen Tang suspected that he had heard everything they said just now clearly.","The driver's face was slightly flushed, as if he was holding it in.","Oh, just laugh if you want to laugh, what's the point of holding it in, isn't that uncomfortable?","\"Xie Yuan, are you done with your cigarette?\" Shen Tang deliberately asked.","Xie Yuan nodded with a dark face, \"Had two more, to freshen up.\"","Shen Tang glanced at his butt then quickly shifted her gaze, \"Oh.\"","The tone was clearly disbelief.","Xie Yuan was furious.","He had gone out just now to check his phone, but there was nothing.","He felt that Shen Tang must have deleted the record, but no matter how he tried to find it, there was not a trace, as if she had done nothing at all with the phone.","Xie Yuan didn't believe it.","Just then, his phone lit up.","When he listened to it, he heard Shen Tang gossiping about his constipation and hemorrhoids.","He didn't have constipation! Let alone hemorrhoids!","Xie Yuan saw this kind of woman for the first time, how could she be so vulgar and indecent!","On the rest of the way, Shen Tang didn't stir up any more trouble, she knew restraint.","The car drove for about another hour before entering the city.","Unexpectedly, they really brought them to the hospital.","Shen Tang looked up, staring at the hospital name, deep in thought.","Could it be that she was overthinking things before?","On second thought, that seemed unlikely.","\"Is Gu Huaian upstairs?\"","\"Yes, let's go up.\"","The driver did not follow.","But Shen Tang noticed that ever since they entered the hospital, there were several fleeting gazes drifting over from time to time.","She inconspicuously glanced over and indeed found several burly men.","Tsk tsk, these people's acting skills were not very good, she discovered them right away.","Shen Tang stroked her chin, if she opened a teaching class, she should be able to earn quite a bit of money..."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: You Mustn't Touch Her","paragraphs":["Shen Tang and Gu Qingan followed Xie Yuan all the way to the ward on the top floor of the inpatient department.","\"Huaian is inside.\"","Shen Tang didn't go in, but leaned against the window to look inside.","Hmm, I can only see someone lying there, but I can't see his face, and I'm not sure if it's Gu Huaian.","\"Sister-in-law, you're not going in?\"","Shen Tang wiped her not very clean sleeves at the corners of her non-existent tears, \"Do you understand? That kind of hometown fear, I'm a little scared now, I dare not go in and see.\"","Xie Yuan's mouth twitched.","He looked at Gu Qingan again: \"Sister, aren't you going in to see Huaian?\"","Gu Qingan sighed, \"I'm also very scared. As long as I don't go in, I don't have to face the bad news that Huaian is going to be amputated.\"","Xie Yuan: \"...\"","His patience was about to run out.","These two women were really something.","\"Huaian misses you, why don't you go in and see first.\"","Xie Yuan pushed open the door and tried to push the two women in.","The more he said this, the more Shen Tang felt something was wrong. She shook her head violently and retreated, \"Wait! Let me get mentally prepared!\"","\"What's there to get mentally prepared for? Isn't he your husband?\"","Shen Tang muttered softly, \"He might not be...\"","Xie Yuan: \"...\"","\"So if Huaian is disabled, you don't want him anymore?\"","\"Who knows...\" Shen Tang sighed.","Of course she didn't really think so, she just felt that the person lying inside was not Gu Huaian.","Unexpectedly—","\"Alright, Xie Yuan, stop teasing them.\"","It turned out to be Gu Huaian's voice!","Shen Tang turned her head and rushed into the ward. Gu Huaian's face was pale as he lay in bed, his head wrapped in bandages, with faint blood stains seeping through.","\"Gu, Gu Huaian?\"","Gu Huaian forced out a smile: \"Tangtang...\"","He had actually just been woken up by Shen Tang's thoughts.","Not to mention Shen Tang, even Gu Qingan was completely stunned.","They didn't expect Gu Huaian to really be here.","Gu Qingan looked closely, yes, it was not fake, it was indeed her brother.","\"What's going on here?\"","Xie Yuan crossed his arms and sneered coldly from the doorway, his attitude was very bad.","\"Did you hear that? If your leg is really broken, your dear wife won't want you anymore.\"","Shen Tang's heart tightened, \"I just now—\"","Gu Huaian gave her a reassuring look, \"Don't worry, I understand.\"","Only then did Shen Tang realize that Gu Huaian could still hear her thoughts now, so he naturally knew what she was thinking.","But the others were unaware of this.","Xie Yuan felt that Gu Huaian was simply bewitched by this woman Shen Tang.","\"My sister is no worse than her in any way.\"","\"No matter how good your sister is, in my heart, she can't compare to Tangtang.\"","Shen Tang's old face turned red, so many people here, how could he say such things.","Gu Qingan, who was on the side, curled her lips, she really couldn't stand to watch.","Xie Yuan was also extremely angry, \"Gu Huaian, are you confused? She just said she would abandon you!\"","\"Yeah, I heard it.\"","Xie Yuan felt this guy was beyond saving. He left in anger, flinging his sleeves.","Only then did Shen Tang and Gu Qingan ask what was going on.","The truth was similar to what Xie Yuan said. Gu Huaian did fall off a cliff and was rescued by hikers in the mountains.","Coincidentally, he just happened to hit his head and lost his memory.","Xie Yuan's younger sister Xie Xuan had liked him since she was a child. She took the opportunity to lie to him that she was his girlfriend.","Upon hearing this, Shen Tang's face darkened slightly.","Gu Huaian chuckled lightly, \"Don't worry, I just lost my memory, I'm not stupid. She's not my type.\"","\"Oh? What is your type then? Or are you saying, if she was your type, you would have accepted her?\"","Shen Tang felt this whole thing was a bit contrived, TV dramas didn't even dare to portray this, novels didn't even dare to write this.","\"I only like you.\"","The sudden confession made Shen Tang's old face flush red.","Gu Qingan: \"...\"","\"Can you two talk about the main issue?\"","She really, really, really didn't want to eat dog food!","\"The reason for the brief amnesia is because the blood clot from the head injury compressed the brain area. But I recovered my memory very quickly, and never believed their words.\" Gu Huaian said.","\"Then why is Xie Yuan still monitoring us?\" Shen Tang told him all about Xie Yuan's behavior along the way.","Gu Huaian's face was also very ugly.","He had clearly only asked Xie Yuan to bring the person over properly. He didn't know he had done so much more.","\"I'm sorry, I scared you guys. I didn't know about this matter. This was indeed wrong of him to do. He's in the underworld, so his methods might be...\"","Shen Tang was about to explode, in vain she had thought of so many ways to escape along the way, in the end she found out that she was the fool who had been toyed with all along.","Gu Qingan's expression was also unpleasant. \"How are you still tangled up with him? Don't you remember you got hurt because of him before?\"","Hearing these words, Shen Tang only then knew they had some bad memories before.","The two met abroad. Gu Huaian had saved Xie Yuan, and then was injured by Xie Yuan's enemies.","In principle, this was not a big deal.","The difficulty was that Xie Xuan fell in love with Gu Huaian at first sight. Her pursuers had since been making things difficult for Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang thought of Gu Huaian struggling alone abroad at that time, and felt even more heartache.","Gu Huaian secretly gave Gu Qingan a thumbs up.","Well done.","Although he didn't want to use this to gain sympathy, making his wife feel heartache for him was still something he enjoyed very much.","\"It was just a coincidence this time, he happened to be treated in this hospital too.\"","This was quite a coincidence, Shen Tang thought.","There was a sudden knock on the door. Without waiting for them to respond, the door was pushed open, and a beautiful girl walked in arrogantly.","\"Brother Huaian, you're awake?\"","After saying that, she noticed Shen Tang and Gu Qingan standing aside, and her expression instantly changed, \"Brother Huaian, who are they?!\"","Gu Qingan said lightly: \"Hello, I'm Gu Huaian's sister.\"","Hearing this, the girl's expression relaxed a little, and she called out sweetly: \"Hello sister.\"","She looked at Shen Tang again, \"Are you Huaian's sister too?\"","Shen Tang sneered, \"No.\"","\"Oh, then you are his younger sister!\"","\"Nope.\"","\"Then you are—\"","\"Oh, I'm his wife.\"","The girl instantly pulled a Sichuan opera changing face, \"Wife! You are his wife, then who am I?\"","Shen Tang asked back, \"Yeah, so who are you?\"","Just then, Xie Yuan strode in, \"Xuanxuan.\"","Xie Xuan cried and threw herself into Xie Yuan's arms like a butterfly, \"Brother, is it true what that woman said, that she is Huaian brother's wife?\"","Xie Yuan sighed, \"It's true.\"","Xie Xuan looked up red-eyed, \"Didn't you say you would help me—\"","Before she could finish, her mouth was covered by Xie Yuan. Only then did Xie Xuan react to what she had just said.","Gu Huaian's face was cold as he asked, \"Help you what?\"","He warned Xie Yuan, \"I told you, don't touch her.\"","Xie Yuan shrugged helplessly, \"I didn't touch her.\"","\"I hope not.\""]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: We were married by agreement.","paragraphs":["Xie Xuan was very straightforward and would blurt out whatever was on her mind. This often resulted in Xie Yuan having to cover her mouth.","Shen Tang suddenly felt a little sympathy for Xie Yuan - having such a big mouth for a little sister must be very tiring.","She even had a feeling that if Xie Xuan said a few more sentences, she might end up spilling out her family's bank card password.","Thinking of this, she really wanted to try asking more.","But she wasn't interested in the bank card password.","\"Xie Xuan, is your brother constipated?\" Shen Tang asked.","Upon hearing Shen Tang's words, Xie Xuan was stunned for a moment. \"Consti-what?\"","\"Constipated.\"","Xie Yuan's face instantly turned dark. \"I do not have constipation! Or hemorrhoids!\"","Shen Tang instantly covered her mouth in surprise. \"What? You have hemorrhoids?\"","Because Xie Xuan didn't know the context, when she heard her brother suddenly say this, she looked over doubtfully: \"Brother, you actually—\"","Before she could finish speaking, she took two steps back with a look of disgust on her face.","Then she said in a small voice, \"Brother, we can't avoid doctors out of modesty. Since we're in the hospital already, you should go get it checked out...\"","Xie Yuan: \"...\"","He ground his back teeth. \"I told you, I'm not sick!\"","\"Yes, yes, you're not sick, I'm the one who's constipated and has hemorrhoids.\"","The way Shen Tang spoke made it seem like she was coaxing a disobedient child. Her words only further confirmed that Xie Yuan had constipation and hemorrhoids.","Xie Yuan was so angry he wanted to teach this loose-tongued woman a lesson.","Gu Huaian lightly coughed and started to fan the flames: \"I didn't expect you to have this kind of hidden illness. But it's not a big deal. I happen to have an extra room next door, how about you—\"","Xie Yuan immediately stood up. He really could not stay in this room any longer.","After Xie Yuan left, Xie Xuan was still shamelessly sitting there.","Shen Tang didn't particularly dislike her, even though she was attracted to her husband.","Of course, Shen Tang didn't have a cuckold fetish.","It was just that Xie Xuan was like an immature child. Her liking for Gu Huaian was probably not romantic, but simply an innocent obsession over his looks.","This wasn't just Shen Tang's wild guess, there were signs indicating as much.","Because she noticed Xie Xuan had secretly looked at her several times, with very complicated feelings in her eyes - admiration, jealousy, and astonishment.","That's right, astonishment.","It was the same look she had seen in the eyes of fans she had run into on the streets.","Shen Tang clutched her stomach and let out a soft cry. Before Gu Huaian could say anything, Xie Xuan hurriedly asked: \"What's wrong?\"","\"Tangtang, what's uncomfortable?\"","\"I feel a little hungry...\"","The few of them then realized they hadn't eaten much today.","What was more important was that they hadn't bathed either.","Shen Tang suddenly raised her arm to smell herself - luckily there was no stink.","It was a good thing the weather was cool, otherwise she probably would've reeked.","She might be the most sloppy female celebrity.","\"Hungry? Let me treat you to a meal?\"","Seeing three pairs of eyes look over at her, Xie Xuan stammered out an explanation: \"Why are you all staring at me? Don't tell me you really want me to foot the bill?\"","\"Yeah, I have no money.\"","Shen Tang replied, turning out her two pockets which were completely empty without anything inside.","\"I don't just have no money, I don't even have a phone...\"","Xie Xuan pursed her lips. \"Aren't you a celebrity? How can you be so poor?\"","\"I can't help it. I just escaped from kidnappers.\"","There was some evasiveness in Xie Xuan's eyes - it looked like she knew about this incident.","\"I see...\"","After thinking for a bit, she took out a card from her bag. \"Then, then take this card and buy yourself a phone.\"","Shen Tang had to hold back her laughter. This girl was really silly, but an adorable kind of silly.","\"Oh right, what were you saying to your brother earlier?\"","\"Huh? Which part?\"","Xie Xuan racked her brains but couldn't remember. It felt like she had said a lot of things today.","\"The part where you asked your brother, 'Didn't you say you would help me'?\"","Shen Tang was just casually asking out of curiosity, and had not been prepared for Xie Xuan to actually answer.","Unexpectedly, she did reply.","First, she snuck what she thought was an inconspicuous glance at Gu Huaian. Then she said softly: \"It's nothing much. My brother promised he would 'deal with' you.\"","Shen Tang's face filled with shock. \"What do you mean, deal with?\"","Don't tell me they were going to bump her off!","Xie Xuan quickly explained when she also thought of this possibility: \"I just meant making you not come around anymore.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"May I ask...is there any difference between the two?\"","Xie Xuan wanted to explain but couldn't articulate the difference. Finally she just mumbled: \"My brother is a good person. He didn't intend to harm you, otherwise he wouldn't have brought you here.\"","Shen Tang neither agreed nor disagreed on this point.","There was no way she believed that Xie Yuan was a good person.","However, it was true that he brought her back here.","Then, Xie Xuan dropped a bombshell out of nowhere: \"Anyway, you and Brother Huaian only got married by agreement. Why don't you just let him go to be with me instead!\"","Shen Tang stared hard first at Gu Huaian, then shifted her gaze to Gu Qingan.","At this moment, she only had one thought in her head: Oh no, our secret's been exposed!","Beside them, Gu Qingan's eyes instantly widened. \"What agreement to get married?\"","\"No...there's no agreement or anything like that.\"","Gu Huaian's brow furrowed. \"Where did you hear such nonsense?\"","\"It's totally not nonsense! Anyway, I just somehow know, okay?\"","Gu Qingan's expression was calm, but those familiar with her could tell she was clearly angry.","She forced out a smile with some effort: \"I'm sorry Miss Xie, but we have some family matters to discuss. Could you please leave us for a moment?\"","Xie Xuan didn't really want to leave, but seeing the strange expressions on all their faces, she got a little frightened.","\"Alright then...\"","After she left and Gu Qingan locked the door, she crossed her arms and gestured at Shen Tang and Gu Huaian with her chin. \"Explain yourselves, what's going on here?\"","Shen Tang let out an awkward laugh. \"Sis, she's just spouting nonsense.\"","\"Oh? Lying isn't very nice though. Truthful children get rewarded with 5 million.\"","Damn, what a vicious curse!","Shen Tang immediately changed her tune. It definitely wasn't because of the 5 million.","\"No no, we really did get married by agreement.\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Tangtang...\"","Shen Tang righteously stated: \"Gu Huaian, that's my sister. I can't bring myself to lie and deceive her.\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","That's not how you really feel inside.","\"So between you two...\"","They didn't seem loveless to Gu Qingan either though.","Shen Tang didn't reply.","Gu Huaian explained: \"I'm chasing after her.\"","Gu Qingan walked over and patted Gu Huaian on the shoulder. \"Go for it! If you can't get her, don't come back.\""]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Brother of Huai 'an","paragraphs":["Gu Qingan didn't stay long as she had other matters to attend to.","After being away for so many days without any news, she wondered if the two children missed her.","Shen Tang also wanted to go with her, but Gu Huaian wouldn't allow it.","In his words, since the hospital room was a suite, it was more than enough for two people to stay there comfortably.","Due to Gu Huaian's mind-reading ability still being active, Shen Tang felt a bit uncomfortable, as if she were naked.","Gu Huaian seemed to be in pain, gasping for breath.","Shen Tang became nervous and asked, \"What's wrong? Should I call a doctor for you?\"","\"It's nothing, just a bit of pain from the wound.\" Gu Huaian's brows furrowed, and he spoke with a sense of loss. \"It's alright, you can go, I'll be fine on my own.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Here it comes again. This person really knows how to manipulate her.","She sighed and said, \"I haven't brought any change of clothes.\"","Gu Huaian hurriedly said, \"I'll have someone bring them for you.\"","Seeing Gu Huaian take out his phone, Shen Tang squinted her eyes and asked, \"What happened to your previous phone?\"","\"It's broken, what's wrong?\"","Shen Tang stroked her chin and recounted the details of the call she received earlier. \"How do you think they obtained my phone number?\"","\"Privacy breaches are rampant nowadays, they might have gotten it from somewhere. Don't worry, I'll have someone look into it.\"","\"By the way, was it Master Xie who messaged me about you taking a shower?\" Shen Tang remembered how she misunderstood and felt upset for a long time because of that one sentence.","\"No, I hadn't met him at that time. That person was another friend of mine, but he was just here for a visit and has already gone back.\"","\"Oh, have you found the master yet?\"","Gu Huaian sighed, unable to hide his disappointment. \"Not yet, but I've got some leads.\"","\"It's alright, no need to rush. The whereabouts of these highly skilled individuals are usually elusive.\"","After taking a shower, Shen Tang's phone was also brought to her.","She opened it and saw over 99 WeChat messages.","She flipped through them and was surprised to find that the person who messaged her the most was Zhou Jin, also known as Second Young Master Zhou Jin, from being angry and complaining at first, to later expressing concern.","Shen Tang felt somewhat bewildered.","Gu Huaian couldn't hold back any longer and asked cautiously, \"Tangtang, who is Zhou Jin?\"","Shen Tang furrowed her brows. \"You've eavesdropped on my thoughts again.\"","\"Sorry, but it's not something I can control...\" Gu Huaian didn't want this ability either; it was too extraordinary.","Suddenly, Shen Tang regretted staying here. If this issue couldn't be resolved, she wouldn't be able to get along with Gu Huaian without any reservations.","As soon as this thought arose, Gu Huaian naturally heard it. He couldn't help but feel remorseful for asking earlier.","However, he really cared about who this Second Young Master Zhou Jin was...","Gu Huaian cautiously looked at Shen Tang, not knowing if she would be angry.","Shen Tang felt somewhat helpless and patiently explained, \"It's nothing, just one of my students. I promised his mother to tutor him for a month, but then you had an accident...\"","\"So he's a student...\" Gu Huaian felt relieved; he should be just a teenager, a little brat who posed no threat.","Shen Tang didn't know what Gu Huaian was thinking, and she began to reply to the messages one by one.","Shen Tang felt apologetic when Elder Sister Liang greeted her with concern, as she had disappeared after only tutoring for a day, which seemed somewhat irresponsible.","After Shen Tang explained sincerely, she thought the matter would be settled. However, to her surprise, Elder Sister Liang said she could continue tutoring when Shen Tang returned.","Shen Tang was thrilled!","Yes! Her money was still there!","She had a good night's sleep.","The next day, Shen Tang slept until the sun was high in the sky before getting up.","When she woke up, Gu Qingan had already been there for a while, sitting on the sofa wearing glasses and working.","Gu Huaian was also sitting by the bedside, working on something.","Shen Tang secretly admired them. These siblings were truly hardworking, starting their day so early.","She sat down next to Gu Huaian and asked, \"How do you feel today? Did the doctor change your medication?\"","Gu Huaian took off his glasses and replied, \"Not bad, I feel much better.\"","Shen Tang observed carefully. The wound still looked quite terrifying.","Although Gu Huaian's injuries seemed severe, they were actually not too bad. However, he couldn't move around for the time being and had to rest in bed.","As a result, the search for the master had to be postponed.","After quietly chatting for a while, Gu Huaian suddenly tried to get up with great effort.","Shen Tang forcefully pressed him back onto the bed and scolded, \"Are you trying to kill yourself?\"","\"I can do it.\"","\"What can you do? You, as a patient, have no right to speak. You can only do it when the doctor says so.\" Shen Tang asserted.","Gu Qingan, who was peeling an apple nearby, felt a bit redundant. \"Are you two acting in a drama here?\"","Shen Tang reached out and hugged her arm.","\"Help! Help!\"","\"It's fine, I'm watching. Sister, don't you think he's being stubborn? Even though he's injured like that, he acts as if the world would stop without him.\"","\"Yes, but what do you mean by 'master'?\" Elder Sister Liang asked first. \"By the way, how are Anran and Wuyang doing? Your parents don't know about this, right?\"","\"No, they don't know. I'm afraid they would worry.\"","Everyone was intelligent, and seeing that Gu Huaian didn't want to talk about it, Gu Qingan didn't pursue it either.","Everyone has their privacy, and she didn't like prying into other people's secrets.","For her, as long as her family was safe, healthy, and well, everything else didn't matter.","Just as she finished peeling an apple, Xie Xuan's chattering voice resounded.","It could be said that her voice arrived before she did.","\"Huaian Brother~\"","Yes, Xie Xuan still called Gu Huaian that way.","Shen Tang also followed suit and whispered, \"Huaian Brother~\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Do you think I sound good?\"","\"Sounds good.\"","\"Hmph, I don't believe you.\"","Xie Xuan entered cheerfully, hopping and skipping in her high heels, looking very joyful.","\"What's the matter? Did you win the lottery?\"","Xie Xuan paused for a moment. \"No.\"","\"Then why are you so happy?\"","Xie Xuan rolled her eyes. \"Are you that shallow? Must I win the lottery to be happy?\"","\"Yes, I am just an ordinary person,\" Xie Xuan sighed.","Shen Tang remained silent.","\"Is money the only thing in your life?\" Xie Xuan asked.","\"No,\" Shen Tang replied.","Just as Xie Xuan was about to say something, Shen Tang continued, \"I don't even have money in my life.\"","Xie Xuan blinked in disbelief and covered her mouth, \"Doesn't Gu Huaian give you any money to spend?\"","Suddenly, a thought struck her, and her eyes lit up. \"How about this? I'll give you money, and you give me Gu Huaian. How does that sound?\"","Shen Tang rubbed his chin. \"How much are you offering?\"","Gu Huaian interjected, \"...\"","Xie Xuan raised a finger, pondered for a moment, and then extended another finger, crossing the two fingers to form a \"ten\" shape.","Shen Tang exclaimed with excitement, \"Ten billion? Okay, deal! Money on one hand, goods on the other.\"","Xie Xuan was taken aback. \"???\"","Gu Huaian said, \"Tang Tang...\"","He was still there. How could she do this in front of him?","Shen Tang lightly tapped her head. \"Oh right, Xuan Xuan, let's go out and talk?\"","Xie Xuan was frightened by Shen Tang's enthusiasm. Seeing Shen Tang reaching out to pull her, she took a few steps back in alarm. \"Wait, are you serious? Don't you love Gu Huaian very much? You're really going to sell him?\"","\"But I want money more. How much are you giving me for ten billion?\" Shen Tang asked.","Xie Xuan pursed her lips. \"Can we negotiate?\"","\"Sure.\"","\"A hundred thousand.\"","\"How much?\"","\"A hundred thousand.\"","Shen Tang touched his ear. He suspected he misheard.","You're a wealthy young lady. Even one of your bags costs more than a hundred thousand. Now, you're offering such a small amount to buy a person.","Shen Tang cautiously asked, \"May I ask if your family has gone bankrupt?\"","\"It's your family that has gone bankrupt!\"","\"Then why are you offering so little?\"","After hesitating for a long time, Xie Xuan finally said, \"Yesterday, when I went home, my brother cut off my living expenses. I only have a hundred thousand left.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Am I the kind of person who sells her husband? Gu Huaian and I are truly in love. I won't sell him for any amount of money. Give up!\"","Everyone present: \"...\"","If it weren't for what you said earlier, they might have actually believed it."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: The Master has been Found","paragraphs":["Of course, Shen Tang knew that Xie Xuan could not take out one billion.","Not just her, ordinary people generally could not take out such a large sum of money.","Gu Huaian weakly said, \"Tang Tang, I'm very valuable!\"","Shen Tang walked over and kissed his forehead, \"Don't talk nonsense, I value you as a person.\"","【Your person and your money are all mine, hahahaha!】","Gu Huaian was a little helpless, but he just liked Shen Tang's greedy and lustful little look.","Xie Xuan on the side was stunned, \"You, you...\"","\"What's wrong with me?\"","\"How can you kiss him?\"","Shen Tang sneered and leaned down to kiss him.","When Gu Huaian looked up, the kiss on the forehead turned into mouth to mouth.","Xie Xuan stamped her feet angrily, \"You two are too bad!\"","Sitting silently working and watching the fun on the side, Gu Qingan pushed his glasses and nodded in agreement.","Well said, these two were really wicked.","That's right, Shen Tang did it on purpose.","Xie Xuan was naive and straightforward. She had been thinking about Gu Huaian, which was not good.","However, she thought Xie Xuan would get angry and leave, but unexpectedly she did not leave. Instead, she moved closer and said, \"Do you two kiss so closely? It's different from in the movies?\"","Shen Tang, Gu Huaian: \"......\"","\"Can't you do it?\"","When Gu Qingan heard Xie Xuan say this, he lowered his head, shoulders shaking, \"Pfft!\"","In the end, he couldn't help but laugh out loud.","Xie Xuan was baffled, \"Did I say something wrong?\"","\"No.\" Gu Huaian said gloomily, \"So do you have nothing else to do and come here every day?\"","Xie Xuan pouted, \"I kindly came to see you, yet you say this to me.\"","\"No need.\"","Xie Xuan's eyes instantly filled with tears, \"Woo woo woo, you're bullying me!\"","Shen Tang thought she would leave now, but unexpectedly, Xie Xuan's brain circuits were inexplicable. She actually ran into her arms crying.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She raised her hands, not knowing where to put them.","\"Um...\"","Xie Xuan looked up with misty eyes, \"Shen Tang, you think he's too much too, right? I won't like him anymore.\"","Just as Shen Tang was about to comfort her, she immediately changed her words: \"You're right, he's too bad.\"","Then she heard Xie Xuan say, \"I'll like you from now on!\"","This sentence was like a thunderclap in Shen Tang's ears. She even wondered if she had misheard.","\"You like me?\"","\"Yes, anyway you look decent enough, you're my type.\"","Gu Huaian's face was as black as coal on the side.","What the heck! This Xie Xuan had something wrong with her!","This time, Gu Qingan tightly covered her mouth to keep herself from laughing out loud. After all, she still wanted to watch the drama live and didn't want to be kicked out.","Shen Tang was also confused. Could this person instantly change her orientation?","She was right in her previous guess. Xie Xuan simply liked Gu Huaian's face.","A person who could be the female lead would naturally have a very good-looking face, even better looking than the male lead.","Shen Tang thought of Xie Xuan's previous offer of 100,000 to buy Gu Huaian, and couldn't help but be a little suspicious. Did she do it on purpose, deliberately making things turn out this way, so she could stop liking him properly?","Shen Tang felt this idea might be a bit far-fetched, but it was really hard not to think so!","However, on second thought, she felt Xie Xuan didn't have that kind of brain.","\"Um...\"","Before Shen Tang could speak, Xie Xuan started sobbing.","\"You don't like me either? I've never had a single friend since I was little, no one has ever truly liked me, even my brother dislikes my clumsiness... woo woo woo, what's the point of me being alive...\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She really hadn't seen such a girl before, leaving her at a loss as to what to do.","She looked to Gu Huaian for help. She saw Gu Huaian was on the phone.","After the call connected, he said coldly, \"You have three minutes to take your sister away!\"","\"What happened to her?\" came the inquiry from the other end of the phone.","Gu Huaian didn't explain, just directly hung up the phone.","Xie Xuan looked at him angrily, \"You're so vicious! You actually told on me!\"","Gu Huaian's thin lips pressed into a straight line, \"Miss Xie, please let my wife go.\"","\"I won't!\"","After saying that, Xie Xuan hugged Shen Tang even tighter.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Perhaps still afraid of Xie Yuan, after hugging for a while, Xie Xuan said to Shen Tang, \"I'll sneak away first and come see you next time!\"","After saying that, she hurried out sneakily clutching her bag.","In less than a minute, Shen Tang could hear Xie Xuan's shrill screams from outside the house.","Hmm, she must have been caught.","Yesterday her allowance was confiscated, who knows what would happen this time.","Gu Huaian, who could hear Shen Tang's thoughts clearly, said, \"Tang Tang, don't think about her!\"","\"OK, I'll listen to you.\"","Shen Tang rubbed her chin, \"But don't you think Xie Xuan is quite cute?\"","\"Not cute, you're the cutest.\"","The ringtone on the phone suddenly rang. Gu Huaian listened for a moment, then sat up abruptly, \"Really?\"","He held Shen Tang's hand excitedly and said, \"Tang Tang, we found the master!\"","Shen Tang was also overjoyed, \"Where? Where?\"","\"The master is staying at the Big Buddha Temple. My people are watching him there. Let's go now, the two of us.\" As Gu Huaian spoke, he lifted the quilt to get out of bed.","\"Stop, stop, you're injured. I'll go alone.\"","\"I can do it!\"","\"You won't listen to me?\"","Gu Huaian was in a dilemma for a moment: \"I heard this master has a strange personality. I'm afraid you'll be mistreated...\"","\"Don't worry, who mistreats who is uncertain.\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\""]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Far Away, Near","paragraphs":["Gu Qingan was prepared to accompany Shen Tang, but he was rejected.","\"I'll accompany you to the entrance.\"","After hesitating for a moment, Shen Tang agreed.","She felt that her health was not good, and it would be bad if she encountered any problems.","The two of them took a car to the Big Buddha Temple, which was a particularly spiritual temple nearby. The incense was strong, and many tourists from other places came here.","It wasn't until they reached the foot of the mountain that Shen Tang understood what it meant to be truly \"busy.\"","Indeed, there were just too many people here, crowded with adults, children, and the elderly, all walking up the mountain.","Yes, there were no other paths to ascend the mountain, only these 999 steps.","Shen Tang had no choice but to abandon the car and walk. She said to Gu Qingan, \"You wait for me in the car.\"","\"I'll go with you.\"","\"No, there are too many people here, and it's not dangerous. Just wait for me here.\"","After some persuasion, Shen Tang ended up walking up the mountain alone.","Although people were coming and going around her, and it was very crowded, she was immersed in her own world.","If this place was really spiritual, then she hoped Gu Huai'an would recover quickly, that her family and friends would be healthy and safe.","She also hoped that the other \"Shen Tang\" could be happy.","Perhaps because she had something on her mind, climbing the stairs was not too tiring.","She didn't know how long it took, but Shen Tang suddenly realized that she had reached the mountaintop.","It was truly a famous Big Buddha Temple, solemn and dignified, just looking at it made people feel respectful and dare not act recklessly.","Shen Tang bowed to the central Buddha and then asked the little monk next to her, \"Excuse me, is Master Zang here?\"","The little monk smiled and shook his head, \"Sorry, there is no Master Zang with that surname here.\"","Shen Tang frowned. Gu Huai'an's information couldn't be false. Could it be that the master had already left?","Thinking that someone was watching him here, Shen Tang hurriedly asked Gu Huai'an and learned that Master Zang had indeed entered the Big Buddha Temple and hadn't come out. Only then did Shen Tang feel relieved.","As long as he was here, she would find him sooner or later.","Maybe this little monk was not aware, she thought.","With so many people here now, and not in a hurry anyway, Shen Tang began to wander around the Big Buddha Temple.","The scenery here was picturesque, the air exceptionally fresh, making people feel relaxed and happy. Even the gloom in her heart was washed away, and the problems that had been bothering her seemed to be resolved.","Shen Tang closed her eyes and took a deep breath, only to hear a crisp male voice, \"Sorry, I couldn't help but take a picture of you when I saw you looking up at the scenery. Let me give you the photo.\"","Shen Tang turned her head and saw a young, handsome man with long hair speaking. He looked to be in his twenties or thirties, a bit shy and bashful.","Shen Tang nodded and said, \"Sure.\"","After the man saw Shen Tang's face clearly, his expression suddenly changed. \"You... I'm afraid you're not from here, right?\"","At first, Shen Tang didn't understand what he meant. \"I'm indeed not a local.\"","The man awkwardly began to explain, \"No, what I mean is...\"","He glanced at the people nearby and quickly stopped talking.","He approached Shen Tang and whispered, \"What I mean is, you're not from this world, right?\"","Shen Tang's heart skipped a beat, but her face remained expressionless. \"Oh? Why do you say that?\"","Could it be that he was not from this world either? Did he know the original owner of her body? Or did he know her?","In that instant, countless thoughts raced through Shen Tang's mind.","The man sighed, \"I'm not sure either. I heard it from my master.\"","\"Who is your master?\"","\"My master is called Zang Tianyi.\"","Shen Tang raised her head abruptly, \"You said your master is who?\"","\"Zang Tianyi?\"","How extraordinary, truly extraordinary.","She never expected that when all seemed lost and she had no way out, she would encounter Zang Tianyi's disciple here, without any effort at all.","However, Shen Tang was not someone who easily trusted others. She casually asked, \"Since your master is Master Zang, why did you learn this?\"","Shen Tang pointed to the camera in the man's hand.","\"It's just a personal hobby of mine. Since you know my master, you must know that he loves traveling far and wide, there are so many beautiful sceneries. I just want to capture them.\"","Shen Tang nodded in understanding. She also enjoyed capturing beautiful sceneries.","Although she used a phone, hahaha.","\"May I request your help in introducing me to Master Zang? I have something important to discuss with him.\"","\"You don't have to say it, I also wanted to bring you to meet my master, regarding you... this matter.\"","Shen Tang felt extremely anxious. She never expected that even Zang Tianyi's disciple could tell that she was not from this world. Then, how formidable must Zang Tianyi himself be?","Would he pose a threat to her?","But looking at Zang Tianyi's disciple, he seemed like a good person, not very clever and quite innocent.","Shen Tang pondered all the way until a voice came from ahead, \"We've arrived.\"","She looked up and saw tall trees surrounding the area, with fallen leaves covering the ground below while the trees on the mountain remained lush.","This was a row of wooden rooms, with wind chimes hanging under the eaves, swaying in the wind and emitting a crisp sound.","Shen Tang's previously tense heart suddenly relaxed.","At this point, thinking about all those irrelevant matters was meaningless.","A voice from inside the room said, \"A guest from a distant place, please come in.\"","Shen Tang took a deep breath and pushed open the door.","Inside the room, there was a faint smell of sandalwood, which was pleasant and calming.","An old man with white hair sat on a cushion, smiling as he looked over.","\"Please have a seat, young friend.\"","Shen Tang sat on the cushion opposite Master Zang.","\"Master, I have come to request something.\"","Master Zang made a gesture, urging her to remain calm. \"Young friend, you came from a different realm. Have you decided to stay here?\"","\"Is Master implying that I can still go back?\" Shen Tang asked.","Master Zang didn't speak, he just smiled and looked at Shen Tang.","After a moment's hesitation, Shen Tang replied with determination, \"Here, I have people who love me and people whom I love. I want to stay here.\"","Here, she had more than just friends; she had family and loved ones, a feeling she couldn't experience in that other world.","Once she had experienced the utmost warmth, it was difficult to accept the lonely life she had before.","Eating, sleeping, working alone, even falling sick alone.","Although she had friends, they had their own lives and couldn't revolve around her.","Shen Tang didn't want to live that kind of life anymore.","Master Zang stroked his long beard and smiled. \"Don't worry, young friend. The problem that troubles you will soon be resolved smoothly.\"","\"How can it be resolved?\" Shen Tang, who usually understood things quickly, couldn't catch on this time. \"How can it be reconciled?\"","\"Well...\" Master Zang's expression turned slightly awkward. \"If you don't understand, you can search online for some courses to learn about it.\"","Shen Tang was about to search on her phone when she suddenly realized something, and her face instantly turned red.","Oh my, what kind of embarrassing question did she just ask!","But Master Zang, true to his title, quickly adjusted. \"Ahem, do you have any other concerns, young friend?\"","After giving it some thought, Shen Tang asked, \"I want to know, where did the original Shen Tang go?\"","Master Zang smiled and looked at her. \"Far away, yet right before your eyes.\"","Shen Tang's heart seemed to skip a beat. \"What do you mean by that, Master?\"","Could it be that she is the Shen Tang from this place? Are they actually the same person?","\"I believe you already have the answer in your heart,\" Master Zang replied.","\"But why? I don't quite understand,\" Shen Tang said.","Master Zang didn't explain but poured a cup of tea and handed it to her. \"Care for a taste?\"","To be honest, Shen Tang wasn't in the mood for tea at the moment, but Master Zang must have had his reasons.","Shen Tang lifted the tea and drank it all in one go, but as she was about to speak, she suddenly felt dizzy and lost consciousness.","Oh my, it's poisoned!","That was her last thought before she passed out."]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: What's a Mere Rebirth","paragraphs":["Shen Tang had a dream.","In the dream, she was like a bystander, standing on the sidelines, glimpsing at \"Shen Tang's\" entire life in a flash.","\"Shen Tang's\" consciousness was clear, but she couldn't control her body.","Every day she was forced to follow the storyline, acting like a vicious cannon fodder, doing all the evil things cannon fodders would do.","The Gu Huaian in the dream was also different from the one in reality. He was very cold, a single glance from him could freeze her in place.","She watched as the \"Shen Tang\" in the dream did all sorts of bad things, and finally died a horrible death.","After \"Shen Tang\" died, her soul floated out from within her body, drifted and drifted, and arrived in another world. She accidentally uncovered the truth.","It turned out she was merely a character in a novel, her existence was to be shamed in all sorts of ways. It turned out her life was controlled by the novel's author.","\"Shen Tang's\" psyche collapsed instantly, she couldn't accept this kind of reality.","Next, the scene went dark.","When she opened her eyes again, \"Shen Tang\" had become the Shen Tang of another world, an orphan who mysteriously appeared at the doorstep of an orphanage.","As a bystander, Shen Tang watched her entire life unfold once more, it felt somewhat different.","Zhuang Zhou dreamed he was a butterfly, she didn't know whether she was Zhuang Zhou who had turned into a butterfly, or a butterfly who had turned into Zhuang Zhou.","But at least now she understood why she didn't have parents, why no one had ever come looking for her.","It turned out she wasn't from this world at all. It turned out she was \"Shen Tang\", and \"Shen Tang\" was her.","Thinking about what she did to Gu Huaian in her past life, she felt a little embarrassed.","Luckily Gu Huaian didn't know about it.","Wait, did Gu Huaian really not know?","Shen Tang thought carefully and realized Gu Huaian's attitude towards her was different from the beginning compared to her past life. She felt something was off.","Could Gu Huaian have reincarnated as well?!","It didn't seem impossible when she thought about it. She had gone through such a bizarre occurrence, what was mere reincarnation compared to that?","\"Little friend? Little friend?\"","Shen Tang heard someone calling her. She felt very annoyed, waved her hand, and heard a \"slap!\".","\"Master!\"","\"It's nothing.\"","Shen Tang's train of thought was interrupted. She opened her eyes irritably to see Master Zang and his disciple surrounding her,","and there was a bright red palm print on Master Zang's face.","\"Master, someone hit you?!\"","Master Zang looked at Shen Tang silently without saying a word.","Shen Tang felt guilty inside. She recalled the slap from her dream just now, could it be that...","Cough, there was no way she would admit to it!","\"Speaking of which, your complexion looks much more radiant now.\"","Master Zang: \"...\"","Disciple: \"...\"","How could she say something like this so shamelessly?","Shen Tang winced as she felt some pain at the back of her head. She got up and saw that she was still lying on that mat.","She looked at it rather resentfully. \"Master, why didn't you give me a warning earlier?\"","If she had known, she would have drank somewhere else!","\"Cough, Master, was that dream I had earlier real?\"","It was just a ephemeral dream, merely a few minutes had passed in reality.","Master Zang nodded slowly. \"Yes.\"","\"Is there anyone else in this world, uh, with memories of their past life?\"","\"There is.\"","\"Is it someone I know?\"","Master Zang nodded, then pointed at himself: \"Me.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Master, you sure have thick skin!","Nevermind, she didn't need to pry anymore.","If she really wanted to know about this, she could just directly ask Gu Huaian. She believed he wouldn't lie to her.","But Shen Tang still wanted to ask about the mind reading. \"Master, you mentioned yin-yang harmony—\"","\"Pfft!\"","Before Shen Tang could finish speaking, Master Zang's disciple spurted out the water he was drinking.","\"Are you alright?\"","\"I'm fine, cough cough, just drank too quickly.\"","Master Zang didn't seem to want to answer this question either. He directly tossed over a small booklet. \"Take this and read it at home. Since you're awake now, please head back.\"","His intention to kick her out was very obvious.","Shen Tang still had some questions she wanted to ask. She saw Master Zang hastily head towards the inner chamber.","\"Wait, Master could I add you on WeChat?\"","Master Zang turned back, took out a brand new banana phone from his robe. \"Should I scan you or you scan me?\"","Oh my, it was good she asked. She didn't expect the Master to actually have WeChat.","Shen Tang had an upward curl to the corners of her lips even as she walked out of the Great Buddha Temple.","She had resolved all her doubts in one go. This trip was truly worth it!","She wondered what booklet Master Zang had given her and opened it to take a look. She instantly closed it back up.","Shen Tang's face was as red as if it was dripping blood. Good heavens, what Master Zang had given her turned out to be an erotic album.","It looked somewhat yellowed, like a book passed down from ancient times. The content was extremely daring. This was Shen Tang's first time seeing something like this.","Noticing no one was looking her way, she sneakily opened it to take another peek.","Tsk tsk, were ancient people this open-minded?","\"What are you looking at?\"","Hearing the voice, Shen Tang hurriedly put away the booklet and turned to look. She realized the person wasn't talking to her.","Shen Tang stroked her chest. Her heart was beating rather quickly, as if she had done something illegal.","She put the booklet into her bag, planning to study it carefully when she got home.","There was a cable car available for going down the mountain, so she wouldn't need to descend step by step. Shen Tang felt much more assured because of this. It was easy to climb up the mountain but difficult to climb down after all. She definitely didn't want to climb down step by step.","When she arrived at the mountain base after getting off the cable car, Shen Tang saw Gu Qingan walk over worriedly.","\"How did it go?\"","Shen Tang made an \"OK\" gesture. \"Extremely well. I met someone and even got their contact information.\"","\"Hehe, big sis waited for me here with great difficulty!\"","\"It wasn't difficult for me at all. Climbing the mountain must have been more tiring for you.\"","Gu Qingan felt tired from just looking at those neverending steps.","Shen Tang waved her hand. \"It wasn't tiring at all. Totally worth the trip! Let's go home!\"","Shen Tang hooked Gu Qingan's arm and skipped happily forward. Even her back view emanated joy.","Hehe, so happy~"]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: Oh, my God, this is awesome","paragraphs":["Shen Tang was thinking that no matter how anxious she was, she couldn't go and force a patient lying in bed to do anything!","Gu Huaian also didn't expect the method to be so simple and crude. He glanced at his own useless leg and wished he could get better immediately.","\"Actually, I can—\"","\"No, you can't!\"","Shen Tang definitely didn't want to do that with him in the ward.","Gu Huaian sighed, \"Fine, then we'll have to wait until I get better.\"","Shen Tang felt somehow strange discussing this topic openly during the day.","She changed the topic and asked, \"So are we staying here or going back?\"","She wanted to earn some tutoring fees. At the same time, she was worried the bumpy ride would be bad for Gu Huaian's health.","Since he could hear her thoughts, Gu Huaian said, \"Let's go back. We can take the plane.\"","A private plane could fly them directly to Gu Family Hospital.","Gu Huaian really didn't want to stay here anymore. That Xie Xuan was like a piece of chewing gum, annoying him to no end.","Speak of the devil.","He just thought of Xie Xuan and heard her chatter loudly at the door.","\"Sister Tang! I'm here to see you!\"","Yes, ever since Xie Xuan decided not to like Gu Huaian anymore and to like Shen Tang instead, she had changed how she addressed her.","Not only that, she had also joined the fan club and spent money to become one of the administrators.","Of course, Shen Tang didn't know any of this because she hadn't checked her phone much.","When Shen Tang heard Xie Xuan's voice, she also felt a headache coming. \"What are you doing here?\"","What she really wanted to ask was why are you here again, but she was afraid it would upset Xie Xuan.","\"I'm here to see you! Sister Tang, it must be difficult for you to stay here with bad food. Why don't you come stay at my house? My family's chef is very good at cooking all kinds of cuisines.\"","Shen Tang's mouth watered.","To be fair, the hospital food really wasn't that tasty. For someone whose taste buds had been pampered like Shen Tang, it was a little hard to swallow.","Gu Huaian's face instantly darkened. He couldn't be more grateful for the decision they just made.","\"Tang Tang...\"","Shen Tang swallowed and painfully rejected the offer: \"I'd better not bother you. I'll be leaving soon.\"","\"Leaving? Where are you going?\" Xie Xuan panicked and grabbed Shen Tang's arm while questioning her.","\"Home. I have work to do too.\"","\"I'm going with you!\" Xie Xuan blurted out.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"No!\"","He didn't agree!","Xie Xuan completely ignored him and pleaded with Shen Tang, \"Sister Tang, can I go back with you? I just came back to the country and don't have any friends. I'm so bored by myself...\"","Here it comes again!","When Shen Tang heard this kind of talk from Xie Xuan, her motherly love would overflow and she could never harden her heart against a girl.","Seeing that Shen Tang was about to agree, Gu Huaian quickly said: \"Xie Xuan! Does your brother know you're leaving?\"","Of course he didn't know.","Xie Xuan rolled her eyes at Gu Huaian, \"You're so annoying. Can you please not interrupt when we are talking?\"","\"Pfft!\"","Shen Tang almost laughed out loud.","So this is the difference between new love and old love?","\"I think you still need your brother's permission. Also, I'll be busy with work when I go back, so I probably won't have time to play with you.\"","Xie Xuan instantly deflated, like an eggplant that had been hit by frost.","\"But I really want to go with you...\"","Shen Tang almost slipped out an agreement.","This pitiful look was just too much!","\"Cough, well I won't have much work soon, so if you come over then, I can host you and show you around properly.\"","Xie Xuan's eyes lit up in delight. \"Really? Sister Tang, I knew you were the best, much better than someone!\"","\"Really!\"","Shen Tang gave Gu Huaian a side glance.","See that? You're not even a fly on the wall anymore.","The mind reading still had some benefits in that no words needed to be exchanged for everything to be understood.","Gu Huaian wearily massaged his brow. A fly on the wall? He didn't even want to be that. Whoever wanted to could have that role.","If Xie Xuan wasn't Xie Yuan's sister, he would've kicked her out long ago.","Because of Xie Xuan's visit this time, Gu Huaian arranged a plane in the afternoon to come pick them up and they left that night.","After returning, Gu Huaian continued to recuperate in the hospital, though his work didn't fall behind at all.","Shen Tang went about her work as scheduled, shuttling between the hospital, Shen Family, studio, and Second Young Master Zhou's Family every day.","She didn't feel tired at all, especially with the large sums of money she was making.","On average, her daily income was around six digits. What was there to complain about?","Zhou Jin's attitude towards Shen Tang had also strangely improved. He was very cooperative during classes.","Shen Tang didn't know why, but it was better this way. It made it easier for her to earn money.","A month passed swiftly and Gu Huaian recovered completely.","Today was the day he would be discharged from the hospital.","Shen Tang came to the hospital carrying a large bouquet, just about to enter when she heard strange sounds coming from the room that sounded like pain mixed with pleasure.","She almost doubted that she had entered the wrong room.","But no, the room number was right.","\"Get out!\" An angry shout came from inside.","Shen Tang froze for a moment. Just as she was about to push the door open, Zhou Qinglian stumbled out with disheveled clothes and red-rimmed eyes.","Seeing Shen Tang, Zhou Qinglian was clearly startled. She glared fiercely at her before running off.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Wait, what did this have to do with her?","She thought for a moment, then curled her finger to lightly knock on the door. \"Um, can I come in?\"","Footsteps sounded and Gu Huaian strode over and pulled Shen Tang into his embrace.","\"Tang Tang, I was almost taken advantage of...\" Gu Huaian sounded greatly wronged.","\"Zhou Qinglian, she...\"","\"She wanted to take me for herself. Fortunately, my reaction was fast enough.\"","Shen Tang didn't really misunderstand hearing those earlier sounds, just felt a little awkward.","To be honest, she had almost forgotten Zhou Qinglian's existence. She didn't expect Zhou Qinglian still hadn't given up.","Was she trying to force herself on him?","Wow, did she think she alone could restrain a grown man like Gu Huaian?","Shouldn't she have come when he was still severely ill instead of waiting until he had recovered?","It seemed she wasn't very smart.","Gu Huaian was a little dissatisfied. He buried his head on Shen Tang's shoulder and said softly: \"Tang Tang, my body has recovered.\"","\"Mm, I've come to take you home.\"","\"Don't want to go back to the villa.\"","\"Okay, then we won't.\"","It was all the same for her. Though, she did miss Peach Blossom a little. She hadn't seen her for a long time.","The two went back to Gu Huaian's place near his company. Mindful of the mind reading still in effect, Shen Tang controlled her brain on the way, trying not to think of anything inappropriate. But when Gu Huaian bent down to change his shoes, she couldn't help but glance at his perky bottom.","[Damn, so perky!]","Shen Tang almost reflexively reached out to slap it but managed to restrain herself.","Gu Huaian: \"???\"","What reflex?","Just who else have you slapped before?!"]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: Brother in Law","paragraphs":["The room had been cleaned, spotless without a speck of dust.","Shen Tang looked carefully, it was exactly the same as when she had left last time, almost no change.","Previously, she couldn't accept the existence of mind reading, always feeling like she was naked without any privacy in front of Gu Huaian.","Now she felt it was fine, after all there was a solution now.","It's just...","Shen Tang couldn't accept doing \"that\" in order to unlock the mind reading ability. The first time was beautiful, she didn't want it to happen because of this weird reason.","She hadn't brought it up, and Gu Huaian hadn't mentioned it either. It was as if the two had tacitly ignored this matter.","Thinking of mind reading, Shen Tang thought of something else. She looked at Gu Huaian with narrowed eyes, \"That reminds me, there's something I want to ask you.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Are you reborn?\"","Gu Huaian nodded: \"Yes.\"","His straightforward answer instead stunned Shen Tang for a moment, \"What, you just told me like that?\"","Gu Huaian stroked Shen Tang's hair and said gently: \"I have nothing that I can’t tell you. I had thought about telling you this before, but there was never a good chance. Mind reading alone made you distance yourself from me, I was afraid if I mentioned rebirth, you would leave me directly.\"","Shen Tang didn't really mind. She did get her just desserts in her previous life, although her death was quite miserable.","After explaining about being forced to follow the storyline, she asked Gu Huaian again: \"What about you, do you have that kind of feeling?\"","Gu Huaian nodded, \"I do too. Sometimes I clearly don't want to do something, yet I can't control my body. I even went to the hospital to get checked, suspecting that I might have a mental illness.\"","It sounded ridiculous, but only those who have personally experienced it knew how terrifying it felt to be unable to control oneself.","Shen Tang threw herself into Gu Huaian's arms, \"It's alright now. No one will control us anymore in the future.\"","\"Yeah, I'm also very glad to meet you again.\"","If he hadn't met Shen Tang, Gu Huaian was certain he would have grown old alone in this life.","Perhaps he would never understand what it felt like to have a lover, and to be loved by someone.","That's right, although Shen Tang hadn't said it out loud, they both understood clearly that the two of them truly loved each other.","\"Are you hungry?\"","\"A little.\"","\"Have a seat, I'll cook for you.\"","\"I'll join you!\"","For couples in love, no matter what they do as long as they stick together, they will feel extremely happy.","Shen Tang was responsible for assisting, while Gu Huaian put on an apron and started cooking.","Since it was late, he didn't make anything too oily in case it was hard to digest.","Gu Huaian simply pan-fried two steaks, with red and green side dishes for embellishment. It looked extremely appetizing.","Just looking at it made Shen Tang even hungrier.","Gu Huaian lit some candles. The dim candlelight set a suggestively romantic atmosphere.","He cut up the steak for Shen Tang before pushing it over, \"Try it and see if you like it.\"","\"Anything you make would definitely taste good.\"","After taking a bite, it was as expected. The flavor was no less than those five-star hotels.","When the meal finished, Shen Tang wiped her mouth and said, \"Alright, I should head home now.\"","Gu Huaian was somewhat bewildered, \"You're not staying here?\"","Shen Tang smiled, \"I don't live here anymore. I want to go back home.\"","Previously, she had always felt somewhat uneasy living with the Shen family, thinking that she had snatched someone else's relatives.","Now that she knew they were her real family, Shen Tang was incredibly happy.","Over the past month, they had gotten along very harmoniously. She was reluctant to leave home for now.","Although Gu Huaian felt a little disappointed, he didn't insist.","\"I'll send you back.\"","\"No need, I can drive back myself.\"","\"I won't feel assured otherwise.\"","Unable to contend against Gu Huaian, Shen Tang let him send her back to the Shen house in the end.","Hearing the car sounds, Shen Yu put down his phone and ran out from the house.","Seeing Gu Huaian, his nose scrunched up in dissatisfaction.","\"Sis, you're only coming back now. Did a certain someone not let you return?\"","Shen Tang flicked his forehead, \"Don't spout nonsense.\"","Shen Yu was very unhappy. \"Sis, let me drive you back from now on. I'm afraid some people harbor malicious intentions.\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Reminding himself that this was his brother-in-law, he endured.","\"I heard you like Michael?\"","Shen Yu stuck out his neck and said, \"So what if I do?\"","\"What a coincidence. I happen to be friends with him on WeChat.\"","This infuriated Shen Yu. Was this guy deliberately here to show off to him?","\"So you have him, no big deal.\"","Shen Yu refused to admit it, but at this moment, his heart felt extremely sour.","\"Call me brother-in-law and I'll connect you.\"","Shen Yu awkwardly swallowed his saliva. \"Really?\"","Seeing Shen Yu's expression, Gu Huaian nearly laughed out loud.","He was indeed Shen Tang's brother. Their little expressions were simply identical.","\"A real man stays true to his word.\"","Shen Yu shouted loudly: \"Brother-in-law!\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","\"You've switched sides already? What happened to keeping perspective?\"","Who was it that clamored daily for her to get a divorce?","Shen Yu smiled awkwardly. \"Sis, it wasn't my intention. But it's Michael's friend!\"","Shen Tang felt his words seemed familiar.","Wait... wasn't this what she often said herself?","She didn't intend to either. It was just the other side kept giving her too much!","Shen Tang suddenly felt uncomfortable. She said to Gu Huaian: \"Ahem, it's gotten late. Be careful on your way back.\"","\"Alright, see you tomorrow.\"","\"See you tomorrow.\"","Shen Yu was extremely excited, but upon entering the house he suddenly realized he didn't actually have Gu Huaian's WeChat contact. He instantly deflated.","\"Sis sis, send me Gu Huaian's WeChat.\"","Shen Tang glanced at him. \"Now you're calling him Gu Huaian again? What happened to brother-in-law?\"","He really knew how to turn his face and deny people!"]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: A Man's gotta Have a Cause.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang directly sent Gu Huaian's WeChat to Shen Yu.","It's unclear what the two talked about, but from the next day onwards, Shen Tang noticed that Shen Yu's attitude towards Gu Huaian had improved significantly. He no longer looked at him with disdain as before.","No need to think too much, Gu Huaian must have offered Shen Yu some benefits that he couldn't refuse.","After all, Shen Yu is very much like her in this aspect.","On the other hand, the TV series and movies she had previously filmed had started airing.","Shen Tang opened Weibo and found quite a few positive reviews, at least there wasn't an overwhelming amount of criticism labeling her as a mere vase.","Fans were very happy, not as aggressive as before when facing haters, but rather surprisingly humble, which made Shen Tang somewhat uncomfortable.","[Are these still Shen Tang's fans? Something doesn't seem quite right.]","[What's the matter, do you need a couple of jabs to feel comfortable?]","[Exactly! Now I feel relieved!]","[...What's wrong with them?]","Seeing these Weibo comments, Shen Tang's expression became quite complicated.","Well, had she gotten used to being criticized?","It's unbearable not to be criticized for a day.","She scrolled through the comments again, and there were still haters persistently targeting her.","However, due to her past glorious experiences of suing them, even when they cursed, they didn't dare go too far.","In the midst of all the praise, those timid haters seemed pitiful.","Shen Tang even felt a bit sympathetic towards them.","One of the haters with the username 'Is Shen Tang Quitting Today' diligently clocked in every day, more dedicated than fans in supporting her.","Shen Tang's name dominated the hot search, and those unaware might have thought she bought it.","But buying it was out of the question, how could she waste that unjust money, after all, she was planning to quit.","It could be said that Shen Tang was trending.","Various endorsements and production teams came knocking, and Pei Kesong brought a stack of documents and slammed them heavily on Shen Tang's desk.","\"Take a look, these are the ones I think are good.\"","Shen Tang touched her nose and briefly flipped through a few, then whispered, \"Can I endorse them all?\"","Pei Kesong frowned, \"All of them?\"","\"Yes, I've told you before, I'm planning to quit.\"","\"You're quitting at this time? Are you crazy or am I crazy?\"","Shen Tang covered her chest and said dramatically, \"I don't want to, but it's too scary here, my fragile little heart can't take it.\"","Pei Kesong remained unmoved, crossing his arms, \"Speak plainly.\"","\"I just want to take it easy.\"","Pei Kesong pushed his glasses up on his nose, \"Are you pregnant?\"","\"No.\"","\"Then you're planning to?\"","Shen Tang was speechless, \"No, why are you asking about that?\"","\"If neither, then your brain must be fried.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Speak plainly, why resort to personal attacks?\"","\"You're so young, not working, planning to retire already?\"","\"Yeah.\"","Shen Tang thought about the balance in her bank account she checked last night, so much money she thought she was dreaming, living off the interest alone would be quite comfortable.","Of course, provided she didn't spend recklessly.","Shen Tang always felt that people work because they don't have money, and since she didn't like working, why should she subject herself to it?","Pei Kesong sighed deeply, his tone weighted with concern as he said, \"Tang Tang, I don't know what you're really thinking. I'm not insisting that you work, but everyone needs a career. If you insist on leaving the entertainment industry, fine, but I hope you find something you truly enjoy doing, rather than lounging at home day after day with no purpose.\"","His words were sincere and heartfelt.","Shen Tang pondered for a moment, realizing she didn't have a particular career she enjoyed.","Compared to other professions, being a female celebrity seemed more liberating.","\"Let me think about it...\" she responded.","\"Take your time, there's no rush. I want your decision to be well-thought-out, not impulsive,\" Pei Kesong replied with understanding.","After finishing speaking, Pei Kesong took out a folder and placed it in front of Shen Tang:","\"Here, this is the contract you signed before. The children's variety show is about to start filming. However, this time it's changed from pre-recorded to live broadcast. Take a look for yourself.\"","Shen Tang raised an eyebrow in surprise; the director was really throwing a curveball.","While other variety shows could be understood, as everyone involved were adults and could play their parts, children were different. They didn't understand pretense and always spoke their minds. Coupled with the tendency of netizens to overanalyze, it could easily lead to trouble.","\"I'm not sure if this is a good idea...\" Shen Tang voiced her concerns. Though she trusted Anran and Wuyang, she didn't want to take unnecessary risks.","\"I need to discuss this with them before deciding,\" she concluded. She couldn't make such a decision alone.","\"Fine, handle it as you see fit,\" Pei Kesong said, refraining from saying more. Some things were better left unsaid.","After some thought, Shen Tang tucked the folder into her bag, intending to discuss it at home.","As soon as she left the building, she received a call from Second Young Master Zhou, saying he needed her urgently.","\"What's the matter?\" she asked.","\"I'm injured.\"","\"If you're injured, call 911, why call me?\"","\"Shen Tang! Are you heartless or what?\"","\"Oops, busted.\"","Shen Tang said that, but she turned the car around and headed to Zhou Jin's house.","Although his voice sounded strong on the phone, she couldn't risk it.","There was no traffic on the road, so Shen Tang arrived at Zhou's house quickly.","The gate was open, and the yard was in disarray, as if it had been through a war. Expensive flowers and plants lay wilted on the ground, making Shen Tang's heart ache just looking at them.","That was all money!","\"Second Young Master Zhou!\"","\"Second Young Master Zhou?\"","\"Zhou Jin?\"","Shen Tang called out for a while, but there was no response. She started to worry that something might have happened to him.","\"I'm here!\"","Zhou Jin hopped down the stairs on one leg, his face bruised and swollen, looking quite frightening.","\"Whoa! What happened to you?\"","\"It's a long story.\"","\"Then make it short.\"","Zhou Jin: \"...\"","\"It's nothing, just some people came to collect debts and got the wrong house.\"","Shen Tang's gaze dropped, puzzled. \"Then what about your leg...\"","Zhou Jin awkwardly grinned, accidentally pulling at his wound and sucking in a sharp breath.","\"I accidentally fell down the stairs.\"","He didn't want to admit he was scared. Those people looked terrifying, and he thought they were after his life!","Shen Tang:...","For a moment, she didn't know what to say.","Both of them had issues.","\"Let's go.\"","With those words, she turned and led the way.","\"Where are we going?\"","\"To the hospital.\"","\"I don't want to go.\"","\"Really not going?\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Alright, then I'm leaving.\"","Zhou Jin watched as Shen Tang walked away without looking back.","\"Wait, are you really leaving!\"","Shen Tang glanced at her watch, \"Big brother, I have something to attend to.\"","Zhou Jin thought for a moment, then extended his hand to Shen Tang, \"Then help me to the hospital.\"","Seeing Shen Tang about to turn away, he hastily changed his tune, \"No, no, no, I'll go. I can manage on my own.\""]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: Do You Hate Me","paragraphs":["Shen Tang considerately slowed her pace, but she did not intend to support Zhou Jin.","Although the two got along quite well recently, Shen Tang did not forget how he had treated Lan Sister at first.","What's more, she felt Zhou Jin seemed to like her.","Of course, Zhou Jin had never said anything about it. This was just Shen Tang's feeling, probably her misconception.","There was a saying, one of the three biggest misconceptions in the world is suspecting that someone likes you.","It was not that Shen Tang was too narcissistic, but Zhou Jin texted her every day, seeming eager to share.","To be blunt, if it wasn't for Elder Sister Liang's face (and money), she would not even want to keep him on her contact list, let alone interact with him.","Zhou Jin wanted to sit in the passenger seat, but Shen Tang pressed her hand on the door, \"Sit in the back, please.\"","Zhou Jin jokingly said, \"What, is the passenger seat reserved for someone that I can't sit there?\"","\"Yes.\"","Zhou Jin almost couldn't maintain the smile on his face, not expecting that Shen Tang would really say that.","\"No way. It's just a passenger seat. Is he that petty?\" If it were me, I would never make it difficult for you like this.\"","His words sounded cheesy.","Shen Tang gave a light cough and said, \"It's not difficult. Just sit in the back.\"","Of course, she was just making up an excuse. Gu Huaian was not that kind of person.","Shen Tang thought again uncertainly, Gu Huaian shouldn't be that kind of person, right...","Zhou Jin pursed his lips unhappily and sat in the back.","On the way, he took the initiative to chat from time to time. However, Shen Tang only responded briefly. Anyone with eyes could see what was going on.","After a moment of silence, Zhou Jin asked, \"Shen Tang, do you dislike me?\"","Shen Tang looked at him through the rearview mirror, \"Huh? Why do you ask that?\"","\"I feel like you don't really want to talk to me.\"","\"I don't dislike you, but I don't like you either.\"","\"Why?\" Zhou Jin felt hurt.","He thought that after such a long time, they were at least friends.","Shen Tang smiled, \"Do you still remember when we first met?\"","Zhou Jin explained in a panic, \"Is it because of that time? I admit I spoke recklessly in anger at that time, which may have made you feel I'm not a good person. But that was because—\"","Shen Tang interrupted him, \"Zhou Jin, I don't think you understand what I mean. Lan Sister is my friend, so I felt it was very inappropriate how you treated her.\"","\"I can apologize to her!\"","Shen Tang's expression was indifferent, \"Then you need to tell her that, not me.\"","Although not the smartest, Zhou Jin understood something from Shen Tang's attitude.","For the first time, he somewhat regretted that he had been too unscrupulous in the past, relying on his powerful family background.","The car fell silent as neither of them spoke again. The atmosphere turned somewhat cold.","After a while, Zhou Jin asked in a low voice, \"...Do I still have a chance?\"","The words had two meanings, and both understood.","\"I'm sorry...\"","Zhou Jin's face turned pale in an instant. He trembled as he squeezed out a few words from his throat, \"I see, I disturbed you.\"","Seeing him leave unsteadily, Shen Tang couldn't help but reflect whether she had been too heartless.","However, she had always firmly rejected those who might like her, not leaving any chance.","Soon, they arrived at the hospital and the car stopped.","After getting out of the car, Zhou Jin barely curved his lips and asked, \"If we hadn't had that unpleasant first meeting, would I have had a chance?\"","Shen Tang could see Zhou Jin was about to cry.","Perhaps she should tell a kind lie to comfort him now, but Shen Tang didn't want to lie.","\"I'm sorry...\"","Zhou Jin's face turned white in an instant. He trembled as he squeezed out a few words from his throat, \"I see, I disturbed you.\"","Seeing him leave unsteadily, Shen Tang couldn't help but reflect whether she had been too heartless.","However, she had always firmly rejected those who might like her, not leaving any chance.","Soon, they arrived at the hospital and the car stopped.","After getting out of the car, Zhou Jin barely curved his lips and asked, \"If we hadn't had that unpleasant first meeting, would I have had a chance?\"","Shen Tang could see Zhou Jin was about to cry.","Perhaps she should tell a kind lie to comfort him now, but Shen Tang didn't want to lie.","\"I'm sorry...\"","Zhou Jin's face immediately turned pale. He trembled as he squeezed out, \"Alright, I bothered you.\"","Watching him leave shaking, Shen Tang couldn't help but reflect if she had been too merciless.","But she had always strictly rejected those who might like her, leaving them no chance.","Not until Zhou Jin entered the hospital did Shen Tang drive away.","On the way back, she felt a little heavy-hearted.","She didn't cheer up until seeing Tao Sister.","\"Tao Sister!\"","Tao Sister had been cracking melon seeds and watching TV shows. Hearing the voice, she spilled seeds all over the floor.","She rushed over to Shen Tang, held her hands and looked her up and down before speaking,","\"Oh my! Madam, you're finally back. You look...hmm, seem to have gained some weight...\"","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly.","She secretly pinched the flesh on her waist. It did seem she had gained some weight.","Staying at Shen Family these days, her aunt and uncle tried new ways to make delicious food for her every day. As a result, she had unintentionally put on some weight.","\"Ahem, Tao Sister, I missed you so much!\"","\"Yeah, you missed me so much that you only ate three meals a day.\"","Shen Tang grinned.","Tao Sister was the person she had known the longest since arriving in this world. She had a special feeling for her.","Shen Tang looked left and right, asking, \"Where is He Uncle? How come he's not home?\"","\"He went out for square dancing.\"","\"Square...dancing?\" No matter how Shen Tang thought about it, square dancing and He Uncle did not go together at all.","\"You also feel it's odd, right? Something fishy is going on!\"","After gossiping for a while, they heard the sound of a car from the yard.","Shen Tang went out to see, and it was indeed Gu Huaian.","\"Why did you get off work so early today?\"","\"I delegated part of my work so I can spend more time with you in the future.\"","\"You should have done this long ago. You are not made of iron. How can you work overtime every day?\"","Shen Tang didn't even want to mention that he handled work every day even when hospitalized. She really didn't know how he could be so busy.","Gu Huaian took out a small box from his pocket, \"This is for you, see if you like it.\"","When Shen Tang opened it, it was a necklace with pink diamonds that shone brightly.","Shen Tang fell in love with it instantly. \"What made you suddenly think of giving me this?\"","\"Seeing it, I felt it suited you very much so I bought it.\"","\"Let me help you put it on.\"","Shen Tang turned around and lowered her head slightly, revealing her fair neck.","Gu Huaian took a quick glance then withdrew his gaze, concentrating on putting on the necklace.","Feeling the cool sensation on her neck, Shen Tang took out her phone to take a photo. The necklace looked so beautiful.","\"Thank you, Gu Huaian. I love it.\"","\"As long as you like it.\"","Shen Tang's eyes glistened. \"Close your eyes. I also have a gift for you.\"","Gu Huaian obediently closed his eyes and the surroundings instantly quieted down. Even Shen Tang's voice disappeared.","He suddenly felt a little panicked.","Just as he was about to speak, a faint, sweet scent approached and something soft touched his lips.","Gu Huaian was stunned."]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Is There Anything You Don't Like","paragraphs":["Even though Shen Tang had kissed Gu Huaian many times before, she still wasn't quite adept at it.","She clumsily rolled over Gu Huaian's lips, unsure of how to get him to open up.","In the end, it was Gu Huaian who turned passivity into initiative, going on the offensive directly.","Shen Tang couldn't breathe properly, pushing him away a couple of times, and Gu Huaian felt like he had been punched in the chest twice.","He held onto Shen Tang's hand, his movements becoming more forceful.","\"Ugh—\"","Shen Tang was infuriated. This guy must be a dog, definitely a dog.","[\"Enough! Enough!\"]","[\"Gu Huaian, back off!\"]","[\"I can't breathe!\"]","[\"I know you can hear me, stop pretending you can't!\"]","However, Gu Huaian seemed oblivious to her inner thoughts, continuing to kiss passionately as if trying to make up for lost time.","Since their last disagreement, they hadn't shared a deep kiss until now.","[\"I'm counting to three!\"]","Gu Huaian paused, slowly lifting his head.","Looking at the glossy, flushed lips, his Adam's apple bobbed, his eyes becoming even deeper, like the starry sky and the vast sea, as if they could drown a person.","He murmured softly, \"Tang Tang...\"","Shen Tang glared at him fiercely, \"If you keep this up, there won't be a next time!\"","Joy flickered in Gu Huaian's eyes, \"So Tang Tang, does that mean there will be a next time?\"","Just then, Sister Tao cleared her throat, \"Madam, Sir, are you done kissing?\"","The question almost made Shen Tang want to dig a hole with her toes right there.","She had completely forgotten that Sister Tao was here.","No, Sister Tao, with the gap between your fingers, you've seen everything, haven't you?","Gu Huaian sighed, somewhat helpless, \"Sister Tao!\"","Sister Tao knew Shen Tang was shy; still, she asked.","Sister Tao lightly tapped her lips, \"Alright, I won't mention it next time.\"","\"Oh, by the way, I promised Anran and Wuyang that their variety show would be changed to a live broadcast. I wonder if they still want to participate.\"","\"I'll ask them tomorrow.\"","Shen Tang blinked, \"Can't we ask them tonight?\"","She wasn't used to postponing things until tomorrow. Wasn't Gu Huaian usually not like this? Was he busy tonight?","Gu Huaian explained, \"I want to spend tonight with you.\"","Shen Tang's face flushed. This guy...","Thinking that the other person could read her mind in real-time, Shen Tang forced herself not to think too much about it; that would be too embarrassing.","\"Ahem, we have time every day, why not ask for their opinions tonight? I miss them too.\"","If all the children in the world were as well-behaved as Anran and Wuyang, Shen Tang wouldn't mind having more children, even two more.","It was probably because of the lack of family affection that Shen Tang particularly wanted more people at home.","Just afraid of having a naughty child.","However, neither of them was unreasonable. They shouldn't have a naughty child... Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian skeptically.","Gu Huaian sighed, \"Tang Tang, stop overthinking.\"","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly, \"Okay?\"","\"Then I'll have someone bring them over.\"","\"Let's go pick them up together.\"","After speaking, Shen Tang looked at Tao Sister and affectionately wrapped her arm around hers, shaking it gently. \"Tao Sister, I'll trouble you to make two more dishes tonight.\"","\"What trouble? I'd love for you to come back and eat every day,\" Tao Sister replied.","This huge villa was empty every day, leaving her bored to death.","\"I want sweet and sour spare ribs, Coca-Cola chicken wings, and pineapple sweet and sour pork!\"","\"Okay, okay, I'll make them all for you!\" Tao Sister said with a big smile, her eyes squinting.","It had been a long time since Shen Tang visited the Gu family's old house. She wondered if the elders had noticed anything.","She felt a slight worry in her heart, but Gu Huaian held her hand reassuringly. \"Don't be afraid.\"","\"I won't be afraid if you take your hand back.\"","Seriously, who drives with one hand? She wasn't ready to die yet!","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He knew he was in the wrong; this was a bad example, definitely don't follow it.","Halfway there, Shen Tang suddenly realized she hadn't bought anything. Was it inappropriate to show up empty-handed?","Gu Huaian reached out, then withdrew his hand back to the steering wheel. \"Don't worry, they have everything.\"","\"Courtesy is courtesy. What they have is theirs, what I buy is mine. Besides, it's been a long time since I've been here, showing up empty-handed is indeed not great.\"","\"It's great that you're here.\"","What Gu Huaian didn't say was that his sister, Gu Qingan, had let slip about their agreement to get married, and now the family was afraid he wouldn't find a wife and would end up lonely.","Before long, they arrived at the Gu family's old house.","Shen Tang wondered if Tao Sister had secretly informed the people at the old house, as they were greeted by the steward as soon as they arrived.","Gu Huaian held Shen Tang's hand as they got out of the car.","\"Has Uncle He, Mom, and Dad rested?\" Gu Huaian asked.","\"Not yet, they're waiting for you,\" Uncle He replied.","Hearing this, Shen Tang immediately felt nervous.","She remembered how much Gu Huaian's father didn't like her.","She hadn't cared before because they were both pretending, but now that she was ready to spend her life with him, naturally she cared about what his family thought of her.","[What should I do?]","[Will he kick me out directly?]","[I'm so nervous...]","It could be said that Shen Tang's impression of Old Master Gu wasn't great.","Gu Huaian tightened his grip on her hand and whispered, \"Don't be afraid, I'm here.\"","\"I'm not afraid,\" Shen Tang said, forcing herself to speak.","Gu Huaian chuckled softly. If he hadn't heard her inner thoughts, he might have believed her.","As soon as they entered, they heard Old Master Gu snort.","Shen Tang paused for a moment and then walked in somewhat stiffly.","\"You decided to come back?\" Old Master Gu said.","\"Dad!\"","Old Madam Gu also glared at Old Master Gu. \"If you have nothing nice to say, then keep your mouth shut!\"","She stood up, smiling as she approached and took Shen Tang's hand. \"Good child, it's been so long since I've seen you. How have you been lately?\"","\"Pretty good.\"","\"I wanted to visit you before, but I was afraid it would be too forward. By the way, I saw some jewelry recently that I thought would suit you, so I bought them all. Come, let's go take a look.\"","Without waiting for Shen Tang to refuse, she pulled her upstairs.","The two of them arrived at the cloakroom on the second floor, which, in terms of size alone, was more than twice as large as Shen Tang's room in her previous life.","It was filled with various formal dresses, shoes, handbags, and jewelry, resembling an exhibition hall.","Why call it an exhibition hall?","Because all those pieces of jewelry were extremely expensive. Although Shen Tang didn't understand their value, just by looking at the size of those gemstones, she knew they were valuable.","Shen Tang almost couldn't help but gasp in awe.","Old Madam Gu led Shen Tang to one of the cabinets and took out a jewelry box containing various beautiful ornaments, sparkling under the light.","\"I'm getting old, and I don't know what you young folks like nowadays. Take a look and see if there's anything you don't like.\"","Shen Tang blinked in confusion. Normally, shouldn't she ask if there's anything she likes?","\"They're all pretty,\" Shen Tang spoke truthfully. They were indeed stunning.","\"Then take all of these.\"","Shen Tang froze once again. There were at least dozens of pieces of jewelry in the box. Were they all for her?","Old Madam Gu smiled and placed the box in Shen Tang's hands. \"Go on, take them.\"","\"They're too precious, I can't accept them!\"","Shen Tang felt as though they weighed a ton in her hands.","She couldn't shake off the feeling of unworthiness.","\"Good child, these are for you. They're not expensive, and besides, they'll only truly shine when worn by the right person.\"","Afraid that Shen Tang might refuse, Old Madam Gu changed the subject, \"By the way, you and Huai'an...\"","Shen Tang's heart skipped a beat."]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: Enticing you with money, of course.","paragraphs":["\"When are you and Huaian planning to have the wedding?\"","\"Ah, this...I'm not sure.\"","Shen Tang had imagined walking down the aisle with her beloved, but after transmigrating she had gotten married directly, skipping that step. She didn't know if she would have the chance to have a wedding in the future.","But knowing Huaian's personality, there probably would be one.","Old Madam Gu smiled. \"You're a good girl. I liked you from the first time I saw you.\" Her husband may have a sharp tongue, but he was actually quite satisfied with Shen Tang.","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly. She hadn't sensed that at all.","\"I'm getting older and don't know how long I'll live. I just hope that you and Huaian can be together well.\" In a marriage there were always bumps, but anything short of a serious transgression was forgivable.","Old Madam Gu blinked. \"Of course, doing something wrong warrants punishment. Like if Huaian's father annoys me, he has to sleep in the study and I confiscate his allowance.\"","Shen Tang was surprised she would share such private matters.","Moreover, her words hinted that she knew something.","\"We're doing fine...\"","Old Madam Gu didn't dwell on it. \"Have you considered having children?\"","Shen Tang suddenly tensed up.","Was this the legendary pressure to have kids? Fashionably late but still arriving?","\"Not yet...\"","\"Don't worry, we won't interfere with you two or pressure you to have kids. As long as you're safe and healthy, it's up to you whether to have children. It's not like our family has a throne to inherit.\"","This wasn't what Shen Tang had imagined at all.","She couldn't help thinking Old Madam Gu was quite open-minded.","Wanting grandkids was one thing; pressuring them was another.","Plus, the Gu family had plenty of money.","Better to desire money than not care at all.","\"We've already written up our wills. Aside from what Huaian and Qing'an inherit themselves, the Gu family assets will be split between you two and Qing'an's three children.\"","\"You're still young. Why talk about this?\"","Why? To tempt her with money, of course.","What if the daughter-in-law left? Her son had pined for so long before falling in love, she didn't want him dying alone.","That was what Old Madam Gu thought, though she didn't show it.","She didn't mind that Shen Tang cared about money. Everyone had their quirks!","Besides, who didn't like money? She wouldn't believe anyone was truly indifferent.","Especially since the Gu family was rich.","Wanting something was better than wanting nothing.","\"Are you hungry, dear? Do you want to stay over tonight?\"","Shen Tang felt awkward not knowing how to refuse. \"I, uh...\"","\"It's fine if it's not convenient today. You can come another day.\"","Shen Tang relaxed. \"Then I'll come see you in a couple days.\"","She had told Tao Sister to make dinner already and didn't want to waste her efforts.","And she looked forward to gossiping with Tao Sister tonight.","After talking, Shen Tang felt much closer to Old Madam Gu.","Old Madam Gu told many funny stories about Huaian's childhood and showed her lots of old photos too. Little Huaian was so cute it made Shen Tang want to have a child.","Of course that was just a thought; she had yet to learn to be a good mother.","Meanwhile, Old Master Gu and Huaian sat together silently downstairs.","After some time Old Master Gu couldn't bear it. \"Don't you have anything to say?\"","\"No.\"","\"Is that so!\"","\"I'm quite good, yes.\"","Old Master Gu: \"...\"","\"Do you even know how to speak properly?\"","\"But isn't this how you taught me? Every time you meet Tangtang you talk to her like this. I thought you liked it.\"","Old Master Gu: \"...\"","\"Now that you have a wife you've forgotten your father!\"","\"You don't want a daughter-in-law? I'll tell Mother.\"","Old Master Gu: \"...\"","Arguing further wouldn't benefit him, so Old Master Gu changed the subject. \"When are you going to have the wedding?\"","\"I thought you didn't like her. Why ask about it?\"","Old Master Gu looked disdainful. \"Could it be you still haven't won her back?\"","When Huaian didn't respond, he raised his chin in satisfaction. He had regained some ground.","But Huaian smiled. \"Who said that? We've reconciled.\"","\"Oh, then when's the wedding?\"","Huaian: \"...\"","Like father like son, poking at each other's weak spots.","Footsteps sounded. The two men stood up together and looked upstairs in unison.","Old Madam Gu and Shen Tang walked down hand in hand, chatting merrily.","Huaian discreetly relaxed.","He knew both had amiable personalities and wouldn't clash, but mother- and daughter-in-law relations were awkward, so he had still worried.","\"Mother is well, I trust?\"","\"She went to class. Did you need her for something?\"","\"I'll go pick her and Wuyang up from school and keep them overnight. I''ll bring them back tomorrow.\"","Old Master Gu wanted to say something but Old Madam Gu silenced him with a look.","She winked at Shen Tang. \"Remember what I said!\"","Shen Tang smiled and nodded.","In the car, Huaian still had to ask, \"What did Mother say to you?\"","\"Nothing much.\"","To avoid exposing anything, Shen Tang didn't even think it over in her mind. Instead she started listing dish names.","\"Steamed lamb, steamed bear paws, steamed deer tail, roasted duck, roasted squab, roasted gosling, braised pork, braised duck, soy sauce chicken, cured meat, steamed pork stomach...\"","Huaian: \"...\"","Who was it that had been too busy and still hadn't eaten?","Oh right, him."]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: Wait and see","paragraphs":["After the two received word that all was well, they returned to the villa.","Tao Sister had already prepared a big table full of dishes, extremely appetizing just to look at, Shen Tang felt hungry as soon as she saw them.","\"Wow, Tao Sister your cooking skills have gotten even better!\"","For people who love cooking, nothing makes them happier than getting compliments from others.","Tao Sister laughed happily as she scooped a big bowl of rice for Shen Tang, pressing down forcefully.","\"Enough, enough!\"","\"Not enough, this is just a bit more.\"","And so, with a crack, the bowl split open.","Tao Sister split open along with it.","What was up with this bowl?","Shen Tang chuckled, \"The quality of this bowl isn't good.\"","\"You're right.\"","Having found an excuse to step down, Tao Sister naturally took it.","After eating their fill, Gu Qingan finally arrived late.","\"Sorry I'm late.\"","\"Not late at all, sister have you eaten?\"","\"I've eaten, oh right, regarding that livestream you mentioned earlier, I don't care. They're both old enough to make their own decisions.\"","Shen Tang had to admit, she really admired Gu Qingan for being such an open-minded parent, not someone who insisted on controlling their child and forcing them to listen to their opinion.","\"In that case, Anran and Wuyang, do you two want to participate?\"","Gu Anran and Gu Wuyang looked at each other, then nodded eagerly in unison, saying in childish voices: \"We want to!\"","\"I've also told you about the potential situations that could occur, you two don't mind either?\"","Gu Anran shook her head, \"I don't mind, they can say whatever they want, the words come out of their mouths after all.\"","Gu Wuyang let out a slight humph like a little adult, \"Do you not have confidence in me? I will definitely become the most popular little kid!\"","Shen Tang gave a thumbs up, \"Not bad, very confident!\"","\"Then it's decided, you'll just stay here. The filming crew will come in a couple days.\"","Since they had watched previous episodes of the show, the two little ones actually knew quite a bit about how the show flowed, and were extremely excited right now.","\"Mom, I want to buy a pretty dress to wear!\" said Gu Anran.","Gu Wuyang wanted one too, but he didn't say anything, only looked over hopefully.","Gu Qingan waved her hand grandly, \"Buy them!\"","And so, Gu Qingan gave each of the three people a card, \"Here, spending money.\"","Shen Tang looked at hers in surprise, \"I get one too?\"","\"The little ones get them.\"","Gu Huaian gave a light cough, \"What about me?\"","\"You're a grown up, how can you brazenly ask like that?\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","\"I'm younger than you.\"","Gu Qingan rolled her eyes, \"Fine, I just don't want to give you one. I figured the esteemed President Gu wouldn't lack for that bit of money anyway.\"","\"I'm lacking.\"","Shen Tang and the two little ones almost burst out laughing watching this scene unfold.","Time quickly arrived at nighttime. For Gu Huaian there was one piece of good news and one piece of bad news.","The good news was that Shen Tang didn't return to the Shen house, but rather stayed here.","The bad news was that the two were still sleeping separately.","He had planned to sneak into bed at night, but unexpectedly there were two light bulbs Gu Anran and Gu Wuyang.","The four of them stared at each other, eye to eye.","Gu Huaian was the first to speak: \"What are you two doing here so late at night?\"","Don't you have your own rooms?","Gu Anran was confused, Gu Wuyang retorted: \"You aren't sleeping either! Sneaking in here, up to no good!\"","Gu Huaian felt a bit guilty, he really was up to no good.","But his acting skills had been honed to perfection, naturally a little kid like Gu Wuyang couldn't see through him.","Gu Huaian said: \"I came to find auntie about something I need to discuss.\"","\"What's so urgent that you have to talk about it in the middle of the night? Can't you talk about it tomorrow morning?\" Gu Wuyang said.","Shen Tang was struggling not to laugh.","She lightly cleared her throat and chimed in: \"He's right, just come talk tomorrow morning.\"","Gu Huaian had no choice but to leave.","The days flashed by in the blink of an eye, and finally the day arrived for the variety show filming.","Shen Tang and the two little ones had agreed beforehand to just act normally, so when the filming crew arrived, Shen Tang and company still weren't awake.","The filming crew really did come extra early in order to stir up trouble, arriving at 5am.","Most young people nowadays rarely get up that early if they have nothing urgent to do. Shen Tang was indeed still in dreamland.","Tao Sister welcomed the filming crew downstairs, and after waiting a while Shen Tang still hadn't come down, she was starting to feel embarrassed.","\"Um, do you want to drink some more water?\"","A crew member burped, \"No no, don't need more.\"","They'd already drank several glasses of water, and were even feeling like they needed the bathroom now.","There were already some people in the livestream, including Shen Tang fans, diligent antifans, and casual observers.","[Huh, what's going on here? Shen Tang still isn't up? Doing it on purpose right?]","[I'm not up yet either, pretty normal, it's so early!]","[Same here, not up yet, I'm still laying in bed watching the livestream. Feels pretty real, who's already up with makeup done at 5am?]","It wasn't until 8am that the three finally came downstairs.","At this point the crew had already eaten the breakfast Tao Sister made, the livestream viewers were even more bleary-eyed.","[Looks delicious]","[Do rich families eat such lavish breakfasts every day?]","[The congee in my hands suddenly doesn't seem appetizing, hard to swallow]","Shen Tang smiled and greeted, \"Good morning!\"","Anran and Wuyang were wearing matching outfits, standing together they looked just like a pair of toy dolls.","[Ahhh so cute so cute!]","[Heavens, the genes are too good!]","[Hehe, I wonder what color sacks they like...]","Next they started packing for the trip, taking a car to the meeting point.","Shen Tang didn't butt in for everything, but also didn't just lie there motionless, letting the kids do as they pleased.","Instead she selectively had the two little ones take action themselves, like packing their luggage, which could help them gain experience.","Things were going very smoothly on Shen Tang's end, the two little cuties attracted quite a few auntie fans.","The arrangements Gu Huaian made at the company were also nearing completion.","The office door was shoved open forcefully, Gu Rong charged in furiously.","\"Gu Huaian, just what have you done! Do you still see me, your second uncle!\"","Gu Huaian had his hands folded, \"Second uncle, what nonsense are you saying? What could I do?\"","Gu Rong was livid, pointing at Gu Huaian's nose and scolding: \"Humph, you haven't done anything? Then why are people investigating me?\"","If not for backing from his superiors, he would have been locked up by now.","Gu Huaian distastefully shifted back a bit, how unsanitary, the spit nearly sprayed on his face.","\"Then second uncle should ask himself what he has done. Our Gu family are all law-abiding good citizens, illegal things cannot be done!\"","Gu Rong nearly choked from anger.","He refused to believe Gu Huaian's hands were completely clean without a single wrongdoing.","Gu Rong let out a cold laugh, leaving a threatening remark: \"You speak so smoothly, but actions speak louder than empty words. You best not fall into my hands.\"","Gu Huaian smiled and nodded: \"Then I will...wait and see.\""]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: What a coincidence, I like you too.","paragraphs":["Due to bringing her child to participate in the variety show, Shen Tang became popular again.","She also gained the title of 'national sister', thanks to Anran and Wuyang always calling her sister.","Of course, Anran and Wuyang were also very popular. With super high looks and well-behaved and smart personalities, many people wanted to kidnap the kids.","Let's not talk about others. Even Shen Tang loved them very much.","She felt the urge to have a child again in her heart.","Since she already reconciled with Gu Huaian, Shen Tang moved some of her stuff back to the flat nearby the company and went between two places.","Shen's family didn't quite agree with Shen Tang being with Gu Huaian at the beginning, but they wanted Shen Tang to be happy even more.","So now, the one under the most pressure in the Shen family was Shen Yu. The whole family was counting on him to be better than the predecessor, and knock Gu Huaian down on the beach, to support Shen Tang.","Shen Yu: \"...\"","This was even harder than reaching heaven.","That day, Gu Huaian was still working late into the night.","The door was suddenly knocked.","Shen Tang peeked in and asked in a low voice, \"Gu Huaian, haven't you finished yet?\"","\"Almost there.\"","\"Um... I have something to talk to you about, but no rush. You can work first.\"","Afraid her mind would be revealed, Shen Tang tried to control herself from overthinking.","\"What is it?\" Gu Huaian said as he stood up.","Shen Tang quickly stopped him, \"No hurry, no hurry. Um... you can work first.\"","After saying that, she directly closed the door.","Shen Tang touched her extremely fast-beating heart, and lightly let out a breath.","Looks like the rabbit was forced into a corner and started biting people.","Regarding Gu Rong's counterattack, Gu Huaian was a little troubled but not panicked at all.","He had made preparations early on, enough to deal with all kinds of situations.","After giving instructions on the matters, Gu Huaian returned to the room and found the door wasn't locked.","He knocked lightly, \"Tangtang.\"","\"Yeah, come in.\"","Pushing the door open, the room was pitch dark.","Gu Huaian was about to turn on the light, when he heard Shen Tang say, \"Don't, don't turn on the light.\"","\"Tangtang, what's wrong?\"","\"Can you come over for a bit? Close the door!\"","Gu Huaian felt a little uneasy, very worried.","He walked over with big steps, and just as he was about to take a closer look, he was dragged down with great force.","His whole body fell onto the bed.","Then, he was fiercely hugged from behind.","\"Tangtang?\"","Gu Huaian's heart thumped like drums, and he couldn't help but start thinking randomly. What was the meaning of Tangtang doing this?","\"Stay overnight tonight.\"","Gu Huaian didn't expect such a good thing to happen, and they could finally embrace each other to sleep again!","He said in disbelief, \"Really?\"","\"Really. You've showered, right?\"","\"I did.\"","Shen Tang moved over a little, lifted the quilt, \"Get in quickly, it's so cold outside.\"","Gu Huaian felt something was off, but he was wearing pajamas anyway so didn't need to change clothes.","As soon as he got under the quilt, he was embraced from behind by Shen Tang. The intimate touch made Gu Huaian's brain short circuit completely.","The soft little hands made trouble on his chest, and Gu Huaian's breathing started becoming uneven.","He grabbed Shen Tang's hands in one go, and said in a hoarse voice, \"Don't make trouble.\"","\"What trouble am I causing?\"","\"Hehe, I'm just touching, not doing anything else.\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","This was on par with trashy words from scumbags.","If he didn't hear her inner thoughts, he would have really believed her!","He didn't know what to say either. Was Tangtang too trusting of him?","No matter what, he was still a man.","After a while, Gu Huaian conceded defeat and endured saying, \"Tangtang, don't touch anymore...\"","Shen Tang retracted her little hands that were up to no good on his abs, and turned to hug Gu Huaian's neck instead.","\"How can you endure so much?\"","Even now, he was still like a wooden man.","\"Tangtang, you...\"","\"Oh, I'm already like this. If you can't do it, then I'll hmm--\"","Gu Huaian wasn't a saint who could remain unmoved. Being treated like this by his beloved, he had wanted to lose control for a long time.","Moreover, a man couldn't say he couldn't do it!","Gu Huaian slowly lowered his head, starting from the forehead, along the cheeks, earlobes, neck, he gently kissed all the way down.","Shen Tang closed her eyes, letting herself go with the flow.","This was a feeling she had never experienced before, making her somewhat expectant and somewhat afraid.","Being able to hear Shen Tang's inner thoughts was like having supernatural assistance for Gu Huaian.","Right before conquering the city, Gu Huaian suddenly stopped, \"Tangtang, you--\"","He wanted to confirm once more, but Shen Tang directly pressed his head down, \"Don't talk!\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","...","No one knew when, but it started drizzling outside. Pitter patter. (Censor, it is really raining.)","There's a saying, one autumn rain one chill, ten autumn rains wear cotton pad. (Censor, this is an idiom!)","The air outside was extremely cold, while the room was hot and sweaty.","The sky gradually lit up, the moon set and sun rose, dispelling the darkness on earth. (Censor, this is really just scene description!)","Shen Tang lay in bed, her waist hurting badly.","She suddenly regretted a little, but come to think of it, Gu Huaian's skills didn't seem bad.","Cough, noticing her thoughts going astray, she quickly stopped thinking more.","She pushed Gu Huaian next to her, \"By the way, can you still hear my inner thoughts now?\"","Gu Huaian listened carefully and shook his head, \"Can't hear anymore.\"","\"What the master said was true!\" Shen Tang was so excited she almost leapt up, accidentally pulling something and hurriedly lying back down.","She looked at him resentfully, \"It's all your fault.\"","\"Yes yes, it's all my fault. You lie down, and I'll go buy medicine.\"","It was the first time without much preparation, in the end still injuring her. Gu Huaian felt very guilty.","\"No, I'm fine.\"","Just thinking about the scene of buying medicine made Shen Tang start wiggling her toes anxiously.","It would be too awkward.","Gu Huaian lightly kissed Shen Tang's forehead and said, \"Then you rest well, I'll go cook.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang's face was half buried in the quilt, and she started blushing as she thought back to the craziness last night.","Although it hurt, it wasn't to the point she couldn't get off bed.","She slowly wore her clothes and went to the kitchen, and found Gu Huaian cooking porridge.","Oh no, he was giggling to himself just now.","Shen Tang directly jumped onto his back.","Gu Huaian was given a shock, but he reacted very quickly to catch the person.","\"Does it not hurt anymore?\"","\"Not hurting.\"","\"Then wanna go again?\"","Gu Huaian said so as he carried her and walked.","Shen Tang quickly changed her words, \"No no no, it still hurts!\"","Although it felt pretty good, tiring was true as well.","Shen Tang hugged Gu Huaian's neck tightly, and directly put him in a choke hold.","\"Gu Huaian.\"","\"Yes.\"","\"I don't think I've said it before, but I really really like you...\"","She was truly so lucky to have met someone like this who only had eyes for her.","Gu Huaian didn't say anything, but moved Shen Tang on his back to his chest.","With foreheads touching, Gu Huaian chuckled and said, \"What a coincidence, I like you too.\"","End of story."]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: What are You Doing","paragraphs":["After Shen Tang and Gu Huaian broke through the last line of defense, the two became even more inseparable, and people around them could barely stand watching.","Now that the mind reading was lifted, Shen Tang became bolder and no longer shrank back like before, not daring to make a move.","Gu Huaian: \"???\"","Do you have some misunderstandings about yourself?","Although Shen Yu was a little annoyed by this brother-in-law who had taken his sister away, he couldn't resist the sheer amount he was given and found it hard to refuse under the massive financial offensive.","No no no, this is not a financial offensive at all, this is clearly favoritism!","Because he liked his sister, he also liked her little brother-in-law along with her.","That's right, that's how it is.","Seeing Gu Huaian treat her family this way, Shen Tang also felt very happy.","She put her arm around Gu Huaian's and leaned against him, \"Gu Huaian, I like you so much...\"","\"Mm.\"","Gu Huaian seemed to respond lightly, but his flushed ears gave him away.","Shen Tang thought he was just too cute like this.","She gave him a little peck on the face.","And then she discovered, not just the ears, his whole face had turned red.","She covered her mouth and giggled, \"No way, I just kissed you a little...\"","It's not like they haven't done more intimate things, how could Gu Huaian become even more shy than before?","Just as Shen Tang was about to say more, she was suddenly lifted into the air. Gu Huaian had picked her up, her legs wrapped around his waist as she clung tightly to his neck.","\"What are you doing?\"","\"Doing you.\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","No way, Gu Huaian you've turned bad!","Though she could only think this to herself, because her mouth was already covered.","After a spell of recklessness, Shen Tang lay in bed, extremely regretting why she had provoked Gu Huaian.","Watching him buttoning up his shirt next to the bed, Shen Tang pouted, \"Aren't you tired at all?\"","Gu Huaian leaned down and gave Shen Tang a light kiss on the lips, \"Is Tang Tang questioning my ability?\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Are men just blindly confident about themselves?","Especially regarding certain areas.","Perhaps the wounds have healed and the pain forgotten...oh no, the wounds haven't healed yet.","Shen Tang rolled her eyes and said, \"Actually I'm not tired either, I didn't feel anything at all.\"","Gu Huaian's hand paused while buttoning up, one brow raised as he asked, \"No feeling at all?\"","Shen Tang sensed the change in Gu Huaian's gaze, and had a bad premonition that if she didn't explain properly, the consequences would be disastrous.","\"Ow, ouch...my waist suddenly hurts a lot, I can't seem to get up...\"","Gu Huaian let out a soft chuckle, \"Tang Tang, wait for me tonight.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Oh no.","After Gu Huaian left, Shen Tang flipped herself up like a carp despite her sore waist. She tidied up simply and quickly, then drove back to the Shen house.","She played games in her room and took a nap for the afternoon.","Feeling hungry, Shen Tang slipped on her flip flops and went downstairs, only to see Gu Huaian chatting happily with her family.","She halted, why did this guy chase after her again?","\"Woken up from your sleep, Tang Tang?\"","Shen Tang scratched her head and sat down beside her auntie, \"Yeah, um...Gu Huaian, what are you doing here?\"","Her auntie glared at her, \"Tang Tang, is that how you talk to him?\"","Then all smiles again for Gu Huaian, \"Huaian, this is your home, you're welcome anytime.\"","\"Mm.\" Gu Huaian's lips curved up slightly, his gaze flashing a hint of smugness as he looked at Shen Tang.","Shen Tang was rather puzzled, weren't you guys very against Gu Huaian before? How come you're all so friendly now?","Gu Huaian glanced at his watch, \"Uncle, auntie, it's gotten late, I'll bring Tang Tang back first and come again tomorrow.\"","\"Alright, alright.\"","Shen Tang clung to her auntie's arm and shook her head, \"I'm not going back, I'll stay here for the night.\"","At the right moment, Gu Huaian's face revealed disappointment.","Auntie quickly said, \"Why don't you stay here too for the night, Huaian?\"","\"Is that...inconvenient?\"","\"Not at all, not at all.\" Auntie was all smiles again.","\"Very inconvenient!\"","But no one listened to Shen Tang at all.","\"Then thanks, auntie.\"","And so in the end, Gu Huaian stayed over.","As for how they spent the night, Shen Tang stated she didn't want to talk about it.","In any case, she would never ask for trouble again, wuwuwu......"]}]);
